  "item_desc_0_0": "* If you are reading this,&  I messed up somehow./%",
  "item_desc_1_0": "* \"Monster Candy\" - Heals 10 HP&* Has a distinct,^1 &  non-licorice flavor./%",
  "item_desc_2_0": "* \"Croquet Roll\" - Heals 15 HP&* Fried dough traditionally&  served with a mallet./%",
  "item_desc_3_0": "* \"Stick\" - Weapon AT 0&* Its bark is worse than&  its bite./%",
  "item_desc_4_0": "* \"Bandage\" - Heals 10 HP&* It has already been used&  several times./%",
  "item_desc_5_0": "* \"Rock Candy\" - Heals 1 HP&* Here is a recipe to make&  this at home:/",
  "item_desc_5_1": "* 1. Find a rock/%",
  "item_desc_6_0": "* \"Pumpkin Rings\" - Heals 8 HP&* A small pumpkin cooked&  like onion rings./%",
  "item_desc_7_0": "* \"Spider Donut\" - Heals 12 HP&* A donut made with Spider&  Cider in the batter./%",
  "item_desc_8_0": "* \"Stoic Onion\" - Heals 5 HP&* Even eating it raw^1, the&  tears just won't come./%",
  "item_desc_9_0": "* \"Ghost Fruit\" - Heals 16 HP&* If eaten^1, it will never&  pass to the other side./%",
  "item_desc_10_0": "* \"Spider Cider\" - Heals 24 HP&* Made with whole spiders^1,&  not just the juice./%",
  "item_desc_11_0": "* \"Butterscotch Pie\" - All HP&* Butterscotch-cinnamon&  pie^1, one slice./%",
  "item_desc_12_0": "* \"Faded Ribbon\" - Armor DF 3&* If you're cuter^1, monsters&  won't hit you as hard./%",
  "item_desc_13_0": "* \"Toy Knife\" - Weapon AT 3&* Made of plastic.&* A rarity nowadays./%",
  "item_desc_14_0": "* \"Tough Glove\" - Weapon AT 5&* A worn pink leather glove^1.&* For five-fingered folk./%",
  "item_desc_15_0": "* \"Manly Bandanna\" - Armor DF 7&* It has seen some wear.&* It has abs drawn on it./%",
  "item_desc_16_0": "* \"Snowman Piece\" - Heals 45 HP&* Please take this to the&  ends of the earth./%",
  "item_desc_17_0": "* \"Nice Cream\" - Heals 15 HP&* Instead of a joke,^1 the&  wrapper says something nice./%",
  "item_desc_18_0": "* \"Puppydough Icecream\"&* Heals 28 HP^1.&* Made by young pups./%",
  "item_desc_19_0": "* \"Bisicle\" - Heals 11 HP&* It's a two-pronged popsicle^1,&  so you can eat it twice./%",
  "item_desc_20_0": "* \"Unisicle\" - Heals 11 HP&* It's a SINGLE-pronged popsicle^1.&* Wait^1, that's just normal.../%",
  "item_desc_21_0": "* \"Cinnamon Bunny\" - Heals 22 HP&* A cinnamon roll in the shape&  of a bunny./%%",
  "item_desc_22_0": "* \"Temmie Flakes\" - Heals 2 HP&* It's just torn up pieces&  of colored construction paper./%%",
  "item_desc_23_0": "* \"Abandoned Quiche\" Heals 34 HP&* A psychologically damaged&  spinach egg pie./%%\"",
  "item_desc_24_0": "* \"Old Tutu\" - Armor DF 10&* Finally^1, a protective piece&  of armor./%%",
  "item_desc_25_0": "* \"Ballet Shoes\" - Wpn AT 7&* These used shoes make you&  feel incredibly dangerous./%%",
  "item_desc_26_0": "* \"Punch Card\" - Battle Item&* Use to make punching attacks&  stronger in one battle./",
  "item_desc_26_1": "* Use outside of battle to&  look at the card./%%",
  "item_desc_27_0": "* \"Annoying Dog\" - Dog&* A little white dog^1.&* It's fast asleep.../%%",
  "item_desc_28_0": "* \"Dog Salad\" - Heals ?? HP&* Recovers HP.&* (Hit Poodles.)/%%",
  "item_desc_29_0": "* \"Dog Residue\" - Dog Item&* Shiny trail left&  behind by a dog./%%",
  "item_desc_30_0": "* \"Dog Residue\" - Dog Item&* Dog-shaped husk shed&  from a dog's carapace./%%",
  "item_desc_31_0": "* \"Dog Residue\" - Dog Item&* Dirty dishes left&  unwashed by a dog./%%",
  "item_desc_32_0": "* \"Dog Residue\" - Dog Item&* Glowing crystals secreted&  by a dog./%%",
  "item_desc_33_0": "* \"Dog Residue\" - Dog Item&* Jigsaw puzzle left&  unfinished by a dog./%%",
  "item_desc_34_0": "* \"Dog Residue\" - Dog Item&* Web spun by a dog&  to ensnare prey./%%",
  "item_desc_35_0": "* \"Astronaut Food\" Heals 21 HP&* For feeding a pet&  astronaut./%%",
  "item_desc_36_0": "* \"Instant Noodles\" Heals HP&* Comes with everything you&  need for a quick meal!/%%",
  "item_desc_37_0": "* \"Crab Apple\" Heals 18 HP&* An aquatic fruit that&  resembles a crustacean./%%",
  "item_desc_38_0": "* \"Hot Dog...?\" Heals 20 HP&* The \"meat\" is made of something&  called a \"water sausage.\"/%%",
  "item_desc_39_0": "* \"Hot Cat\" Heals 21 HP&* Like a hot dog^1, but with&  little cat ears on the end./%%",
  "item_desc_40_0": "* \"Glamburger\" Heals 27 HP&* A hamburger made of edible&  glitter and sequins./%%",
  "item_desc_41_0": "* \"Sea Tea\" Heals 10 HP&* Made from glowing marshwater.&* Increases SPEED for one battle./%%",
  "item_desc_42_0": "* \"Starfait\" Heals 14 HP&* A sweet treat made of&  sparkling stars./%%",
  "item_desc_43_0": "* \"Legendary Hero\" Heals 40 HP&* Sandwich shaped like a sword.&* Increases ATTACK when eaten./%%",
  "item_desc_44_0": "* \"Cloudy Glasses\" - Armor DF 6&* Glasses marred with wear.&* Increases INV by 9./",
  "item_desc_44_1": "* (After you get hurt by an&  attack^1, you stay invulnerable&  for longer.)/%%",
  "item_desc_45_0": "* \"Torn Notebook\" - Weapon AT 2&* Contains illegible scrawls.&* Increases INV by 6./%",
  "item_desc_45_1": "* (After you get hurt by an&  attack^1, you stay invulnerable&  for longer.)/%%",
  "item_desc_46_0": "* \"Stained Apron\" - Armor DF 11&* Heals 1 HP every other&  turn./%",
  "item_desc_47_0": "* \"Burnt Pan\" - Weapon AT 10&* Damage is rather consistent.&* Consumable items heal 4 more HP./%",
  "item_desc_48_0": "* \"Cowboy Hat\" - Armor DF 12&* This battle-worn hat makes you&  want to grow a beard./",
  "item_desc_48_1": "* It also raises ATTACK by 5./%",
  "item_desc_49_0": "* \"Empty Gun\" - Weapon AT 12&* An antique revolver^1.&* It has no ammo./",
  "item_desc_49_1": "* Must be used precisely, or&  damage will be low./%",
  "item_desc_50_0": "* \"Heart Locket\" - Armor DF 15&* It says \"Best Friends Forever.\"/%",
  "item_desc_51_0": "* \"Worn Dagger\" - Weapon AT 15&* Perfect for cutting plants&  and vines./%",
  "item_desc_52_0": "* \"Real Knife\" - Weapon AT 99&* Here we are!/%",
  "item_desc_53_0": "* \"The Locket\" - Armor DF 99&* You can feel it beating./%",
  "item_desc_54_0": "* \"Bad Memory\" Hurts 1 HP&* ?????/%%",
  "item_desc_55_0": "* \"Dream\" Heals 12 HP&* The goal of \"Determination.\"/%%",
  "item_desc_56_0": "* \"Undyne's Letter\" - Unique&* Letter written for Dr.&  Alphys./%%",
  "item_desc_57_0": "* \"Undyne's Letter EX\" - Unique&* It has DON'T DROP IT&  written on it./%%",
  "item_desc_58_0": "* \"Popato Chisps\" Heals 13 HP&* Regular old popato chisps./%%",
  "item_desc_59_0": "* \"Junk Food\" Heals 17 HP&* Food that was probably&  once thrown away./%%",
  "item_desc_60_0": "* \"Mystery Key\" Unique&* It is too bent to fit on&  your keychain./%%",
  "item_desc_61_0": "* \"Face Steak\" Heals 60 HP&* Huge steak in the shape&  of Mettaton's face./",
  "item_desc_61_1": "* (You don't feel like it's&  made of real meat...)/%%",
  "item_desc_62_0": "* \"Hush Puppy\" Heals 65 HP&* This wonderful spell will stop&  a dog from casting magic./%%",
  "item_desc_63_0": "* \"Snail Pie\" - Heals Some HP&* An acquired taste./%%",
  "item_desc_64_0": "* \"temy armor\" - Armor DF 20&* The things you can do with&  a college education!/",
  "item_desc_64_1": "* Raises ATTACK when worn^1.&* Recovers HP every other turn^1.&* INV up slightly./%%",
