  "SCR_TEXT_1173": "* (Accept the bird's offer?)& &         Get ride    No        \\C ",
  "SCR_TEXT_1174": "  ",
  "SCR_TEXT_1177": "* (Umbrellas and birds...^1)&* (A bad combination.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1182": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1197": "* (It's a legendary artifact.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_1198": "* (Will you take it?)& &         Take it     Leave it  \\C ",
