  "SCR_TEXT_1225": "* (You're carrying too many&  dogs.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1229": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1237": "* (The fridge is filled with&  instant noodles and soda.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_1238": "* (Take a package of noodles?)& &         Take it     Leave it  \\C ",
  "SCR_TEXT_1239": " ",
