  "SCR_TEXT_2977": "* (There's a lonely sandwich&  inside.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_2983": "* (It's empty.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_2988": "%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_2993": "* this is a ghost sandwich.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_2994": "* do you want to try it...& &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_2995": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_3001": "* (You attempt to bite&  into the ghost sandwich.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3002": "* (You phase right through&  it...)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3003": "* oh.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3004": "* nevermind.../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3008": "* oh.....................&  ....................&  ................./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3014": "* after a great meal i like&  to lie on the ground and&  feel like garbage.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3015": "* it's a family tradition.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3016": "* do you want..^1.&* ... to join me...&         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_3017": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_3023": "* okay..^1.&* follow my lead.../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3028": "* oh.....................&  ....................&  ................./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3034": "* do you want to play a game^1?&* it's called thundersnail./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3035": "* the snails will race^1, and if&  the yellow snail wins^1, you&  win./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3036": "* it's 10G to play.& &         Play        No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_3037": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_3045": "* um..^1.&* you don't have any money?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3046": "* n-no^1, you can still play^1,&  don't worry about it.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3047": "* okay..^1.&* press \\*Z repeatedly to&  encourage your snail./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3048": "* ready?/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3052": "* um..^1. that's less than 10G./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3053": "* but since you're my only&  real customer^1, i guess i'll&  just take what you have.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3054": "* okay..^1.&* press \\*Z repeatedly to&  encourage your snail./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3055": "* ready?/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3061": "* okay..^1.&* press \\*Z repeatedly to&  encourage your snail./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3062": "* ready?/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3068": "* oh.........../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3073": "* .../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3074": "* Seven./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3075": "* Seven human souls./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3076": "* With the power of seven&  human souls^1, our king.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3077": "\\W* \\YKing \\RASGORE \\YDreemurr\\W.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3078": "* ... will become a god./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3079": "\\W* With that power^1, \\RASGORE\\W &  can finally shatter the&  barrier./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3080": "* He will finally take the&  surface back from humanity.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3081": "* And give them back the&  suffering and pain that&  we have endured./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3082": "* .../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3083": "* Understand^1, human?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3084": "* This is your only chance&  at redemption./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3085": "* Give up your soul.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3086": "* Or I'll tear it from&  your body./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3104": "* Yo^1, I know I'm not supposed&  to be here^1, but.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3105": "* I wanna ask you something./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3106": "* .../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3107": "* Man^1, I've never had to ask&  anyone this before.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3108": "* Umm.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3109": "* Yo..^1. You're human^1, right?&* Haha./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3110": "* Man^1! I knew it!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3111": "* ... well^1, I know it now^1,&  I mean.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3112": "* Undyne told me^1, um^1, \"stay&  away from that human.\"/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3113": "* So^1, like^1, ummm.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3114": "* I guess that makes us enemies&  or something./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3115": "* But I kinda stink at that^1,&  haha./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3116": "* Yo^1, say something mean so&  I can hate you?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3117": "* Please? & &         Yes         No \\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_3118": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_3124": "* Huh...?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3125": "* Yo^1, that's your idea of&  something mean?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3126": "* My sister says that to me&  ALL THE TIME!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3127": "* Guess I have to do it^1, haha./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3128": "* Yo^1, I..^1. I hate your guts./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3129": "* .../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3130": "* Man^1, I..^1. I'm such a turd./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3131": "* I'm..^1. I'm gonna go home&  now./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3135": "* Yo^1, what^1?&* So I have to do it?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3136": "* Here goes nothing.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3137": "* Yo^1, I..^1. I hate your guts./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3138": "* .../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3139": "* Man^1, I..^1. I'm such a turd./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3140": "* I'm..^1. I'm gonna go home&  now./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3148": "* (It's a water cooler.)&* (Take a cup of water?)&         Yes         No \\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_3149": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_3153": "* (There's no more water left&  in the cooler.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3155": "* (Sadistically^1, you've poured&  out all the water right in&  front of Undyne's eyes.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3163": "* (You take a cup of water.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3171": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3177": "* (Get rid of the water?)& &         Yes         No \\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_3178": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_3184": "* (You pour the water on&  the ground next to the&  water cooler.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3196": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3201": "* A rousing error./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3205": "* (Give Undyne the water?)& &         Yes         No \\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_3206": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_3210": "* (She looks dry...)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3215": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3238": "* Ring..\\E0./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3240": "HELLO^1!&THIS IS PAPYRUS!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3241": "REMEMBER WHEN&I ASKED YOU&ABOUT CLOTHES?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3242": "\\E3WELL^1, THE FRIEND&WHO WANTED TO&KNOW.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3243": "\\E0HER OPINION OF&YOU IS VERY.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3244": "\\E3MURDERY./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3245": "\\E0ERROR!!^1!&SEE YOU LATER!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3250": "\\E0BUT I BET YOU&KNEW THAT&ALREADY!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3251": "\\E3AND BECAUSE YOU&KNEW THAT.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3252": "\\E0I TOLD HER WHAT&YOU TOLD ME&YOU WERE WEARING!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3253": "A \\[1]!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3254": "BECAUSE I KNEW^1,&OF COURSE.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3255": "\\E3AFTER SUCH A&SUSPICIOUS&QUESTION.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3256": "\\E0YOU WOULD&OBVIOUSLY CHANGE&YOUR CLOTHES!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3257": "YOU'RE SUCH A&SMART COOKIE!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3258": "THIS WAY YOU'RE&SAFE AND I&DIDN'T LIE!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3259": "NO BETRAYAL&ANYWHERE!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3260": "BEING FRIENDS&WITH EVERYONE&IS EASY!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3261": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_3262": "* Click.../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3268": "\\E0WELL^1, WORRY&NOT DEAR HUMAN!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3269": "PAPYRUS WOULD&NEVER BETRAY YOU!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3270": "\\E3I AM NOT A&CRUEL PERSON./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3271": "\\E0I STRIVE TO BE&COMFORTING AND&PLEASANT./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3272": "PAPYRUS!&HE SMELLS LIKE&THE MOON./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3273": "SO, BECAUSE OF&MY INHERENT&GOODNESS.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3274": "I TOLD HER YOU&WERE NOT WEARING&A \\[1]!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3275": "\\E3EVEN THOUGH YOU&TOLD ME YOU&WERE!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3276": "INSTEAD^1, I MADE&SOMETHING UP!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3277": "I TOLD HER YOU&WERE WEARING.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3278": "\\E0A \\[2]./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3279": "\\E3IT PAINED ME TO&TELL SUCH A&BOLDFACED LIE./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3280": "I KNOW YOU WOULD&NEVER EVER WEAR&A \\[2]./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3281": "\\E0BUT YOUR SAFETY&IS MORE IMPORTANT&THAN FASHION./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3282": "\\E3DANG!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3283": "I JUST WANT TO&BE FRIENDS WITH&EVERYONE.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3284": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_3285": "* Click.../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3291": "\\E0WELL^1, WORRY&NOT DEAR HUMAN!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3292": "\\E3PAPYRUS WOULD&NEVER BETRAY YOU!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3293": "\\WY\\E0OU SAID YOU WERE\\Y &NOT WEARING A&\\[1]\\W./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3294": "\\E3SO OF COURSE&I ACTUALLY&TOLD HER.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3295": "\\E0YOU WERE&INDEED WEARING&A \\[1]!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3296": "\\E3IT PAINED ME TO&TELL SUCH A&BOLDFACED LIE./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3297": "BUT SINCE YOU&AREN'T WEARING&A \\[1]./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3298": "\\E0SHE SURELY&WON'T ATTACK&YOU!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3299": "NOW YOU ARE&SAFE AND SOUND./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3300": "\\E2WOWIE..^1.&THIS IS HARD./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3301": "I JUST WANT TO&BE EVERYBODY'S&FRIEND!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3302": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_3303": "* Click.../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3309": "\\E0BUT I BET YOU&KNEW THAT&ALREADY!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3310": "\\E3AND BECAUSE YOU&KNEW THAT.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3311": "\\E0I KNEW WHEN&YOU SAID:/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3312": "\\E3\"I AM NOT&WEARING A&\\[1].\"/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3313": "\\E0IT WAS REALLY&A SECRET CODE!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3314": "\\E3YOU REALLY&MEANT.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3315": "\\E0\"I ACTUALLY AM&WEARING&A \\[1]!\"/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3316": "YOU WERE TRYING&TO PROTECT&YOURSELF.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3317": "WHILE MAKING IT&SO I DIDN'T&HAVE TO LIE!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3318": "I PICKED UP ON&THIS, AND FOLLOWED&YOUR PLAN./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3319": "I TOLD HER YOU&WERE NOT WEARING&A \\[1]!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3320": "IN FACT I TOOK&IT ONE STEP&FURTHER!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3321": "\\E3I TOLD HER YOU&WERE PROBABLY.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3322": "\\E0WEARING A&\\[2]!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3323": "\\E3OF COURSE, YOU&WOULD NEVER&WEAR THAT./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3324": "\\E0BUT THAT'S THE&POINT!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3325": "SHE WON'T&RECOGNIZE YOU&NOW!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3326": "AND I DIDN'T&HAVE TO BETRAY&EITHER OF YOU!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3327": "SINCE I JUST&TOLD HER WHAT&YOU SAID!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3328": "WOWIE^1!&YOU'RE SUCH A&SMART COOKIE!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3329": "I REALLY CAN&BE FRIENDS WITH&EVERYONE!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3330": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_3331": "* Click.../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3337": "* Ring..\\E0./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3339": "HEY^1!&WHAT'S UP!?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3340": "I WAS JUST&THINKING.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3341": "YOU^1, ME^1, AND&UNDYNE SHOULD ALL&HANG OUT SOMETIME!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3342": "I THINK YOU&WOULD MAKE&GREAT PALS!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3343": "LET'S MEET UP&AT HER HOUSE&LATER!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3344": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_3345": "* Click.../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3348": "AFTER YOU HANG&OUT WITH ME.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3349": "LET'S MEET UP&AT HER HOUSE!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3350": "I THINK YOU&WOULD MAKE&GREAT PALS!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3351": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_3352": "* Click.../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3393": "* (It's a book labelled&  Monster History Part 7.)&         Read it     Do not\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_3394": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_3398": "* When a human dies^1, its&  soul remains stable&  outside the body./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3399": "* Meanwhile^1, a monster's soul&  disappears near-instantly&  upon death./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3400": "* This allows monsters to&  absorb the souls of&  humans.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3401": "* While it is extremely&  difficult for humans to&  absorb a monster's soul./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3402": "* This is why they feared us./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3403": "* Though monsters are weak^1,&  with enough human souls.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3404": "* They could easily destroy&  all of mankind./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3407": "* (You decide not to read it.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3413": "* (It's a book labelled&  Monster History Part 8.)&         Read it     Do not\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_3414": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_3418": "* There is one exception&  to the aforementioned&  rules:/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3419": "* A certain type of monster^1,&  the \"boss\" monster./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3420": "* Due to its life cycle^1, it&  possesses an incredibly&  strong soul for a monster./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3421": "* This soul can remain&  stable after death^1, if&  only for a few moments./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3424": "* (You decide not to read it.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3429": "* (All these books are labelled&  Human History.)&         Read one    Do not\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_3430": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_3434": "* (You look inside a book.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3435": "* (It's a comic of a giant&  robot fighting a beautiful&  alien princess.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3436": "* (This doesn't strike you&  as very accurate...)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3441": "* (You decide not to.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3446": "* (All these books are labelled&  Human History.)&         Read one    Do not\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_3447": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_3451": "* (You look inside a book.)&* (It's a comic book.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3452": "* (Two scantily-clad chefs are&  flinging energy pancakes&  at each other.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3453": "* (This doesn't strike you&  as very accurate...)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3458": "* (You decide not to.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3463": "* (All these books are labelled&  Human History.)&         Read one    Do not\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_3464": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_3469": "* (You look inside a book.)&* (It's a comic book.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3470": "* (A hideous android is running&  to school with toast in&  its mouth.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3471": "* (Seems like it's late.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3472": "* (This doesn't strike you&  as very accurate...)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3477": "* (You decide not to.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3482": "* (There's a piano here.^1)&* (Play it?)&         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_3483": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_3487": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3488": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_3495": "See that heart^1? &That is your SOUL^1,&the very culmination&of your being!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3496": "Your SOUL starts off&weak^1, but can grow&strong if you gain&a lot of LV./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3497": "What's LV stand for^1?&Why^1, LOVE^1, of course!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3498": "You want some&LOVE, don't you?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3499": "Don't worry,&I'll share some&with you!/%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3503": "Down here^1, LOVE is&shared through..^1./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3504": "Little white..^2.\\E1 &\"friendliness&pellets.\"/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3505": "\\E2Are you ready\\E0?/%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3509": "Move around^1!&Get as many as&you can^2!%%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3510": "%%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3514": "You idiot./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3515": "In this world^1, it's&kill or BE killed./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3516": "Why would ANYONE pass&up an opportunity&like this!?/%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3520": "Die./%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3524": "Hey buddy^1,&you missed them./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3525": "Let's try again^1,&okay?/%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3528": "Is this a joke^2?&Are you braindead^2?&RUN^2. INTO^2. THE^2.&BULLETS!!!",
  "SCR_TEXT_3531": "You know what's&going on here^1,&don't you?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3532": "You just wanted to&see me suffer./%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3535": "\\E1What a terrible&creature^1, torturing&such a poor^1,&innocent youth.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3536": "\\E2Ah, do not be&afraid^1, my child./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3537": "\\XI am \\BTORIEL\\X,&caretaker of&the \\RRUINS\\X./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3538": "I pass through this&place every day to&see if anyone has&fallen down./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3539": "You are the first&human to come here&in a long time./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3540": "I will do my best&to ensure your&protection during&your time here./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3541": "\\E2Come^2!&I will guide you&through the&catacombs./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3542": "%%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3548": "* Three gold for the ferry.& &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_3549": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_3553": "* Later^1, then./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3554": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_3559": "* Hop on!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3564": "* (It's a switch.)& &         Press it    Don't\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_3565": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_3571": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3584": "* (The lasers were deactivated.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3591": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3604": "* (The lasers were reactivated.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3612": "* Ring.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3613": "\\TS \\E3 \\F6 \\TA %",
  "SCR_TEXT_3614": "\\E1* Um.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3615": "\\E0* I noticed you've been&  kind of quiet.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3616": "\\W*\\E8 Are you w-worried&  about meeting \\RASGORE\\W...?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3617": "\\E2* .../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3618": "\\E0* W-well^1, don't worry^1,&  okay?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3619": "\\E7* Th-the king is a&  really nice guy.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3620": "\\E0* I'm sure you can&  talk to him^1, and.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3621": "* W-with your human&  soul^1, you can pass&  through the barrier!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3622": "* S-so no worrying^1, OK^1?&* J-just forget about it&  and smile./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3623": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_3624": "* Click.../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3630": "* hey buddy^1, what's up^1?&* wanna buy a hot dog?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3631": "* it's only 30G.& &  Yes         No \\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_3632": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_3638": "* here^1.&* have fun./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3641": "* here's another hot&  dog./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3642": "* it's on the house^1.&* well^1, no^1.&* it's on you./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3653": "* sorry^1, thirty is&  the limit on&  head-dogs./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3656": "\\TS*^1 \\Tsi'll be 'frank' with&  you./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3657": "* as much as i like&  putting hot dogs&  on your head.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3658": "* thirty is just&  an excessive number./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3659": "* twenty-nine^1, now&  that's fine^1, but&  thirty.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3660": "* does it look like&  my arms can reach&  that high?/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3687": "* thanks, kid^1.&* here's your hot dog./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3690": "* thanks, kid^1.&* here's your 'dog./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3691": "* yeah^1. 'dog^1.&* apostrophe-dog^1.&* it's short for hot-dog./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3695": "* another h'dog^1?&* here you go.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3696": "* whoops^1, i'm actually&  out of hot dogs./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3697": "* here^1, you can have&  a hot cat instead./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3701": "* another dog^1, coming&  right up.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3702": "* ... you really like&  hot animals^1, don't&  you?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3703": "* hey^1, i'm not judging./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3704": "* i'd be out of a job&  without folks like you./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3708": "* cool^1.&* here's that ''dog./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3709": "* apostrophe-apostrophe&  dog./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3710": "* it's short for&  apostrophe-dog./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3711": "* which is^1, in turn^1,&  short for.../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3715": "* another one^1?&* okay./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3716": "* careful^1.&* if you eat&  too many hot dogs.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3717": "* you'll probably get&  huge like me./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3718": "* huge as in super-&  popular^1, i mean./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3719": "* i'm practically&  a hot-dog tycoon now./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3725": "* whoops^1, you don't have&  enough cash./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3726": "* you should get a job^1.&* i've heard being a&  sentry pays well./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3729": "* you're holding too much^1.&* ... guess i'll just put&  it on your head./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3738": "* yeah^1, you've gotta&  save your money for&  college and spiders./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3743": "* Ring.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3744": "\\TS \\E3 \\F6 \\TA %",
  "SCR_TEXT_3745": "* L-looks like you&  beat him!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3746": "\\E0* Y-you did a really&  great job out there./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3747": " &  All thanks&  to you      ... \\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_3748": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_3754": "\\E3* What^1?&* Oh no^1, I mean.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3755": "\\E4* You were the one&  doing everything cool!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3756": "\\E0* I just wrote some&  silly programs for&  your phone./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3760": "\\E1* .../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3761": "\\E2* .../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3762": "\\E1* .../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3765": "\\E2* .../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3766": "\\E4* ... umm^1, h-hey^1, this&  might sound strange^1,&  but.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3767": "\\E6* ... c-can I tell&  you something?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3768": "\\E9* .../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3769": "\\E4* B-before I met you^1,&  I d-didn't really.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3770": "\\E9* I didn't really&  like myself very&  much./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3771": "* For a long time^1,&  I f-felt like a&   total screw-up./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3772": "\\E9* L-like I couldn't&  do a-anything&  w-without.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3773": "\\E9* W-without ending up&  letting everyone&  down./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3774": "\\E3* B-but...!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3775": "\\E4* Guiding you has&  made me feel.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3776": "\\E9* A lot better about&  myself./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3777": "\\E0* So... thanks for&  letting me help&  you./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3778": "\\E9* .../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3779": "\\E4* Uhhh^1, anyway^1, we're&  almost to the CORE./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3780": "\\E0* It's just past&  MTT Resort./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3781": "\\E6* Come on^1!&* Let's finish this!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3782": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_3783": "* Click.../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3787": "\\E0EUREKA!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3788": "I'VE FIGURED OUT&THE PUZZLE!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3789": "\\E3YOU SEEM LIKE&YOU'RE HAVING&FUN^1, THOUGH.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3790": "\\E0DO YOU ABSOLUTELY^1,&DAPSOLUTELY WANT&THE SOLUTION???/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3791": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_3792": "* (Do you absolutely^1,&  dapsolutely want the answer?)&         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_3793": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_3800": "THE^1!&SOLUTION^1!&IS!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3801": "(PLEASE IMAGINE&A DRUMROLL IN&YOUR HEAD)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3802": "... THAT TREE&OVER THERE HAS&A SWITCH ON IT!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3803": "CHECK IT&OUTIE!!!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3807": "WOW..^1.&YOU'RE TRULY A&PUZZLE PASSIONEER!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3808": "I'M SO ENTHUSED&BY YOUR&ENTHUSIASM!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3809": "YOU CAN DO IT^1,&HUMAN!!!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3814": "I'VE FIGURED OUT&THE PUZZLE!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3815": "\\E0DO YOU ABSOLUTELY^1,&DAPSOLUTELY WANT&THE SOLUTION???/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3816": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_3817": "* (Do you absolutely^1,&  dapsolutely want the answer?)&         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_3818": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_3825": "THE^1!&SOLUTION^1!&IS!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3826": "(PLEASE IMAGINE&A DRUMROLL IN&YOUR HEAD)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3827": "... THAT TREE&OVER THERE HAS&A SWITCH ON IT!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3828": "CHECK IT&OUTIE!!!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3832": "WOW..^1.&YOU'RE TRULY A&PUZZLE PASSIONEER!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3833": "I'M SO ENTHUSED&BY YOUR&ENTHUSIASM!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3834": "YOU CAN DO IT^1,&HUMAN!!!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3839": "* (There's a switch on the&  trunk of this tree.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3840": "* (Press it?)& &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_3841": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_3845": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3859": "OHO^1!&THE HUMAN ARRIVES!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3860": "ARE YOU READY TO&HANG OUT WITH&UNDYNE?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3861": "I HAVE A PLAN&TO MAKE YOU TWO&GREAT FRIENDS!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3862": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_3863": "* (Will you hang out?)& &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_3864": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_3872": "OKAY^1!&STAND BEHIND ME!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3878": "HMMM..^1.&STILL GETTING&READY?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3879": "\\E0TAKE YOUR TIME!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3884": "OKAY^1!&ALL READIED-UP&TO HANG OUT!?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3885": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_3886": "* (Will you hang out?)& &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_3887": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_3895": "OKAY^1!&STAND BEHIND ME!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3901": "TAKE YOUR TIME!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3910": "OKAY^1!&STAND BEHIND ME!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3916": "TAKE YOUR TIME!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3921": "\\E4* .../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3922": "\\E5* So why are YOU&  here?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3923": "\\E4* To rub your victory&  in my face?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3924": "\\E4* To humiliate me&  even further?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3925": "\\E1* IS THAT IT? & &  Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_3926": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_3932": "\\E2* Oh-ho-ho-ho./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3933": "\\E1* Well^1, I've got news&  for you^1, BRAT./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3934": "\\E2* You're on MY&  battlefield now./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3935": "\\E3* And you AREN'T&  going to&  humiliate me./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3936": "\\E3* I'll TELL you&  what's going to&  happen./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3937": "\\E0* We're going to&  hang out./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3938": "\\E2* We're going to&  have a good&  time./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3939": "\\M1* We're going to&  become \"friends.\"/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3940": "\\E3* You'll become so&  enamored with me.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3941": "\\E1* YOU'LL be the one&  feeling humiliated&  for your actions!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3942": "\\E6* Fuhuhuhuhu!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3943": "\\M2* It's the perfect&  revenge!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3944": "\\E1* Err.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3945": "\\E9* Why don't you&  have a seat?/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3951": "\\E4* Then why are you&  here?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3952": "\\E1* ...!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3953": "\\E2* Wait^1, I get it./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3954": "\\E3* You think that I'm&  gonna be friends&  with you^1, huh?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3955": "* Right???&              NEVER &  Yes         with you\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_3956": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_3963": "\\E6* Really^1?&* How delightful!^1!&* I accept!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3964": "* Let's all frolick&  in the fields&  of friendship!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3965": "\\E2* ...NOT!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3966": "\\E2* Why would I EVER&  be friends with&  YOU!?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3967": "\\E3* If you weren't my&  houseguest^1, I'd beat&  you up right now!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3968": "\\E0* You're the enemy&  of everyone's hopes&  and dreams!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3969": "\\E1* I WILL NEVER&  BE YOUR FRIEND./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3970": "\\E3* Now get out of&  my house!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3976": "\\E1* WHAT?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3977": "\\E4* First you parade&  into my house^1,&  then you INSULT me?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3978": "\\E2* You little BRAT^1!&* I have half a&  mind to.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3979": "\\E1* .../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3980": "\\E3* Wait./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3981": "\\E2* I'll prove you&  WRONG./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3982": "\\E3* We ARE going to&  be friends./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3983": "\\E1* In fact.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3984": "\\E3* We./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3985": "\\M1* Are going to be&  BESTIES./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3986": "* I'll make you like&  me so much.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3987": "\\E1* Your WHOLE LIFE&  will revolve around&  me!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3988": "\\M2* It's the perfect&  revenge!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3989": "\\E6* FUHUHUHUHU!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3990": "\\E1* Err.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_3991": "\\E9* Now^1, why don't&  you have a seat?/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3998": "* (Sit down and progress?)& &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_3999": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4003": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4010": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4011": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4016": "* That sugar's for&  the tea./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4017": "\\E2* I'm not gonna give&  you a cup of&  sugar!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4018": "\\E6* What do I look&  like^1, the ice-cream&  woman?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4019": "\\E2* Do human ice-cream&  women TERRORIZE HUMANITY&  with ENERGY SPEARS?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4020": "\\E3* Are their ice-cream&  songs a PRELUDE TO&  DESTRUCTION?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4021": "\\E1* IS THAT IT? & &  Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4022": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4028": "\\E1* ... what^1?&* REALLY?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4029": "\\E6* That rules!!!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4033": "\\E3* That's what I&  thought./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4038": "* Envision these&  vegetables as your&  greatest enemy!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4039": "\\E2* Now!^1!&* Pound them to dust&  with your fists!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4041": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_4042": "* (How will you pound?)& &         Strong      Wimpy\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4043": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4050": "* (You punch the vegetables&  at full force^1.&* You knock over a tomato.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4052": "* YEAH^1!&* YEAH!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4053": "\\E1* Our hearts are&  uniting against these&  healthy ingredients!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4054": "\\M2* NOW IT'S MY TURN!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4055": "* NGAHHH!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4060": "* (You pet the vegetables&  in an affectionate&  manner.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4062": "* OH MY GOD!!^1!&* STOP PETTING THE&  ENEMY!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4063": "\\M2* I'll show you&  how it's done!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4064": "* NGAHHH!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4071": "* ... we add the&  noodles!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4072": "\\E0* Homemade noodles&  are the best!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4073": "\\E6* BUT I JUST BUY&  STORE-BRAND!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4074": "\\M2* THEY'RE THE&  CHEAPEST!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4075": "\\E1* NGAHHHHHHHHH&  HHHHHHHHHH!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4076": "\\E9* Uhh^1, just put them&  in the pot./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4077": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_4078": "\\M0* (How will you put them in?)& &         Fiercely    Careful\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4079": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4086": "* (You throw everything into&  the pot as hard as you can^1,&  including the box.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4087": "* (It clanks against the&  empty bottom.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4089": "\\M2* YEAH!!^1!&* I'M INTO IT!!!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4094": "* (You place the noodles&  in one at a time.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4095": "* (They clank against the&  empty bottom.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4097": "* Nice???/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4103": "\\E0* Humans suck^1, but&  their history..^1.&* Kinda rules./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4104": "\\E2* Case in point^1:&* This giant sword!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4105": "\\E0* Historically^1, humans&  wielded swords up&  to 10x their size./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4106": "\\E1* RIGHT?& &  True        False\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4107": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4113": "\\E6* Heh^1, I knew it!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4114": "\\E2* When I first heard&  that^1, I immediately&  wanted one!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4115": "\\E0* So me and Alphys&  built a giant&  sword together./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4116": "\\E0* She figured out all&  the specs herself.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4117": "\\E6* She's smart^1, huh!?/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4121": "\\E2* Pfft^1!&* You liar!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4122": "\\E3* I've READ Alphys's&  human history book&  collection!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4123": "\\E3* I know all about&  your giant swords.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4124": "\\E3* Your colossal^1,&  alien-fighting&  robots.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4125": "* Your supernatural&  princesses.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4126": "\\E6* Heh^1! There's no&  way you're gonna&  fool me!!!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4131": "* (Look inside the bone drawer?)& &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4132": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4136": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4147": "\\M5* WHAT A SENSATIONAL OPPORTUNITY&  FOR A STORY!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4148": "\\M3* I CAN SEE THE HEADLINE NOW:/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4149": "\\M4* \"A DOG EXISTS SOMEWHERE.\"/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4150": "\\M2* FRANKLY^1, I'M BLOWN AWAY./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4151": "* (REPORT THIS ONE?)& &         Report      Look More\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4152": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4159": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4165": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4170": "\\M5* THIS DOG..^1.&* STILL EXISTS!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4171": "* THIS STORY..^1.&* JUST KEEPS GETTING&  BETTER AND BETTER!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4172": "\\M2* (REPORT THIS ONE?)& &         Report      Look More\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4173": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4179": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4185": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4191": "\\M5* OH MY!!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4192": "\\M2* ... IT'S A COMPLETELY&  NONDESCRIPT GLASS OF WATER./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4193": "\\M4* BUT ANYTHING CAN MAKE&  A GREAT STORY WITH ENOUGH&  SPIN!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4194": "\\M2* (REPORT THIS ONE?)& &         Report      Look More\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4195": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4201": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4207": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4214": "\\M3* I'M HONORED TO BE IN THE&  PRESENCE OF SUCH A HUGE&  LUKEWARM WATER FAN^1, FOLKS!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4215": "\\M2* (REPORT THIS ONE?)& &         Report      Look More\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4216": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4222": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4228": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4234": "\\M5* OH NO!!^1!&* THAT MOVIE SCRIPT!!^1!&* HOW'D??^1? THAT GET THERE???/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4235": "\\M4* IT'S A SUPER-JUICY SNEAK&  PREVIEW OF MY LATEST&  GUARANTEED-NOT-TO-BOMB FILM:/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4236": "\\M6* METTATON THE MOVIE XXVIII..^1.&  STARRING METTATON!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4237": "\\M1* I'VE HEARD THAT LIKE THE&  OTHER FILMS.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4238": "\\M1* IT CONSISTS MOSTLY OF A SINGLE&  FOUR-HOUR SHOT OF ROSE PETALS&  SHOWERING ON MY RECLINING BODY./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4239": "\\M5* OOH!!^1!&* BUT THAT'S!!^1!&* NOT CONFIRMED!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4240": "\\M5* YOU WOULDN'T (COUGH) SPOIL MY&  MOVIE FOR EVERYONE WITH A&  PROMOTIONAL STORY^1, WOULD YOU?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4241": "\\M2* (REPORT THIS ONE?)& &         Report      Look More\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4242": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4248": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4254": "\\M5* PHEW!!^1! THAT WAS CLOSE!^1!&* YOU ALMOST GAVE ME A BUNCH&  OF FREE ADVERTISEMENT!!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4255": "\\M2 %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4260": "\\M3* OH^1!&* YOU'RE BACK!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4261": "\\M6* THAT'S RIGHT^1, FOLKS^1!&* IT SEEMS NO ONE CAN RESIST&  THE ALLURE OF MY NEW FILM!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4262": "\\M2* (REPORT THIS ONE?)& &         Report      Look More\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4263": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4270": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4276": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4282": "\\M4* BASKETBALL'S A BLAST^1, ISN'T IT^1,&  DARLING?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4283": "\\M1* TOO BAD YOU CAN'T PLAY WITH&  THESE BALLS./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4284": "\\M4* THEY'RE MTT-BRAND FASHION&  BASKETBALLS^1.&* FOR WEARING^1, NOT PLAYING./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4285": "\\M6* YOU CAN'T GET RICH AND FAMOUS&  LIKE MOI WITHOUT BEAUTIFYING&  A FEW ORBS./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4286": "\\M2* (REPORT THIS ONE?)& &         Report      Look More\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4287": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4293": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4299": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4304": "* IT SEEMS OUR REPORTER IS DRAWN&  TO SPORTS LIKE MOTHS TO A&  FLAMING BASKETBALL HOOP./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4305": "\\M2* (REPORT THIS ONE?)& &         Report      Look More\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4306": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4312": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4318": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4326": "\\M5* OH MY^1! IT'S A PRESENT^1!&* AND IT'S ADDRESSED TO YOU^1,&  DARLING!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4327": "\\M6* AREN'T YOU JUST BURSTING&  WITH EXCITEMENT?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4328": "\\M5* WHAT COULD BE INSIDE^1?&* WELL^1, NO TIME LIKE THE&  \"PRESENT\" TO FIND OUT!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4329": "\\M2* (REPORT THIS ONE?)& &         Report      Look More\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4330": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4336": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4342": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4347": "\\M4* READY FOR YOUR..^1.&* PRESENTATION?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4348": "\\M4* (... LET'S CUT THAT ONE IN&  POST.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4349": "\\M2* (REPORT THIS ONE?)& &         Report      Look More\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4350": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4356": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4362": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4369": "\\M5* OOH LA LA^1!&* THIS VIDEO GAME YOU FOUND..^1.&* IS DYNAMITE!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4370": "\\M4* THOUGH I DON'T MAKE AN&  APPEARANCE IN IT UNTIL&  THREE-FOURTHS IN./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4371": "\\M3* BUT I LIKE THAT./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4372": "\\M6* APPEARING FROM THE HEAVENS LIKE&  MANNA^1, SLAKING THE AUDIENCE'S&  HUNGER FOR GORGEOUS ROBOTS.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4373": "\\M5* OOH^1!&* THAT'S METTATON!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4374": "\\M2* (REPORT THIS ONE?)& &         Report      Look More\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4375": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4381": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4387": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4392": "* AH^1, YOU UNDERSTAND./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4393": "* THIS IS A GAME WHERE YOU&  SHOULD CHECK EVERYTHING&  TWICE./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4394": "\\M2* (REPORT THIS ONE?)& &         Report      Look More\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4395": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4401": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4407": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4415": "* Buy a Spider Cider for 9999G?& &         Yes         No \\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4416": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4433": "* Some spiders crawled down&  and gave you a jug./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4434": "* You didn't have enough&  gold./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4436": "* You are carrying too&  many items./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4439": "*%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4447": "* Buy a Spider Donut for 9999G?& &         Yes         No \\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4448": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4465": "* Some spiders crawled down&  and gave you a donut./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4466": "* You didn't have enough&  gold./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4468": "* You are carrying too&  many items./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4471": "*%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4477": "* Ribbit^1, ribbit.&* (I have heard you are quite&  merciful^1, for a human...)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4478": "\\W* (Surely you know by now a&  monster wears a \\YYELLOW\\W name&  when you can \\YSPARE\\W it.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4479": "* (What do you think of that?)&         Very        It's&         Helpful     Bad\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4480": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4486": "* (It is rather helpful.^1)&* (Remember^1, sparing is just&  saying you won't fight.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4487": "* (Maybe one day^1, you'll&  have to do it even if&  their name isn't yellow.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4491": "* (Really^1? Then^1, I'll tell all&  of my friends to tell&  their friends' friends...)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4492": "* (Never use yellow names.)&* (How about that?)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4493": "         Keep        No more&         Yellow      Yellow&         Names       Names\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4494": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4501": "* (OK^1, they will still&  use yellow names.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4505": "* (OK^1, I will let them&  know not to use yellow&  names.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4511": "* Ribbit^1, ribbit^1.&* (How are you doing without&  yellow names?)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4512": "                     Bring &         It's        Them&         great       Back\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4513": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4519": "* (Glad to hear it.^1)&* (Though^1, I do not know why&  you dislike yellow.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4520": "* (You had better hope you do&  not encounter a banana-themed&  monster.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4524": "* (Huh^1? It's rather inconvenient&  that you changed your mind&  like this.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4525": "* (Since I told everyone&  not to use yellow names^1,&  everyone threw theirs out.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4526": "* (This is really troubling...^1)&* (Hmmm...)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4527": "\\W* (Well^1, last year it was&  fashionable to have \\ppink\\W &  names.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4528": "* (I think everyone still&  has those in their closets&  somewhere...)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4529": "* (I'll ask everyone to look.^1)&* (But this is the last time!)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4535": "* Ribbit^1, ribbit...&* (I hope you're satisfied.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4540": "* \\YNAPSTABLOOK22 has sent you&  a friend request.\\W /",
  "SCR_TEXT_4541": "* Accept the request?& &         Accept      Reject\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4542": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4547": "* (It seems to have already&  rejected itself...)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4588": "* hey^1.&* i heard you're going&  to the core./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4589": "\\E0* how about grabbing some&  dinner with me first?&  Yeah        I'm busy \\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4590": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4591": "* .../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4597": "* great^1, thanks for&  treating me./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4602": "* well^1, have fun in&  there./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4609": "* This is the barrier./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4610": "* This is what keeps&  us all trapped&  underground./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4611": "* .../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4612": "* If.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4613": "* If by chance you&  have any unfinished&  business.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4614": "* Please do what you&  must./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4615": " & &         Continue    Go Back\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4616": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4623": "* ..^2.&* ... I see.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4624": "* This is it^1, then./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4630": "* I see./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4631": "* Anything you want to&  do is important&  enough./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4632": "* Even something as small&  as reading a book^1,&  or taking a walk.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4633": "* Please take your time./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4639": "* Oh..^1.&* Back so soon?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4640": "* How are you feeling?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4641": " & &         Ready       Go Back\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4642": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4649": "* ..^2.&* ... I see.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4650": "* This is it^1, then./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4655": "* I see./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4656": "* Do what you have to./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4662": "* Tra la la^1.&* I am the riverman./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4663": "* Or am I the riverwoman...^1?&* It doesn't really matter./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4664": "* I love to ride in my boat^1.&* Would you care to join me?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4665": "* (Ride in the boat?)& &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4666": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4669": "* Tra la la^1.&* Care for a ride?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4670": "* (Ride in the boat?)& &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4671": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4678": "* Where will we go today?& &         Error       Error\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4680": "* Where will we go today?& &         Snowdin     Waterfall\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4682": "* Where will we go today?& &         Snowdin     Hotland\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4684": "* Where will we go today?& &         Waterfall   Hotland\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4686": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4691": "* Then perhaps another time^1.&* Or perhaps not^1.&* It doesn't really matter./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4713": "* Then we're off.../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4720": "* (There's a switch on the&  wall.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4721": "* (Press it?)& &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4722": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4725": "* (The switch doesn't do&  anything.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4729": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4743": "* (Seems like a comfortable&  bed.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4744": "* (Lie on it?)& &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4745": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4749": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4763": "* (It's just a regular suspicious&  bed now.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4767": "* (It's a yellow key.^1)&* (You put it on your&  keychain.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4772": "* (There's something under&  the sheets.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4773": "* (Check it out?)& &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4774": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4779": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4791": "* (The power has been turned&  on.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4794": "* (It seems like this controls&  the elevator's power.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4795": "* (Turn it on?)& &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4796": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4801": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4816": "\\E7* I always was a crybaby^1,&  wasn't I^1, \\[C]?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4817": "\\E1* .../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4818": "\\E2* ... I know./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4819": "\\E0* You're not actually&  \\[C], are you?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4820": "\\E7* \\[C]'s been gone for&  a long time./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4821": "* .../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4822": "\\E9* Um..^1. what.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4823": "\\E0* What IS your name?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4824": "\\E2* .../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4825": "\\E5* \"Frisk?\"/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4826": "\\E7* That's.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4827": "\\E5* A nice name./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4828": "* .../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4829": "\\E7* Frisk.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4830": "\\E0* I haven't felt like&  this for a long time./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4831": "\\E2* As a flower^1, I was&  soulless./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4832": "\\E1* I lacked the power to&  love other people./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4833": "\\E2* However^1, with everyone's&  souls inside me.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4834": "\\E7* I not only have my own&  compassion back.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4835": "\\E5* But I can feel every&  other monster's as&  well./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4836": "\\E7* They all care about&  each other so much./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4837": "\\E0* And..^1. they care about&  you too^1, Frisk./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4838": "* .../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4839": "\\E7* I wish I could tell&  you how everyone&  feels about you./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4840": "* Papyrus..^1. Sans..^1.&* Undyne..^1. Alphys.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4841": "\\E0* ... Toriel./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4842": "\\E7* Monsters are weird./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4843": "\\E5* Even though they barely&  know you.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4844": "\\E6* It feels like they&  all really love&  you./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4845": "\\E8* Haha./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4846": "* .../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4847": "\\E1* Frisk..^1. I..^1.&* I understand if you&  can't forgive me./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4848": "* I understand if you&  hate me./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4849": "* I acted so strange and&  horrible./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4850": "\\E3* I hurt you./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4851": "* I hurt so many people./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4852": "\\E1* Friends^1, family^1,&  bystanders.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4853": "\\E3* There's no excuse for&  what I've done./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4855": " & &  Forgive     Do not\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4856": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4862": "\\E3* Wh..^1. what?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4863": "\\E7* ... Frisk^1, come on./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4864": "\\E0* You're..^1.&* You're gonna make me&  cry again./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4865": "\\E7* ... besides^1, even if&  you do forgive me.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4869": "\\E2* ... right^1./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4870": "* I understand./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4871": "\\E1* I just hope that.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4872": "* I can make up for&  it a little right&  now./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4875": "\\E1* I can't keep these&  souls inside of me./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4876": "\\E0* The least I can do&  is return them./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4877": "\\E2* But first.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4878": "\\E4* There's something I&  have to do./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4879": "* Right now^1, I can feel&  everyone's hearts&  beating as one./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4880": "* They're all burning&  with the same&  desire./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4881": "* With everyone's power..^1.&* With everyone's&  determination.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4882": "* It's time for&  monsters.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4883": "* To finally go free./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4887": "\\E7* Frisk.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4888": "\\E0* I have to go now./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4889": "\\E7* Without the power of&  everyone's souls.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4890": "\\E1* I can't keep&  maintaining this&  form./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4891": "* In a little while.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4892": "* I'll turn back into&  a flower./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4893": "\\E3* I'll stop being&  \"myself.\"/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4894": "* I'll stop being able&  to feel love again./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4895": "\\E1* So..^1. Frisk./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4896": "\\E7* It's best if you&  just forget about&  me^1, OK?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4897": "\\E0* Just go be with&  the people who&  love you./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4898": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_4899": " &         Comfort&         him         Do not\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4900": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4919": "\\E0* So^1, Alphys.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4920": "\\E9* What do you want&  to do now that&  we're all free?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4921": "\\E0* We have the whole&  world to explore&  now./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4923": "\\E3* W-well^1, of course&  I'm going to go&  out and.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4924": "\\E4* Um.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4925": "\\E3* No^1, I should be&  honest!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4926": "\\E1* I'm gonna stay inside&  and watch anime like&  a total loser!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4928": "\\E0THAT'S THE SPIRIT!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4929": "EVERYONE!!^1!&A CELEBRATION!!!&TO BEING LOSERS!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4931": "\\E9* Heh^1.&* Papyrus has the&  right idea./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4932": "\\E0* Losing to Frisk is&  the best thing to&  ever happen to me./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4933": "\\E0* So I'm glad that&  we.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4934": "\\E9* Huh^1?&* What is it^1, Asgore?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4936": "\\E2* Um..^1. what's an.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4937": "\\E0* ... anime?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4939": "\\E1* (Oh My God?)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4940": "\\E3* (Frisk^1. Please.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4941": "\\E2* (Help me explain what&  anime is to Asgore.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4942": "\\E0* Y-you see^1, it's&  like a cartoon^1,&  but.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4943": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_4944": " &         With        With&         Sword's     Gun's\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4945": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4950": "\\E2* So it's like a&  cartoon..^1.&* But with swords?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4952": "\\E2* So it's like a&  cartoon..^1.&* But with guns?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4953": "\\E0* Golly^1!&* That sounds neato!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4954": "\\E3* Where is this^1?&* Where can I see the&  Anime./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4956": "\\E3* H-hold on^1, uh..^1.&* I think I have&  some on my phone./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4957": "\\E0* Here^1, l-look at&  this!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4958": "\\E0* .../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4959": "\\E3*...Oh^1, uh.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4960": "\\E4* Um..^1. that's the..^1.&* That's the wrong.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4961": "\\E5* Uh^1, nevermind./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4963": "* Golly^1.&* Were those two robots.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4965": "\\E9* ... kissing?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4967": "\\E0* Boy^1!&* Technology sure is&  something^1, isn't it?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4969": "\\E5* Eheheh..^1. yeah^1!&* It sure is!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4973": "\\E0* Psst..^1.&* F-Frisk./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4974": "\\E3* Um^1, you've gotta&  tell me./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4975": "\\E6* D..^1. do you think&  Asgore and Toriel&  are...?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4976": "\\E3* Uh^1, ever gonna get&  back together?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_4977": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_4978": "& &         Yeah        Nope\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4979": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4983": "* Error.../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4987": "\\E7* Y-yeah!!^1!&* Yeah^1, that's what&  I hope^1, too./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4988": "\\E7* Just think about how&  cute they must have&  been together./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4989": "\\E0* It's quickly becoming&  my number one ship&  of all time./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4990": "\\E7* Tori and Gorey.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_4991": "\\E5* My..^1.&* My old boss and&  his ex-wife./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4992": "\\E8* ... uh^1, that sounds&  a lot less cool&  all of a sudden./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4998": "\\E8* ... yeah^1, that's what&  I thought./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4999": "\\E7* A woman can dream&  though^1, right?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5000": "\\E2* And write fanfiction./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5001": "\\E1* A LOT of fanfiction./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5007": "\\E0* Frisk^1!&* I just realized!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5008": "\\E3* Now that we aren't&  fighting each&  other.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_5009": "\\E2* I can finally ask&  you.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_5010": "\\E0* \"Would you like a&  cup of tea?\"/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5011": "\\E2* .../",
  "SCR_TEXT_5012": "\\E0* Would you like a&  cup of tea?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5013": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_5014": "& &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5015": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_5019": "* Error.../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5023": "* Oh^1!&* Well!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5024": "\\E3* Actually^1, the cup I&  had is cold now./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5025": "* So you shouldn't&  have it./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5026": "\\E0* But^1, I am so&  happy you said&  yes./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5027": "\\E0* As soon as I can^1,&  I will make some&  more for you./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5028": "\\E0* Then we can be&  great pals./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5034": "\\E3* Oh.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_5035": "\\E3* Okay./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5037": "\\E2* Frisk^1! Stop^1!&* You're breaking his&  big burly heart!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5039": "\\E2* Um^1, it's OK^1, Undyne./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5040": "\\E0* My heart's already&  broken./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5042": "\\E6* ASGORE^1! STOP^1!&* YOU'RE BREAKING MY&  BIG BURLY HEART!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5044": "\\E9* Y-yeah^1, Asgore^1.&* Don't break Undyne's&  heart./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5045": "\\E2* That's my job./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5047": "\\E2* OH MY GOD!&* YOU'RE GOING BACK&  IN THE TRASH!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5049": "\\E0CAN I GO IN THE&TRASH TOO?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5051": "\\E9* Sure^1, Papyrus./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5053": "\\E1* guess i have to&  go in the trash&  too./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5055": "\\E0* Oh^1, may I enter&  the trash as well?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5057": "\\E1* Uh^1, okay?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5059": "\\E0* Am I invited to&  the trash?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5061": "\\E6* SURE!!!&* WHY NOT!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5063": "\\E1* On second thought^1,&  do not put me&  in the trash./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5065": "\\E5* Oh.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_5067": "\\E1* OH MY GOD!!!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5073": "* (If you leave here^1, your&  adventure will really&  be over.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5074": "* (Your friends will follow&  you out of the underground.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5075": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_5076": " &         Don't       I'm&         leave       ready\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5077": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_5081": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5095": "\\E0* Oh my.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_5097": "\\E0* Isn't it beautiful^1,&  everyone?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5099": "\\E3* Wow..^1. it's e-even&  better than on TV./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5100": "\\E7* WAY better^1!&* Better than I ever&  imagined!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5102": "\\E1* Frisk^1, you LIVE with&  this!?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5103": "\\E9* The sunlight is so&  nice..^1. and the air&  is so fresh!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5104": "* I really feel alive!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5106": "\\E0HEY SANS.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_5107": "\\E3WHAT'S THAT GIANT&BALL?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5109": "\\E1* we call that&  \"the sun^1,\" my friend./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5111": "\\E0THAT'S THE SUN!^1?&WOWIE!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5112": "I CAN'T BELIEVE&I'M FINALLY MEETING&THE SUN!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5114": "\\E0* I could stand here&  and watch this for&  hours.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_5116": "\\E0* Yes^1, it is beautiful^1,&  is it not?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5117": "\\E1* But we should really&  think about what comes&  next./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5119": "\\E3* Oh^1, right./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5120": "\\E0* Everyone.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_5121": "* This is the beginning&  of a bright new&  future./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5122": "* An era of peace between&  humans and monsters./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5123": "\\E2* Frisk.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_5124": "* I have something to&  ask of you./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5125": "\\E0* Will you act as our&  ambassador to the&  humans?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5126": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_5127": "* (Be the ambassador?)& &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5128": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_5133": "WOWi, Nice error./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5136": "\\E0YEAH^1!&FRISK WILL BE THE&BEST AMBASSADOR!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5137": "AND I^1, THE GREAT&PAPYRUS.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_5138": "WILL BE THE BEST&MASCOT!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5139": "I'LL GO MAKE A&GOOD FIRST&IMPRESSION!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5143": "\\E0IT'S OK FRISK^1!&I'VE GOT YOU&COVERED!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5144": "IF YOU DON'T WANT&TO BE THE&AMBASSADOR.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_5145": "I CAN DO IT FOR&YOU!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5146": "I'LL GO MAKE A&GOOD FIRST&IMPRESSION!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5151": "* Frisk.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_5152": "\\E2* You came from this&  world^1, right...?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5153": "\\E1* So you must have&  a place to return to^1,&  do you not?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5154": "\\E2* What will you do&  now?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5155": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_5156": "         I want      I have&         to stay     places&         with you    to go\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5157": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_5161": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5182": "* (The door has no mail slot.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5183": "* (Slide the letter under?)& &         Slide       NO!!!! \\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5184": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_5197": "* (You slide the letter under&  the door and give it a&  knock.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5206": "* (You'll keep the letter&  warm for a little longer.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5212": "* (It's a note from Alphys.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5213": "* (Read it...?)& &         Read        Do not \\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5214": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_5220": "* (It's hard to read because&  of the handwriting^1, but&  you try your best...)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5221": "* Hey./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5222": "* Thanks for your help back&  there./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5223": "* You guys..^1.&* Your support really means a&  lot to me./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5224": "* But..^1.&* As difficult as it is&  to say this.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_5225": "* You guys alone can't&  magically make my own&  problems go away./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5226": "* I want to be a better&  person./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5227": "* I don't want to be&  afraid anymore./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5228": "* And for that to happen^1,&  I have to be able to&  face my own mistakes./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5229": "* I'm going to start&  doing that now./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5230": "* I want to be clear./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5231": "* This isn't anyone else's&  problem but mine./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5232": "* But if you don't ever&  hear from me again.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_5233": "* If you want to know&  \"the truth.\"/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5234": "* Enter the door to the&  north of this note./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5235": "* You all at least deserve&  to know what I did./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5236": "* (That's all she wrote.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5240": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5250": "* (Buy chips for 25G?)& &         Buy         No \\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5251": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_5255": "* (There were no chips left&  in the machine.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5256": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_5274": "* (The vending machine&  dispensed some chisps.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5275": "* (You didn't have enough&  gold.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5277": "* (You are carrying too&  many items.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5280": "*%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5285": "* Ring..\\E0.\\TT /",
  "SCR_TEXT_5286": "\\F1 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_5290": "* Hello?&* This is TORIEL./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5291": "* For no reason in&  particular...&* Which do you prefer?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5292": "* Cinnamon or&  butterscotch?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5293": "\\E1* ... wait^1.&* Do not tell me./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5294": "\\E0* It is ERROR MESSAGE!& &  Yes         No      \\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5295": "\\E0* Is it Butterscotch?& &  Yes         No      \\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5296": "\\E0* Is it Cinnamon?& &  Yes         No      \\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5297": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_5309": "\\E0* Hee hee hee^1.&* I had a feeling./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5310": "\\E1* When humans fall down&  here^1, strangely..^1.&* I.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_5311": "\\E1* I often feel like&  I already know them./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5312": "\\E0* Truthfully^1, when I first&  saw you^1, I felt.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_5313": "\\E1* ... like I was seeing&  an old friend for&  the first time./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5314": "\\E0* Strange^1, is it not?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5315": "* Well^1, thank you for&  your selection./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5316": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_5317": "* Click.../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5323": "\\E1* Oh..^1. I see./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5324": "\\E0* Well^1, thank you^1.&* Goodbye for now./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5325": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_5326": "* Click.../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5337": "* (Seems like you could skip&  Mettaton's monologue by&  turning him around now.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5338": "* (What will you do?)& &         Skip        Hear again\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5339": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_5345": "* (You told Mettaton there&  was something cool&  behind him.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5353": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5359": "* though.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_5360": "* one thing about you&  always struck me&  as kinda odd./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5361": "* now^1, i understand&  acting in self-defense./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5362": "* you were thrown into&  those situations&  against your will./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5363": "* but.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_5364": "* sometimes.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_5365": "* you act like you&  know what's gonna&  happen./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5366": "* like you've already&  experienced it all&  before./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5367": "* this is an odd thing&  to say^1, but.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_5368": "\\W* if you have some sort&  of \\Yspecial power\\W.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_5369": "* isn't it your&  responsibility to do&  the right thing?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5370": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_5371": " & &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5372": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_5379": "\\E1* ah./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5380": "\\E0* i see./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5381": "\\E3* .../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5390": "\\E1* heh./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5391": "\\E0* well^1, that's your&  viewpoint./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5392": "\\E2* i won't judge you&  for it./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5393": "\\E3* .../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5402": "* (Ring...)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5404": "\\E0* Hey!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5405": "\\E3* This um^1, doesn't have&  anything to do with&  guiding you..^1. but.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_5406": "\\E2* .../",
  "SCR_TEXT_5407": "\\E6* Uhh^1, hey^1, would you want&  to watch a human TV&  show together???/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5408": "* Sometime???/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5409": "\\E4* It's called^1, um^1,&  M..^1.Mew Mew Kissy&  Cutie.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_5410": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_5411": " & &         Sure!       ...no...\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5412": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_5420": "* R-really!?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5421": "\\E3* It's so good^1!&* It's um^1, my favorite&  show!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5422": "* It's all about this&  human girl named Mew Mew&  who has cat ears!%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5423": "\\E3* Which humans don't have!&* S-so she's all&  sensitive about them!%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5424": "\\E6* But like...&* Eventually!%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5425": "* She realizes that her&  ears don't matter!%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5426": "* That her friends like&  her despite the ears!%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5427": "\\E7* It's really moving!%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5428": "\\E5* Whoops, spoilers%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5429": "\\E6* Also, this sounds&  weird, but she has&  the power!%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5430": "\\E5* To control the minds&  of anyone she kisses!%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5431": "\\E3* She kisses people and&  controls them to fix&  her problems!!%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5432": "\\E5* They don't remember&  anything after the&  kiss I mean!!%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5433": "\\E3* BUT IF SHE MISSES&  THE KISS!!!&* THEN!!%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5434": "\\E4* Then^1, uh^1, and^1, uh^1,&  also I mean^1, of course%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5435": "\\E5* Eventually^1, she&  realizes that&  controlling people%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5436": "\\E3* OKAY WELL I almost&  spoiled the whole&  show^1, but%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5437": "\\E5* Uhhh^1, I think you'd&  really like it!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5438": "\\E0* We should watch it^1!&* After you get through&  all this!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5439": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_5440": "* (Click...)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5445": "\\E5* Um^1! Well^1!&* That's okay!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5446": "* Just thought I'd!^1!&* Ask!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5447": "\\E6* B-but I think you'd&  really like it!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5448": "* If you gave it a&  chance!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5449": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "SCR_TEXT_5450": "* (Click...)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5455": "\\M1* Did y'hear!^1?&* You're back!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5456": "\\M0* I'll tell you a big secret./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5457": "\\M1* I'm starting a band^1, y'hear?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5458": "\\M1* It's called the Red Hot&  Chibi Peppers./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5459": "\\M0* All I've thought of is&  the name./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5460": "\\M3* And I don't^1, play...&* Instruments^1, or sing./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5461": "\\M1* Well^1!&* Do you think we'll be&  popular!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5462": " & &         Yeah        No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5463": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_5471": "\\M0* Yeah^1, me too.../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5477": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5485": "* (It's a lamp.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5486": "* (Turn it on?)& &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5487": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_5493": "* (There's no lightbulb.^1)&* (A flashlight is stuck in&  the bulb socket.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5494": "* (Turn it on?)& &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5495": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_5499": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5506": "* (The flashlight is out of&  batteries.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5510": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5517": "* Hey^1, hey^1!&* Did you remember my name?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5518": "* (Did you?)& &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5519": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_5527": "* Wh-WHAT!^1?&* You REMEMBER!?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5528": "* How could I be so easily&  defeateeeeeeeeed!?/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5533": "* Wh-WHAT!^1?&* You DON'T REMEMBER!?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5534": "* How could I be so easily&  defeateeeeeeeeed!?/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5541": "* (It's a small white dog.^1)&* (It's fast asleep...)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5542": "* (Fight the dog?)& &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5543": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_5550": "* (Can't fight the dog.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5551": "* (Seems like the fabric it's&  sleeping on has too many&  holes in it.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5552": "* (Seems like the dog needs&  to \"patch\" the fabric.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5553": "* (Then you can fight the dog.^1)&* (... maybe.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5554": "* (Upon closer examination^1,&  the holes in the fabric&  seem to be growing.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5555": "* (Might take a while for the&  dog to fix all of them.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5556": "* (Dogs aren't usually very&  good at knitting.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5557": "* (A crocheting dog is out of&  the question.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5561": "* (Let sleeping dogs lie^1, instead&  of fighting them.^1)&* (That's how the saying goes.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5566": "* (Knock knock)./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5569": "* Oooooaaah ^1!&* Room service !/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5570": "* Got my \"Sea Tea\" ?& &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5571": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_5575": "* Room service never came ^1.&* (Sigh ...)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5581": "* Thanks a million ./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5585": "* (No response.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5598": "* (You pour the Sea Tea under&  the door.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5599": "* HUH !?!?!?!^2?&* That's just the way I want ^1!&* Here's a tip ./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5600": "* (You got 99G.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5604": "* ..^1.&* No you don't ./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5609": "* Then ...!?/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5614": "* (Knock knock)./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5617": "* Oooooaaah ^1!&* Room service !/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5618": "* Got my \"Cinnamon Bun\" ?& &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5619": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_5623": "* Room service never came ^1.&* (Sigh ...)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5628": "* Thanks a trillion ./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5632": "* (No response.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5646": "* (You flatten the Cinnamon Bun&  until it's paper thin.)&* (You slide it under the door.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5647": "* HUH !?!?!?!^2?&* That's just the way I want ^1!&* Here's a tip ./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5648": "* (You got 99G.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5652": "* ..^1.&* No you don't ./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5657": "* Then ...!?/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5662": "* (You hear shuffling.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5663": "* (Seems like you could put&  something under the door.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5664": " & &         Put         No Put\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5665": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_5669": "* (No response.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5676": "* (...)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5677": "* (But you didn't have anything&  appealing.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5705": "* (You put a Hot Dog in front&  of the door.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5706": "* (A white paw shoots out from&  under the door.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5707": "* (It tries to pull the Hot Dog&  into its room...)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5708": "* (But it keeps pressing down too&  hard^1, and the hot dog keeps&  spinning away.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5709": "* (...)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5710": "* (It finally succeeds.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5711": "* (...)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5712": "* (You hear the grinding of&  stone.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5713": "* (A single hushpuppy slides&  out from under the door.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5714": "* (You got Hush Puppy.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5720": "* (You put a Hot Cat in front&  of the door.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5721": "* (You hear growling...)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5727": "* (You put a Dog Salad in front&  of the door.^1)&* (It slides underneath.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5728": "* (...)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5729": "* (The Dog Salad was absorbed&  by the darkness.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5736": "* (You put a Dog Residue in&  front of the door.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5737": "* (It slides underneath the door^1,&  as if pulled by a magnet.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5738": "* (...)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5743": "* (ZOMMM!!^1!)&* (It shoots back out at a&  high speed!)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5747": "* (Two Dog Residues slowly slide&  back out from underneath&  the door.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5755": " %%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5761": "* Yes^1, we know^1.&* The elevator to the city&  is NOT working./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5762": "* Because of this incident^1, rooms&  are running at a special rate!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5763": "* 200G a room^1. Interested^1?& &         Stay        Do not\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5764": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_5768": "* 200G a room^1. Interested^1?& &         Stay        Do not\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5769": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_5774": "* Did you enjoy your stay?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5775": "* What^1?&* Room..^1.&* Key?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5776": "* No^1, we don't do that./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5777": "* If you leave your room^1,&  you'll have to pay again./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5778": "* 200G a room^1. Interested^1?& &         Stay        Do not\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5779": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_5791": "* Fabulous^1!&* We'll escort you to your&  room!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5797": "* ... that's not enough money./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5802": "* Do let us know if you&  change your mind^1.&* Have a sparkular day!/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5807": "* ... MY ONE TRUE LOVE?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5808": "* .../",
  "SCR_TEXT_5809": "* (YOU LOOK BORED^1, DARLING.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5810": "* (I WANT THIS TO BE A STELLAR&  PERFORMANCE^1, SO IF YOU&  WON'T GIVE IT YOUR ALL...)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5811": "* (THEN I'LL SKIP AHEAD FOR&  THE AUDIENCE'S SAKE.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5812": "* (Perform?)& &         Yeah        Skip this\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5813": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_5819": "* (UNDERSTOOD.^1)&* (LET'S KNOCK 'EM DEAD!)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5823": "* (KA-SIGH...^1)&* (THE SHOW MUST GO ON!)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5829": "Interesting./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5830": "You want to go back./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5831": "You want to go bac^1k&to the worl^2d&you destroyed./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5832": "It was you who pushed&everythin^1g to its edge./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5833": "It was you who led the worl^1d&to its destruction./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5834": "But you cannot accept it./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5835": "You think you are above&consequences.&         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5836": "",
  "SCR_TEXT_5842": "Exactly./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5846": "Then what are you looking for?/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5851": "Perhaps./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5852": "We can reach a compromise./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5853": "You still have somethin^1g&I want./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5854": "Give it to me./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5855": "And I will bring this&world back./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5856": " & &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5857": "",
  "SCR_TEXT_5863": "Then it is agreed./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5864": "You will give me your SOUL.& &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5865": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_5869": "Then stay here for&all eternity./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5870": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_5877": ".../",
  "SCR_TEXT_5878": "Then^1, it is done./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5882": "Then stay here for&all eternity./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5883": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_5888": "* hey./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5889": "* is your refrigerator&  running?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_5890": " & &         yes         no\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_5891": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_5897": "* nice^1.&* i'll be over to deposit&  the brewskis./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_5901": "* ok^1, i'll send someone&  over to fix it./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5902": "* thanks for letting me&  know./",
  "SCR_TEXT_5903": "* good communication is&  important./%%",
