  "obj_battlecontroller_286": "* YOU WON!&* You earned \\[1] EXP and \\[2] gold.",
  "obj_battlecontroller_287": "&* Your LOVE increased.",
  "obj_bed_dark_64": " error/%%",
  "obj_bed_dark_66": "* (It's a bed.)/%%",
  "obj_bed_watcher_94": "* (Seems like a comfy bed.)/",
  "obj_bed_watcher_95": "* (You could probably climb&  into it if you were to&  the left of it.)/%%",
  "obj_blookdiary_64": "%%",
  "obj_blookdiary_70": "* Dear Diary^1:&* Shyren's sister \"fell down\"&  recently./",
  "obj_blookdiary_71": "* It's sad^1.&* Without her sister to&  speak for her.../",
  "obj_blookdiary_72": "* She's become more&  reclusive than ever./",
  "obj_blookdiary_73": "* So I reached out to her^1,&  and told her.../",
  "obj_blookdiary_74": "* That she^1, Blooky^1, and I&  should all perform together&  sometime./",
  "obj_blookdiary_75": "* She seemed to like&  that idea./%%",
  "obj_blookdiary_80": "* Dearer Diary^1:&* I like to buy a new diary&  for every entry I make./",
  "obj_blookdiary_81": "* I love to collect diaries./%%",
  "obj_blookdiary_85": "* Dearest Diary^1:&* Our cousin left the farm&  to become a training dummy./",
  "obj_blookdiary_86": "* That leaves just Blooky&  and I./",
  "obj_blookdiary_87": "* Blooky asked me if I was&  going to try to become&  corporeal^1, too./",
  "obj_blookdiary_88": "* They sounded so..^1.&* Resigned.../",
  "obj_blookdiary_89": "* Come on^1, Blooky^1.&* You know I'd never leave&  you behind./",
  "obj_blookdiary_90": "* And besides.../",
  "obj_blookdiary_91": "* I'd never find the kind&  of body I'm looking for^1,&  anyway./%%",
  "obj_blookdiary_96": "* My Darling Diary^1:&* I met someone..^1.&* Interesting today./",
  "obj_blookdiary_97": "* Last week I posted that&  advertisement for my&  Human Fanclub./",
  "obj_blookdiary_98": "* Today was our first meeting./",
  "obj_blookdiary_99": "* Only one other person came./",
  "obj_blookdiary_100": "* Honestly^1, she's a dork^1.&* And she's obsessed with&  these awful cartoons./",
  "obj_blookdiary_101": "* But she's kind of funny^1,&  too..../",
  "obj_blookdiary_102": "* I want to see her again./%%",
  "obj_blookdiary_107": "* Diary... My dear:&* My diary collection is&  going fabulously./",
  "obj_blookdiary_108": "* I have like five now./%%",
  "obj_blookdiary_115": "* Dear Diary^1:&* She surpised me with&  something today./",
  "obj_blookdiary_116": "* Sketches of a body that&  she wants to create for&  me.../",
  "obj_blookdiary_117": "* A form beyond my wildest&  fantasies./",
  "obj_blookdiary_118": "* In a form like that^1, I&  could finally feel&  like... \"myself.\"/",
  "obj_blookdiary_119": "* After all^1, there's no&  way I can be a star&  the way I am now./",
  "obj_blookdiary_120": "* Sorry^1, Blooky^1.&* My dreams can't wait&  for anyone.../%%",
  "obj_blueattackgen_60": "* You're blue now.",
  "obj_blueattackgen_90": " YOU'RE BLUE NOW./",
  "obj_blueattackgen_91": " THAT'S MY ATTACK!/",
  "obj_blueattackgen_92": " NYEH HEH HEH& HEH HEH HEH& HEH HEH HEH!!!/%%",
  "obj_bonebox_63": "HEY^1, THOSE ARE ALL&THE ATTACKS I USED&ON YOU./",
  "obj_bonebox_64": "GREAT MEMORIES^1,&HUH?/",
  "obj_bonebox_65": "SEEMS LIKE IT&WAS ONLY&YESTERDAY.../",
  "obj_bonebox_66": "\\E3EVEN THOUGH&IT BASICALLY&JUST HAPPENED./%%",
  "obj_bonebox_70": "HEY^1, THOSE ARE ALL&THE ATTACKS I&DIDN'T USE./",
  "obj_bonebox_71": "\\WHOW LUCKY OF YOU^1!&HAD I ONLY USED&MY \\YSPECIAL ATTACK\\W,/",
  "obj_bonebox_72": "\\E2YOU SURELY WOULD&HAVE BEEN BLASTED&TO.../",
  "obj_bonebox_73": "\\WH\\E3EY.^1 WAIT^1.&WHERE'S MY \\YSPECIAL&ATTACK\\W?/",
  "obj_bonebox_74": "\\E1NO^1! I'VE BEEN&DOGBURGLED BY THAT&PERNICIOUS PUP!/",
  "obj_bonebox_75": "\\E3THAT LOATHESOME&SCOUNDREL LOVES TO&SNEAK INTO MY ROOM./",
  "obj_bonebox_76": "\\E5SOMETIMES IT EVEN&CRAWLS INTO MY BED&WHILE I'M RESTING./",
  "obj_bonebox_77": "\\E3IF THAT WASN'T&BAD ENOUGH^1, IT HAS&VERY COLD FEET./%%",
  "obj_bonebox_81": "* (It's a box of bones.)/%%",
  "obj_bonebox_85": "* (It's a box of bones.)/%%",
  "obj_bonedrawer_check_84": "%%",
  "obj_boysnightout_80": "* Hey^1! You^1!&* Stop!/%%",
  "obj_boysnightout_113": "* We've^1, like^1, received an&  anonymous tip about a human&  wearing a striped shirt./",
  "obj_boysnightout_114": "* They told us they were&  wandering around Hotland&  right now.../",
  "obj_boysnightout_115": "* I know^1, sounds scary^1, huh?/",
  "obj_boysnightout_116": "* Well^1, just stay chill^1.&* We'll bring you someplace&  safe^1, OK?/%%",
  "obj_boysnightout_117": "%%%",
  "obj_boysnightout_156": "* ... Huh^1?&* What is it, bro?/",
  "obj_boysnightout_157": "* The shirt they're wearing?/",
  "obj_boysnightout_158": "* ... like^1, what about it?/%%",
  "obj_boysnightout_181": "* Bro.../",
  "obj_boysnightout_182": "* Are you thinkin..^1.&* What I'm thinkin?/",
  "obj_boysnightout_183": "* Bummer^1.&* This is^1, like..^1.&* Mega embarrassing./",
  "obj_boysnightout_184": "* We^1, like^1, actually&  totally have to kill&  you and stuff./%%",
  "obj_businessmanticore_70": "* This elevator goes straight&  to the capital^1.&* But it stopped working./",
  "obj_businessmanticore_71": "* The hotel's doing its best to&  accomodate everybody&  stuck here./%%",
  "obj_businessmanticore_75": "* Me^1?&* I just like explaining things&  to passersby./%%",
  "obj_businessmanticore_80": "* Good news^1!&* The elevator started working&  again./",
  "obj_businessmanticore_81": "* But now it's been so busy^1,&  we still haven't gotten the&  chance to ride it./%%",
  "obj_businessmanticore_86": "* Mettaton hasn't made a&  performance for more&  than five minutes.../",
  "obj_businessmanticore_87": "* What's happening...^1?&* Can you explain it?/%%",
  "obj_butterflybullet_102": "* Whimsalot doesn't want to&  fight anymore.",
  "obj_cactus_55": "* Ah^1, the cactus.&* Truly the most tsundere&  of plants./%%",
  "obj_cactus_58": "* It's not like this cactus&  was waiting for you to come&  back or anything.../%%",
  "obj_carbed_63": "THAT'S MY BED!/",
  "obj_carbed_64": "IF I EVER GET&TO THE SURFACE.../",
  "obj_carbed_65": "I'D LIKE TO&DRIVE DOWN A&LONG HIGHWAY./",
  "obj_carbed_66": "WIND IN MY&HAIR.../",
  "obj_carbed_67": "SUN ON MY&SKIN.../",
  "obj_carbed_68": "\\E3OF COURSE^1, THAT'S&JUST A DREAM./",
  "obj_carbed_69": "\\E0SO INSTEAD I&CRUISE WHILE I&SNOOZE./%%",
  "obj_carbed_72": "WHY ARE YOU SO&INTERESTED IN MY&BED?/",
  "obj_carbed_73": "\\E3ARE YOU TIRED?/%%",
  "obj_carbed_78": "* (It's a racecar bed^1, neatly&  made.)/%%",
  "obj_carrybird_95": "* Isn't my little Cinnamon&  just the cutest?/",
  "obj_carrybird_96": "* Bun-buns are so adorable..^1.&* Tee hee!/%%",
  "obj_carrybird_98": "* Bun-bun-bun-bun-bun.../%%",
  "obj_chairiel_118": "* (Seems like the right size&  for Toriel.)/%%",
  "obj_chairiel_123": "* (It's a great reading chair.^1)&* (But it doesn't seem like&  anyone uses it.)/%%",
  "obj_cheesetable1_58": "* This cheese has been here&  quite a long time./",
  "obj_cheesetable1_59": "* It's stuck to the table.../%%",
  "obj_cheesetable1_62": "* (Looks like cheese has a&  nibble taken out of it.)/%%",
