  "obj_chipdoor_r_89": "* (The door is open.)/%%",
  "obj_chipdoor_r_94": "* (The door is open.)/%%",
  "obj_clamgirl_74": "* I'm visiting Waterfall&  from the city./",
  "obj_clamgirl_75": "* Synchronicity...^1?&* My neighbor's daughter looks&  about your age./",
  "obj_clamgirl_76": "\\W* Her name is \"\\YSuzy\\W.^1\"&* I feel like you two should&  be friends./",
  "obj_clamgirl_77": "* You have..^1.&* A neighbor's blessing!!!/%%",
  "obj_clamgirl_81": "* Not knowing where I live&  is no issue^1.&* Fate finds a way./",
  "obj_clamgirl_82": "* In life's grand scheme^1, she&  might be why you came here&  in the first place.../%%",
  "obj_clamgirl_93": "* I sense a disturbance in&  the nearby aura.../",
  "obj_clamgirl_94": "* I think you should leave&  that girl alone./%%",
  "obj_clamgirl_102": "* So you never met my&  neighbor's daughter./",
  "obj_clamgirl_103": "* Don't despair^1.&* This world has infinite&  opportunities./",
  "obj_clamgirl_104": "* But there's a limit to the&  things you can do today^1.&* Accepting this is healthy./",
  "obj_clamgirl_105": "* Take my neighbor's blessing^1!&* And consider this blessing&  for anything you like!/%%",
  "obj_clamgirl_110": "* I wanted to tell you about&  my neighbor's daughter./",
  "obj_clamgirl_111": "* But you walked right by me&  before I could tell you./",
  "obj_clamgirl_112": "* Fate has decided that I&  should not tell you./%%",
  "obj_clamguy_73": "* O, k, k, k, k.../",
  "obj_clamguy_74": "* I was thirsty^1, so I came&  over from Waterfall to get&  a drink!/%%",
  "obj_clamguy_78": "* O, k, k.../",
  "obj_clamguy_79": "* What are you doing with&  all of that water?/%%",
  "obj_clamguy_83": "* O, k, k, k, k.../",
  "obj_clamguy_84": "* So now we have a private pool^1?&* Worse things have happened./%%",
  "obj_clamguy_89": "* O, k, k, k, k.../",
  "obj_clamguy_90": "* Are you just carrying that&  around to look sophisticated?/",
  "obj_clamguy_91": "* Cause it's not working./%%",
  "obj_clamguy_98": "* O, k, k, k, k.../",
  "obj_clamguy_99": "* I'll be able to have a nice&  drink on the surface./%%",
  "obj_colorlever_77": "* (It's some kind of switch.^1)&* (There's a red-colored&  slot in the center.)/%%",
  "obj_colorlever_81": "* (The red switch has been&  turned on.)/%%",
  "obj_colorlever_89": "* (Click!^1)&* (The red key fits perfectly&  into the slot.)/%%",
