  "obj_f_frasier_35": " %",
  "obj_f_frasier_36": "%%%",
  "obj_f_frasier_40": "* Hee hee hee^1.&* Did you really think&  you could run away?/%%",
  "obj_f_frasier_43": "* Hee hee hee./",
  "obj_f_frasier_44": "* Did you really think&  I was gonna be&  satisfied.../",
  "obj_f_frasier_45": "* ... killing you only&  ONE time?/%%",
  "obj_f_frasier_49": "* Pathetic..^1.&* Now you're REALLY&  gonna die!/%%",
  "obj_f_frasier_53": "* Hee hee hee./",
  "obj_f_frasier_54": "* Do you even realize&  what will happen if&  you defeat me...?/%%",
  "obj_f_frasier_58": "* Don't you get it?/",
  "obj_f_frasier_59": "* There's no such thing&  as happy endings./",
  "obj_f_frasier_60": "* This is all that's&  left...!/%%",
  "obj_f_frasier_64": "* Are you REALLY that&  desperate...^1?&* Hee hee hee.../%%",
  "obj_f_frasier_68": "* Are you letting me&  kill you..^1.&* ... on PURPOSE^2?&* SICKO^1. Ha ha ha./%%",
  "obj_f_frasier_72": "* Honestly^1, fighting&  you IS pretty fun.../",
  "obj_f_frasier_73": "* ... So even if you&  ARE a sicko^1, I'll&  take it!/%%",
  "obj_f_frasier_77": "* Maybe you're wondering&  if I ever get tired&  of winning.../",
  "obj_f_frasier_78": "* Wanna see my answer?/%%",
  "obj_f_frasier_82": "* Don't you have anything&  better to do?/%%",
