  "obj_froggit_42": "%%%",
  "obj_froggit_184": "* Froggit doesn't seem to&  know why it's here.",
  "obj_froggit_185": "* Froggit hops to and fro.",
  "obj_froggit_186": "* The battlefield is filled&  with the smell of mustard&  seed.",
  "obj_froggit_187": "* You are intimidated by&  Froggit's raw strength^4.&* Only kidding.",
  "obj_froggit_188": "* Froggit seems reluctant&  to fight you.",
  "obj_froggit_189": "* Froggit is trying to&  run away.",
  "obj_froggit_205": "* FROGGIT - ATK 4 DEF 5&* Life is difficult for&  this enemy./^",
  "obj_froggit_214": "* Froggit didn't understand&  what you said^1, but was&  scared anyway./^",
  "obj_froggit_225": "* Froggit didn't understand&  what you said^1, but was&  flattered anyway./^",
  "obj_gameintro_fake_44": "Long ago^1, two races&ruled over Earth^1:&HUMANS and MONSTERS. \\E1 ^1 %",
  "obj_gameintro_fake_45": "One day^1, th^7ey all&disappeared without&a trace.",
  "obj_garbagepile_70": "* (Piles of garbage.)&* (There are quite a few&  brands you recognize.)/%%",
  "obj_garbagepile_71": "* (Just garbage.)/%%",
  "obj_garbagepile_72": "* (There's a pile of yellow names&  in the trash pile.)/%%",
  "obj_garbagepile_73": "* (Garbage.)/%%",
  "obj_garbagepile_74": "* (A trash heap.)/%%",
  "obj_garbagepile_75": "* (Your persistent garbage&  habit shows no signs&  of payoff.)/%%",
  "obj_garbagepile_76": "* (Trash.)/%%",
  "obj_gaster_follower_a_94": "* Alphys might work faster^1.&* But the old Royal Scientist^1,&  Doctor W.D. Gaster?/",
  "obj_gaster_follower_a_95": "* One day^1, he vanished&  without a trace./",
  "obj_gaster_follower_a_96": "* They say he shattered&  across time and space./",
  "obj_gaster_follower_a_97": "* Ha ha..^1.&* How can I say so&  without fear?/",
  "obj_gaster_follower_a_98": "* I'm holding a piece of&  him right here./%%",
  "obj_gaster_follower_b_94": "* It makes sense why ASGORE&  took so long to hire a&  new Royal Scientist./",
  "obj_gaster_follower_b_95": "* After all^1, the old one..^1.&* Dr. Gaster^1.&* What an act to follow!/",
  "obj_gaster_follower_b_96": "* They say he created the CORE./",
  "obj_gaster_follower_b_97": "* However^1, his life..^1.&* Was cut short./",
  "obj_gaster_follower_b_98": "* One day^1, he fell into&  his creation^1, and.../%%",
  "obj_gaster_follower_b_102": "* Will Alphys end up the&  same way?/%%",
  "obj_gaster_follower_c_95": "* I understand why ASGORE&  waited so long to hire a&  new Royal Scientist./",
  "obj_gaster_follower_c_96": "* The previous one..^1.&* Dr. Gaster./",
  "obj_gaster_follower_c_97": "* His brilliance was&  irreplaceable./",
  "obj_gaster_follower_c_98": "* However^1, his life..^1.&* Was cut short./",
  "obj_gaster_follower_c_99": "* One day^1, his experiments&  went wrong^1, and.../%%",
  "obj_gaster_follower_c_103": "* Well^1, I needn't gossip./",
  "obj_gaster_follower_c_104": "* After all^1, it's rude to&  talk about someone who's&  listening./%%",
  "obj_gaster_room_34": "ENTRY NUMBER&SEVENTEEN/",
  "obj_gaster_room_35": "DARK&DARKER&YET DARKER/",
  "obj_gaster_room_36": "THE DARKNES^2S&KEEPS GROWING/",
  "obj_gaster_room_37": "THE SHADOW^2S&CUTTING DEEPER/",
  "obj_gaster_room_38": "PHOTON&READING^2S&NEGATIVE/",
  "obj_gaster_room_39": "THIS NEX^2T&EXPERIMENT/",
  "obj_gaster_room_40": "SEEMS/",
  "obj_gaster_room_41": "VERY/",
  "obj_gaster_room_42": "VERY/",
  "obj_gaster_room_43": "INTERESTING/",
  "obj_gaster_room_44": ".../",
  "obj_gaster_room_45": "WHAT DO YOU&TWO THINK/%%",
  "obj_gladdummy_216": " Thanks!",
  "obj_gladdummy_218": "Thanks!",
  "obj_gladdummy_219": "Thank&you!",
  "obj_gladdummy_220": "Great&work!",
  "obj_gladdummy_221": "Bravo!",
  "obj_gladdummy_222": "OK!",
  "obj_gladdummy_223": "...",
  "obj_gladdummy_232": "%%%",
  "obj_gladdummy_405": "* Dummy looks like it's&  going to fall over.",
  "obj_gladdummy_406": "* Dummy stands around&  absentmindedly.",
  "obj_gladdummy_411": "* Dummy tires of your&  aimless shenanigans.",
  "obj_gladdummy_448": "* GLAD DUMMY - ATK 0 DEF 0^1 &* Wipe that smile off your&  face./^",
  "obj_glydeb_148": "How&great&I am.",
  "obj_glydeb_149": "Look.&Watch.&Observe.",
  "obj_glydeb_150": "Wow.&Check&out my&pecs.",
  "obj_glydeb_151": "Sorry...&for&NOTHING&*ollies*",
  "obj_glydeb_159": "Boo?&What a&wimpy&ghost.",
  "obj_glydeb_160": "Mmm,&Fresh&Sweet&Haters",
  "obj_glydeb_165": "OK!&I rule!&I admit&it!",
  "obj_glydeb_168": "What&else do&you have&to say!?",
  "obj_glydeb_174": "...",
  "obj_glydeb_175": "Eh?&You&forgot&to clap.",
  "obj_glydeb_176": "HELLO??&I'M&RIGHT&HERE!!!",
  "obj_glydeb_181": "%%%",
  "obj_glydeb_414": "* Glyde does fancy flips.",
  "obj_glydeb_415": "* Glyde is giving itself a&  high five^1.&* ... somehow.",
  "obj_glydeb_416": "* Glyde sees its reflection &  and gets jealous.",
  "obj_glydeb_417": "* Glyde is thinking of new&  slang for the word \"cool.\"&* Like \"freakadacious.\"",
  "obj_glydeb_418": "* An arrogant-smelling wind&  blows through.",
  "obj_glydeb_420": "* Glyde is doing tons of flips&  to get your attention.",
  "obj_glydeb_421": "* Glyde seems satisfied.",
  "obj_glydeb_422": "* Glyde is dying^1, but in a&  cool way.",
  "obj_glydeb_455": "* GLYDE - ATK HIGH DEF HIGH&* Refuses to give more details&  about its statistics./^",
  "obj_glydeb_466": "* You clap really sloppily^1.&* Glyde sucks up your praise&  like a vacuum cleaner./^",
  "obj_glydeb_471": "* You clap like a gorilla^1.&* Glyde is becoming addicted to&  your praise./^",
  "obj_glydeb_486": "* You boo..^1. but haters&  only make Glyde stronger^1.&* Glyde ATTACK UP+DEFENSE DOWN./^",
  "obj_glydeb_492": "* You boo loudly^1.&* Glyde leaves to look elsewhere&  for praise./^",
  "obj_glydeb_506": "* You do nothing^1.&* No effect./^",
  "obj_glydeb_511": "* You do nothing^1.&* Glyde leaves to look elsewhere&  for praise./^",
  "obj_glydeb_519": "* You do nothing^1.&* Glyde looks desperate for&  attention./^",
  "obj_glydeb_525": "* You do nothing^1.&* Glyde looks disappointed you&  aren't paying attention./^",
  "obj_bigglydeshot_word_0": "COOL",
  "obj_bigglydeshot_word_1": "VIBIN",
  "obj_bigglydeshot_word_2": "RAD",
  "obj_bigglydeshot_word_3": "NICEY",
  "obj_bigglydeshot_word_4": "SPICEY",
  "obj_bigglydeshot_word_5": "SWEET",
  "obj_bigglydeshot_word_6": "SICK",
  "obj_greatdog_440": "* Greater Dog is watching you&  intently.",
  "obj_greatdog_441": "* Greater Dog is waiting for&  your command.",
  "obj_greatdog_442": "* It smells like freshly-&  squeezed puppy juice.",
  "obj_greatdog_443": "* Greater Dog is seeking&  affection.",
  "obj_greatdog_444": "* Greater Dog just wants&  affection.",
  "obj_greatdog_445": "* Greater Dog is making&  puppy-dog eyes.",
  "obj_greatdog_446": "* Greater Dog is patting the&  ground with its front paws.",
  "obj_greatdog_447": "* Greater Dog wants some TLC.",
  "obj_greatdog_448": "* Pet capacity is 40-percent.",
  "obj_greatdog_449": "* Greater Dog is contented.",
  "obj_greatdog_450": "* Greater Dog is panting&  slowly.",
  "obj_greatdog_466": "* GREATER DOG - ATK 15 DEF 8&* It's so excited that it&  thinks fighting is just play./^",
  "obj_greatdog_478": "* The Greater Dog's ears&  perk up^1.&* Nothing else happens./^",
  "obj_greatdog_482": "* You call the Greater Dog./",
  "obj_greatdog_483": "* It bounds towards you^1,&  flecking slobber into your&  face./^",
  "obj_greatdog_495": "* Greater Dog inches closer./^",
  "obj_greatdog_501": "* Greater Dog decides you are&  too boring./^",
  "obj_greatdog_512": "* You pet the dog./^",
  "obj_greatdog_515": "* Tummy rubs are forbidden./^",
  "obj_greatdog_520": "* You pet decisively^1.&* Pet capacity reaches 100&  percent./",
  "obj_greatdog_521": "* The dog flops over with&  its legs hanging in the air./^",
  "obj_greatdog_528": "* As you pet the dog^1,&  it sinks its entire weight&  into you.../",
  "obj_greatdog_529": "* Your movements slow./",
  "obj_greatdog_530": "* But^1, you still haven't&  pet enough...!/^",
  "obj_greatdog_536": "* Greater Dog's excitement is&  creating a power field that&  prevents petting./^",
  "obj_greatdog_540": "* Greater Dog curls up in&  your lap as it is&  pet by you./",
  "obj_greatdog_541": "* It gets so comfortable&  it falls asleep.../",
  "obj_greatdog_542": "* Zzzzz.../",
  "obj_greatdog_543": "* .../",
  "obj_greatdog_544": "* Then it wakes up^1!&* It's so excited!/^",
  "obj_greatdog_549": "* Greater Dog is too far&  away to pet^1.&* You just pet the air./^",
  "obj_greatdog_558": "* You play with the dog./^",
  "obj_greatdog_561": "* Greater Dog is too tired&  to play./^",
  "obj_greatdog_565": "* You make a snowball and&  throw it for the dog&  to fetch./",
  "obj_greatdog_566": "* It splats on the ground./",
  "obj_greatdog_567": "* Greater Dog picks up all&  the snow in the area&  and brings it to you./",
  "obj_greatdog_568": "* Now dog is very tired..^1.&* It rests its head on you.../^",
  "obj_greatdog_573": "* Greater Dog is not excited&  enough to play with./^",
  "obj_grillbynpc_doggo_74": "* I'm thinking of getting a&  spiked collar to show off&  my personality./",
  "obj_grillbynpc_doggo_75": "* It makes a statement like..^1.&* \"Attach a leash to me and&  take me for a walk please.\"/%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_doggo_79": "* He may not look like it^1,&  but this big guy writes&  the most eloquent letters./",
  "obj_grillbynpc_doggo_80": "* Here^1, take a look!/",
  "obj_grillbynpc_doggo_81": "* (It's just the word \"Bark\"&  but in flowery cursive.)/%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_doggo_86": "* Papyrus^1?&* Is that you^1?& Come on.../%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_doggo_91": "* Undyne!^1?&* Did you come all the way&  out here...?/%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_doggo_96": "* Huh^1?&* Since when did you and&  Sans become friends...?/",
  "obj_grillbynpc_doggo_97": "* I don't like him..^1.&* He loves to appear without&  moving./%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_doggo_101": "* Where're the other two^1?&* I can't play with this&  big dumb guy alone.../",
  "obj_grillbynpc_doggo_102": "* He'll just win!!!/%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_doggo_104": "* Sometimes the others like to&  prank me^1. They sit still&  so I can't see them./",
  "obj_grillbynpc_doggo_105": "* They must be here^1, playing a&  joke on me./",
  "obj_grillbynpc_doggo_106": "* I'll just wait until one of&  them admits it.../%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_doggo_110": "* Having an amorphous^1,&  shambling family member&  is great./",
  "obj_grillbynpc_doggo_111": "* They're always moving^1, so I&  can see them 100-percent&  of the time!/%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_foodmonster_73": "* Hmmm..^1.&* Isn't human food different&  from monster food?/",
  "obj_grillbynpc_foodmonster_74": "* It does things like \"spoil.\"/",
  "obj_grillbynpc_foodmonster_75": "* And when you eat it^1, it&  passes all the way through&  your whole body./",
  "obj_grillbynpc_foodmonster_76": "* Disgusting./",
  "obj_grillbynpc_foodmonster_77": "* I'd love to try it sometime./%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_foodmonster_80": "* And I've heard they have&  things called bathrooms./%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_foodmonster_84": "* To a human^1, monster food&  would be very interesting./",
  "obj_grillbynpc_foodmonster_85": "* As soon as you eat it^1, it&  converts perfectly into&  energy./",
  "obj_grillbynpc_foodmonster_86": "* ... that makes me wonder^1.&* How do humans do it?/",
  "obj_grillbynpc_foodmonster_87": "* Eat during battle...?/%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_foodmonster_90": "* Ice cream in one hand^1,&  sword in the other./",
  "obj_grillbynpc_foodmonster_91": "* That's the way of the&  monster warrior.../%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_foodmonster_97": "* Hmmm^1, this is around the&  time that Sans comes in./",
  "obj_grillbynpc_foodmonster_98": "* Then^1, a little bit later^1,&  his brother comes in^1,&  irritated./",
  "obj_grillbynpc_foodmonster_99": "* Yes^1, his brother^1.&* Papyrus./",
  "obj_grillbynpc_foodmonster_100": "* He's an interesting fellow./",
  "obj_grillbynpc_foodmonster_101": "* He always orders a glass of&  milk.../",
  "obj_grillbynpc_foodmonster_102": "* He says it's \"full of&  strong bones.\"/%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_foodmonster_104": "* Hope he shows up today./%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_foodmonster_109": "* Soon^1, I'll be able to try&  some human food.../",
  "obj_grillbynpc_foodmonster_110": "* And then I guess I'll try&  a human bathroom^1, too./%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_foodmonster_115": "* Sans is interesting^1.&* He has told me about all&  kinds of incredible foods./",
  "obj_grillbynpc_foodmonster_116": "* But^1, despite his knowledge^1,&  he always orders the worst&  burger off the menu./%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_grillby_73": "* ..^1.&* ..^1.&* ..^1./",
  "obj_grillbynpc_grillby_74": "* Grillbz said that he'd offer&  you a glass of water^1, but he&  doesn't touch the stuff./%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_grillby_78": "* .............^1.&* ..............^1.&* ... good job./%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_grillby_83": "* ..^1.&* ..^1.&* ..^1./",
  "obj_grillbynpc_grillby_84": "* Grillbz said that your&  food is probably cold&  by now./%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_hot2_73": "* Those dogs are part of&  the ROYAL GUARD^1, the elite&  military group led by UNDYNE./",
  "obj_grillbynpc_hot2_74": "* She's rude^1, loud^1, and beats up&  everybody who gets in her&  way.../",
  "obj_grillbynpc_hot2_75": "* It's no wonder all the kids&  want to be like her when&  they grow up!/%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_hot2_77": "* I want to be like UNDYNE&  when I grow up^1, too^1!&* Hoo hoo hoo!/%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_hot2_81": "* Sans is a sentry^1.&* But don't let his title make&  you think he does anything./",
  "obj_grillbynpc_hot2_82": "\\W* Everyone knows he sits&  around in the forest&  reading \\Ycar magazines\\W./%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_hot2_87": "* Ehhhhhhhhnnnnn..^1.&* I wish I had something else&  to do./%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_hot2_92": "* Those dogs are part of&  the ROYAL GUARD^1, the.../",
  "obj_grillbynpc_hot2_93": "* Huh^1?&* Where are they?/",
  "obj_grillbynpc_hot2_94": "* Something feels really off./%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_hot2_101": "* Wow^1, a brand new world.../",
  "obj_grillbynpc_hot2_102": "* I might not get to&  translate for Grillby&  anymore.../",
  "obj_grillbynpc_hot2_103": "* ... which is fine^1, since I&  was actually just making&  up what he was saying./%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_hot2_109": "* Grillby is getting nervous./",
  "obj_grillbynpc_hot2_110": "* Sans is his best customer^1,&  and he hasn't shown up&  at all today.../%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_hot2_115": "* Something feels really bad^1.&* Our lives are going nowhere^1,&  aren't they...?/",
  "obj_grillbynpc_hot2_116": "* I think I need another&  espresso.../%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_hotandbothered_73": "* No matter where I go^1,&  it's the same menu^1, the&  same people.../",
  "obj_grillbynpc_hotandbothered_74": "* Help^1!&* I want new drinks an'&  ^1h-^1h-^1h-hot guys!!!!/%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_hotandbothered_75": "* I guess the bartender's kind&  of ^1h-^1h-^1h-hot.../%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_hotandbothered_79": "* C'mon everybody!!^1!&* ^1L-^1l-^1l-let's party!!!/",
  "obj_grillbynpc_hotandbothered_80": "* ... anyone?/%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_hotandbothered_84": "* Sansyyyy..^1.&* Come back and sit with me.../",
  "obj_grillbynpc_hotandbothered_85": "* Everything's so fun when&  you're around!!!/%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_hotandbothered_90": "* It's s-s-so quiet in here./",
  "obj_grillbynpc_hotandbothered_91": "* L-lighten up everybody^1!&* This is why I hate&  th-this place./%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_hotandbothered_98": "* I w-wonder if the&  o-overworld h-has h-hot&  guys.../",
  "obj_grillbynpc_hotandbothered_99": "*  A-and neat d-drinks.../",
  "obj_grillbynpc_hotandbothered_100": "* Ooooooo^1, I'm ready!/%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_hotandbothered_105": "* H-hey^1, isn't Sansy s'posed&  to come swinging in right&  about now???/",
  "obj_grillbynpc_hotandbothered_106": "* C'mon Sansy^1!&* You're the life of the&  party.../%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_lesserdog_71": "* (It's playing poker against&  itself.)/",
  "obj_grillbynpc_lesserdog_72": "* (It appears to be losing.)/%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_lesserdog_76": "* (It has switched to Go Fish.)/%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_lesserdog_81": "* (It finally won a game of&  poker against itself...?)/%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_mandog_75": "* You better watch where you&  sit down in here^1, kid./",
  "obj_grillbynpc_mandog_76": "* Because that big guy WILL jump&  into your lap and give you&  lots of love and attention./%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_mandog_80": "* Where's Sans..^1.&* He's supposed to give me&  a pat on the head.../%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_mandog_85": "* She hasn't been responding&  to our letters.../",
  "obj_grillbynpc_mandog_86": "* Maybe it's because we let&  Doggo write them all./%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_mandog_91": "* I was hoping Sans came in&  to give me a pat on the&  head./",
  "obj_grillbynpc_mandog_92": "* Interloper...!/%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_mandog_96": "* Where's that big lug^1?&* We can't start until he&  shows up./%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_mandog_98": "* Smells kinda..^1. quiet./%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_mandog_103": "* Hmmm^1, now that our parents&  are the same entity.../",
  "obj_grillbynpc_mandog_104": "* Does that mean I'm&  married to my sister?/",
  "obj_grillbynpc_mandog_105": "* .../",
  "obj_grillbynpc_mandog_106": "* Wait^1, we're dogs^1.&* That stuff's normal./%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_sansdate_121": "* fast shortcut^1, huh?/%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_sansdate_129": "* hey^1, everyone./%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_sansdate_164": "* Hey^1, Sans.&* (Hi^1, Sans.)/%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_sansdate_208": "* Greetings^1, Sans.&* Hiya^1, Sansy~/%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_sansdate_245": "* Hey Sans^1, weren't you just&  here for breakfast a&  few minutes ago?/",
  "obj_grillbynpc_sansdate_247": "* nah^1, i haven't had&  breakfast in at least&  half an hour./",
  "obj_grillbynpc_sansdate_248": "\\E2* you must be thinking&  of brunch./%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_sansdate_286": "* here^1, get comfy./%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_sansdate_521": "* (You tip the ketchup...)/",
  "obj_grillbynpc_sansdate_522": "* (The cap falls off and all&  the ketchup in the bottle&  pours onto your food.)/%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_sansdate_545": "* whoops./",
  "obj_grillbynpc_sansdate_546": "\\E0* eh, forgeddaboudit^1.&* you can have mine./",
  "obj_grillbynpc_sansdate_547": "\\E1* i'm not hungry anyway./%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_sansdate_577": "* anyway^1, cool or not^1,&  you have to agree&  papyrus tries real hard./",
  "obj_grillbynpc_sansdate_578": "\\E0* like how he keeps&  trying to be part of&  the royal guard./",
  "obj_grillbynpc_sansdate_579": "\\E1* one day^1, he went to&  the house of the head&  of the royal guard.../",
  "obj_grillbynpc_sansdate_580": "\\E0* and begged her to&  let him be in it./",
  "obj_grillbynpc_sansdate_581": "\\E1* of course^1, she shut&  the door on him because&  it was midnight./",
  "obj_grillbynpc_sansdate_582": "\\E0* but the next day^1, she&  woke up and saw him&  still waiting there./",
  "obj_grillbynpc_sansdate_583": "* seeing his dedication^1,&  she decided to give&  him warrior training./",
  "obj_grillbynpc_sansdate_584": "\\E1* it's^1, uh^1, still a&  work in progress./%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_sansdate_609": "\\E1* oh yeah^1, I wanted&  to ask you something./%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_sansdate_683": "* welp^1, that was a&  long break./",
  "obj_grillbynpc_sansdate_684": "\\E1* i can't believe i let&  ya pull me away from&  work for that long./%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_sansdate_708": "* just kidding./",
  "obj_grillbynpc_sansdate_709": "* grillby^1, put it on&  my tab./%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_sansdate_751": "* by the way.../",
  "obj_grillbynpc_sansdate_752": "* ... i was going to say&  something^1, but i forgot./%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_womandog_76": "* (We're sentries^1, but we never&  get any respect.)/",
  "obj_grillbynpc_womandog_77": "* (I wish those skeletons would&  throw us a bone.)/",
  "obj_grillbynpc_womandog_78": "* (We love bones.)/%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_womandog_81": "* (Where are those skeletons?^1)&* (I wanted to get a bone&  from them...)/%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_womandog_86": "* (We're considering paying a&  visit to the doctor.)/",
  "obj_grillbynpc_womandog_87": "* (No^1! Not the vet!^1)&* (... well^1, maybe she's a&  little like a vet.)/%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_womandog_92": "* (I like Sans.^1)&* (Sometimes he feeds us scraps&  of food under the table.)/",
  "obj_grillbynpc_womandog_93": "* (Then his brother gets mad...^1)&* (But why!^1? We're adults!^1)&* (We can handle it!)/%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_womandog_97": "* (Where's Doggo?^1)&* (I hope he didn't get&  lost again.)/%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_womandog_99": "* (It's lonely in here today.^1)&* (If our friends don't show up^1,&  would you like to play?)/%%",
  "obj_grillbynpc_womandog_105": "* (All of our parents have&  been combined into one&  horrible being.)/",
  "obj_grillbynpc_womandog_106": "* (That's OK^1, though.^1)&* (It's really \"brought our&  families together.\")/%%",
  "obj_gyftrot_271": "Error!!",
  "obj_gyftrot_273": "Is this&funny to&you?",
  "obj_gyftrot_274": "Don't&put any&more on&me!",
  "obj_gyftrot_275": "Leave me&alone...",
  "obj_gyftrot_276": "Hohoho!&Go ahead&and&laugh...",
  "obj_gyftrot_277": "Get this&off of&me...",
  "obj_gyftrot_279": "Thanks.",
  "obj_gyftrot_283": "Aw, you&shouldn'&have...",
  "obj_gyftrot_284": "You even&wrapped&it...",
  "obj_gyftrot_285": "Keep&away&from me!",
  "obj_gyftrot_286": "I don't&want&your&gift!",
  "obj_gyftrot_287": "How do&I know&it's not&a trick?",
  "obj_gyftrot_293": "GOSHDARN&TEENAGE&GOOGLY&EYES!!!",
  "obj_gyftrot_294": "I WAS&STARTING&TO TRUST&YOU!!!",
  "obj_gyftrot_300": "That's&a little&better.",
  "obj_gyftrot_301": "Er...&Those&are&real.",
  "obj_gyftrot_303": "A weight&has been&lifted.",
  "obj_gyftrot_304": "Thanks&for&nothing!",
  "obj_gyftrot_312": "%%%",
  "obj_gyftrot_507": "* Gyftrot laments its lack of&  hands.",
  "obj_gyftrot_508": "* Gyftrot eyes you with&  suspicion.",
  "obj_gyftrot_509": "* Gyftrot distrusts your&  youthful demeanor.",
  "obj_gyftrot_510": "* Ah^1, the scent of fresh&  pine needles.",
  "obj_gyftrot_511": "* Gyftrot tries vainly to&  remove its decorations.",
  "obj_gyftrot_512": "* Gyftrot pretends to refuse&  your gift.",
  "obj_gyftrot_513": "* Gyftrot politely accepts&  your gift.",
  "obj_gyftrot_514": "* Gyftrot stumbles blindly.",
  "obj_gyftrot_515": "* Gyftrot is slightly less&  irritated.",
  "obj_gyftrot_516": "* Gyftrot's problems have&  been taken away.",
  "obj_gyftrot_517": "* Gyftrot looks disappointed.",
  "obj_gyftrot_519": "* Gyftrot's antlers tremble.",
  "obj_gyftrot_534": "* GYFTROT - ATK 16 DEF 8&* Some teens \"decorated\" it as&  a prank./^",
  "obj_gyftrot_544": "* You remove the striped cane&  that says \"I use this tiny&  cane to walk\" on it./^",
  "obj_gyftrot_545": "* You remove the box of&  non-dog-related raisins./^",
  "obj_gyftrot_546": "* You remove the lenticular&  bookmark of a smug teen&  winking./^",
  "obj_gyftrot_547": "* You remove the barbed wire&  made of pipe cleaners./^",
  "obj_gyftrot_548": "* You remove a childhood&  photograph of Snowdrake and&  his parent./^",
  "obj_gyftrot_549": "* You remove a small^1, confused&  dog./^",
  "obj_gyftrot_550": "* You remove a stocking filled&  with chicken nuggets./^",
  "obj_gyftrot_551": "* You remove the shirt that says& 'I'm with stupid' and points&  inward./^",
  "obj_gyftrot_553": "* You try to undecorate...?/^",
  "obj_gyftrot_554": "* You remove the googly eyes./^",
  "obj_gyftrot_579": "* You add some googly eyes&  you found on the ground./^",
  "obj_gyftrot_586": "* You can't improve on&  perfection./^",
  "obj_gyftrot_601": "* You give the cheapest gift&  of all..^1.&* Friendship./^",
  "obj_gyftrot_610": "* You give 35 G because&  you can't think of an&  appropriate gift./^",
  "obj_gyftrot_616": "* You give your remaining&  money because you can't&  think of a better gift./^",
  "obj_gyftrot_624": "* Gyftrot refuses your gift./^",
  "obj_gyftrot_625": "* Hey now^1.&* You aren't made of money./^",
  "obj_gyftrot_626": "* Hey now^1.&* You aren't made of friendship./^",
  "obj_gyftrotnpc_70": "* I've heard there's a local&  tradition based off of&  my own suffering./",
  "obj_gyftrotnpc_71": "* .../%%",
  "obj_gyftrotnpc_72": "* .../%%",
  "obj_gyftrotnpc_76": "* Everyone's leaving^1, eh?/",
  "obj_gyftrotnpc_77": "* Good riddance^1!&* Maybe I'll finally get&  some peace and quiet!/%%",
  "obj_heartdefeated_0_0": "  You cannot give&  up just yet.../",
  "obj_heartdefeated_0_1": "  \\[C]^1!&  Stay determined.../%%",
  "obj_heartdefeated_100_0": "  \\[C], this is just&  a bad dream.../",
  "obj_heartdefeated_100_1": "  Wake up^1!&  It's not over!/%%",
  "obj_heartdefeated_101_0": "  \\[C]! It's like&  he says.../",
  "obj_heartdefeated_101_1": "  You have to&  stay determined.../%%",
  "obj_heartdefeated_102_0": "  \\[C]! Please&  don't give up.../",
  "obj_heartdefeated_102_1": "  Have some&  determination.../%%",
  "obj_heartdefeated_103_0": "  \\[C]! You're&  \\[C]!/",
  "obj_heartdefeated_103_1": "  You can't quit^1!&  Stay determined.../%%",
  "obj_heartdefeated_104_0": "  \\[C], is this&  a kind of joke?/",
  "obj_heartdefeated_104_1": "  Cut it out^1!&  Wake up!/%%",
  "obj_heartdefeated_105_0": "  \\[C], it's not&  time to leave!/",
  "obj_heartdefeated_105_1": "  Hold on!/%%",
  "obj_heartdefeated_106_0": "  \\[C], gather&  your strength./",
  "obj_heartdefeated_106_1": "  Stay determined!/%%",
  "obj_heartdefeated_107_0": "  \\[C], you have&  to keep going./",
  "obj_heartdefeated_107_1": "  Stay determined!/%%",
  "obj_heartdefeated_200_0": "  You cannot give&  up just yet.../",
  "obj_heartdefeated_200_1": "  \\[C]^1!&  Stay determined.../%%",
  "obj_heartdefeated_201_0": "  Our fate rests &  upon you.../",
  "obj_heartdefeated_201_1": "  \\[C]^1!&  Stay determined.../%%",
  "obj_heartdefeated_202_0": "  You're going to&  be alright!/",
  "obj_heartdefeated_202_1": "  \\[C]^1!&  Stay determined.../%%",
  "obj_heartdefeated_203_0": "  Don't lose hope!/",
  "obj_heartdefeated_203_1": "  \\[C]^1!&  Stay determined.../%%",
  "obj_heartdefeated_204_0": "  It cannot end&  now!/",
  "obj_heartdefeated_204_1": "  \\[C]^1!&  Stay determined.../%%",
  "obj_heartdefeated_300_0": "  geeettttttt&  dunked on!!!/",
  "obj_heartdefeated_300_1": "  if we're really&  friends.../",
