  "obj_introimage_70": "Long ago^1, two races&ruled over Earth^1:&HUMANS and MONSTERS^6. \\E1 ^1 %",
  "obj_introimage_71": "One day^1, war broke&out between the two&races^6. \\E0 ^1 %",
  "obj_introimage_72": "After a long battle^1,&the humans were&victorious^6. \\E1 ^1 %",
  "obj_introimage_73": "They sealed the monsters&underground with a magic&spell^6. \\E0 ^1 %",
  "obj_introimage_74": "Many years later^2.^2.^5.  \\E1 ^1 %",
  "obj_introimage_75": "      MT. EBOTT&         201X^9 \\E0 %",
  "obj_introimage_76": "Legends say that those&who climb the mountain&never return^5.^3 \\E1 %",
  "obj_introimage_78": " \\E1 %",
  "obj_introimage_79": " ^9 ^5 \\E0 %",
  "obj_introimage_80": " ^9 ^5 ^2 \\E1 %",
  "obj_introimage_81": " ^9 ^5 ^2 \\E2 %",
  "obj_introimage_82": " ^9 ^9 ^9 ^9 ^9 ^9 \\E2 %%",
  "obj_introimage_83": " ^9 ^9 ^9 ^9 ^9  \\E0 %%",
  "obj_introimage_84": " ^9 ^9 ^9 ^9 ^9 ^9 \\E0 %",
  "obj_introimage_85": " %%",
  "obj_jerry_164": "Guys, it's COLD.&Does ANYONE care?",
  "obj_jerry_165": "Why are we doing&this? What a fail.",
  "obj_jerry_166": "Wow, you guys&SUCK at this.",
  "obj_jerry_167": "SHHHH! I'm&THINKING, guys!!",
  "obj_jerry_168": "Ka-SIGH.",
  "obj_jerry_171": "Well... can YOU&give me a ride&home?",
  "obj_jerry_172": "Huh? Did they&ditch me...? SOME&friends!",
  "obj_jerry_173": "Awkwarrrd.",
  "obj_jerry_174": "So, like, what&are you even&doing?",
  "obj_jerry_175": "The wi-fi here&sucks.",
  "obj_jerry_199": "Hahaha!&Say something&else funny!",
  "obj_jerry_200": "Haha! Wow!&Drake, you suck!",
  "obj_jerry_201": "Hahaha!&Where do you get&your ideas!?!",
  "obj_jerry_207": "%%%",
  "obj_jerry_407": "* Jerry eats powdery food and&  licks its hands loudly.",
  "obj_jerry_408": "* Jerry sneezes without covering&  its nose.",
  "obj_jerry_409": "* Jerry tells everyone it has to&  go to the bathroom.",
  "obj_jerry_410": "* Jerry lets out a yawn.",
  "obj_jerry_411": "* Smells like....... Jerry.",
  "obj_jerry_412": "* Jerry is wounded.",
  "obj_jerry_414": "* The other monsters celebrate&  Jerry's disappearance.",
  "obj_jerry_415": "* Return of Jerry.",
  "obj_jerry_442": "* JERRY - ATK 0 DEF 30&* Everyone knows Jerry.&* Makes attacks 2 seconds longer./^",
  "obj_jerry_450": "* You and the other&  monsters ditch Jerry&  when it looks away!/^",
  "obj_jetpackchara_198": "* MY MY./",
  "obj_jetpackchara_199": "* IT SEEMS YOU'VE BESTED ME./",
  "obj_jetpackchara_200": "* BUT ONLY BECAUSE YOU HAD&  THE HELP OF THE BRILLIANT&  DOCTOR ALPHYS!/",
  "obj_jetpackchara_201": "* OH^1, I LOATHE TO THINK OF&  WHAT WOULD HAVE HAPPENED&  TO YOU WITHOUT HER!!!/",
  "obj_jetpackchara_203": "* WELL^1, TOODLES!!/%%",
  "obj_jetpackchara_223": "* OH YES^1!&* ABOUT THE SUBSTITUTION.../",
  "obj_jetpackchara_224": "* HAVEN'T YOU EVER SEEN&  A COOKING SHOW BEFORE?/",
  "obj_jetpackchara_225": "* I ALREADY BAKED THE CAKE&  AHEAD OF TIME!!!!!&* SO FORGET IT!!!/%%",
  "obj_jetpackchara_301": "* Ring.../",
  "obj_jetpackchara_302": "\\TS \\E3 \\F6 \\TA %",
  "obj_jetpackchara_303": "* Wh-what!^1?&* Wh-why aren't you&  m-m-moving?/",
  "obj_jetpackchara_304": "* N-no...^1!&* I must not have&  added enough fuel!/",
  "obj_jetpackchara_305": "\\E8* D-darnit..^1.&* I'm sorry.../",
  "obj_jetpackchara_306": "* Even when it's&  something like&  this^1, I.../",
  "obj_jetpackchara_307": "* I still...^1!&* I still.../%%",
  "obj_jetpackchara_324": "* OH NO^1, WOULD YOU LOOK AT&  THAT!/",
  "obj_jetpackchara_325": "\\TS \\E3 \\F6 \\TA %",
  "obj_jetpackchara_326": "* What?/",
  "obj_jetpackchara_327": "\\TS \\E0 \\F0 \\TM %",
  "obj_jetpackchara_328": "* I FORGOT!&* RIGHT ABOUT NOW IS WHEN&  WE HAVE OUR COMMERCIAL BREAK!/",
  "obj_jetpackchara_329": "\\TS \\E3 \\F6 \\TA %",
  "obj_jetpackchara_330": "* Wh..^1.&* What are you...%",
  "obj_jetpackchara_331": "\\TS \\E0 \\F0 \\TM %",
  "obj_jetpackchara_332": "* UNFORTUNATELY, THAT MEANS&  NO ONE IS WATCHING THIS&  RIGHT NOW./",
  "obj_jetpackchara_333": "* I'M NOT GOING TO DESTROY&  YOU WITHOUT A LIVE&  TELEVISION AUDIENCE!!/",
  "obj_jetpackchara_334": "* LOOKS LIKE YOU'VE FOILED ME&  ONCE AGAIN, THANKS TO THE&  BRILLIANT DR. ALPHYS!!!/",
  "obj_jetpackchara_335": "* UNTIL NEXT TIME, BEAUTIFUL!/",
  "obj_jetpackchara_336": "* TOODLES!/%%",
  "obj_judgeshroom_91": "* hOIVS!/%%",
  "obj_judgeshroom_95": "* p..^1.&* tem heard human allergics&  to tem.../",
  "obj_judgeshroom_96": "* dat OK..^1.&* tem understan.../",
  "obj_judgeshroom_97": "* tem..^1.&* ALSO allergic to tem!!!/%%",
  "obj_judgeshroom_187": "* Mushroom danc^2e&* Mushroom danc^2e&* Whatever could it mean/%%",
  "obj_judgeshroom_211": "* It symbolizes my inner&  pain./%%",
  "obj_judgeshroom_213": "* It symbolizes my inner&  torment^1, trapped here&  by my hyphae./",
  "obj_judgeshroom_214": "* My struggle to pull away^1.&* My struggle to escape^1.&* But alas^1, to no avail./%%",
  "obj_judgeshroom_218": "* If only I could see the&  world above./",
  "obj_judgeshroom_219": "* But even if the barrier&  was open^1, how would I&  leave...?/%%",
  "obj_judgeshroom_224": "* It means you've lived a&  life of sin./%%",
  "obj_judgeshroom_226": "* It means..^1.&* Don't talk to me./%%",
  "obj_judgeshroom_231": "* It symbolizes my unbridled&  happiness./",
  "obj_judgeshroom_232": "* The government told me&  they are willing to&  transplant me outside!/",
  "obj_judgeshroom_233": "* Why didn't you smile at my&  dance^1? It almost feels&  a little rude.../%%",
  "obj_killerboysnightout_event_101": "* ... you're here./",
  "obj_killerboysnightout_event_102": "* So that means Undyne..^1.&* She's.../",
  "obj_killerboysnightout_event_103": "* Like^1, Undyne^1!&* We'll avenge you!/%%",
  "obj_killerlab_event_113": "* OH^1, THERE YOU ARE./",
  "obj_killerlab_event_114": "\\M5* YOU UGLY LITTLE CREATURE^1.&* YOU'VE MADE QUITE A NAME&  FOR YOURSELF./",
  "obj_killerlab_event_115": "\\M3* SUCH INFAMY...^1!&* I'M IMPRESSED./",
  "obj_killerlab_event_116": "\\M4* OH^1. YES^1.&* IF YOU'RE LOOKING FOR ALPHYS^1,&  SHE'S NOT HERE./",
  "obj_killerlab_event_117": "\\M0* WHILE YOU WERE BUSY DOING&  YOUR^1, AHEM^1, THING.../",
  "obj_killerlab_event_118": "* SHE WAS RUNNING AROUND&  EVACUATING PEOPLE TO SAFETY./",
  "obj_killerlab_event_119": "\\M4* NOW THEY'RE IN A PLACE&  WHERE YOU'LL NEVER GET TO&  THEM./",
  "obj_killerlab_event_120": "\\M2* DECIDING NOT TO FIGHT YOU^1.&* MY MY^1, SHE REALLY IS THE&  ONLY SMART ONE^1, ISN'T SHE?/%%",
  "obj_killerlab_event_151": "\\M0* OH^1?&* HOW SASSY./",
  "obj_killerlab_event_152": "\\M4* YOU'RE JUST ITCHING TO GET&  YOUR HANDS ON ME^1, AREN'T&  YOU?/",
  "obj_killerlab_event_153": "\\M5* WELL..^1. T-O-O B-A-D!/",
  "obj_killerlab_event_154": "\\M4* THIS WORLD NEEDS STARS MORE&  THAN IT NEEDS CORPSES!/",
  "obj_killerlab_event_155": "\\M1* TOODLES!/%%",
  "obj_kitchenforcefield_123": "* (As per culinary standard^1,&  a death forcefield surrounds&  the kitchen.)/%%",
  "obj_kitchenforcefield_124": "* (As per journalistic standards^1,&  a death forcefield surrounds&  the area of intrigue.)/%%",
  "obj_kitchenforcefield_125": "* (It's the kind of every-day&  death forcefield you see&  at home.)/%%",
  "obj_kitchenforcefield_126": "* (It's a forcefield.)/%%",
  "obj_kitchenforcefield_127": "* (It's a battery-powered&  forcefield.)/%%",
  "obj_kitchenforcefield_128": "* (It's a forcefield.)/%%",
  "obj_knock_room_62": "%%",
  "obj_knock_room_65": "* (Doesn't seem like&  anyone's home.)/%%",
  "obj_knock_room_67": "* (If someone's there^1,&  they aren't answering&  the door.)/%%",
  "obj_knock_room_69": "* (No one is home.^1)&* (And you get the feeling&  no one ever will be.)/%%",
  "obj_knock_room_71": "* (You hear irritated groans&  from the inside.)/%%",
  "obj_knock_room_75": "* (Sounds like only fire&  lives here now.)/%%",
  "obj_knock_room_81": "* Who's there^1?&* I'm in the middle of&  my favorite TV program./",
  "obj_knock_room_82": "* I know^1, I know..^1.&* Staring at a screen...&* Sounds like a boring hobby./",
  "obj_knock_room_83": "* But TV offers an escape&  to another world^1.&* We really need that./%%",
  "obj_knock_room_86": "* You wanna watch too^1?&* Sorry^1, this is a one-player&  TV show./%%",
  "obj_knock_room_91": "* Ahh^1, what a beautiful knock..^1.!&* Maybe if I don't answer^1,&  I'll hear it again./%%",
  "obj_knock_room_93": "* Ahh^1, my patience rewards me./%%",
  "obj_knock_room_95": "* Ahh.../%%",
  "obj_knock_room_99": "* (No answer.)/%%",
  "obj_knock_room_113": "* (No answer.)/%%",
  "obj_lab_powerswitch_218": "* Hey^1!&* Stop!!!/%%",
  "obj_lab_powerswitch_258": "* I got you guys some&  food^1, okay!?/%%",
  "obj_lab_powerswitch_294": "\\E4* Sorry about that.../",
  "obj_lab_powerswitch_295": "\\E2* They get kind of sassy&  when they don't get&  fed on time./",
  "obj_lab_powerswitch_296": "\\E3* Um!!/",
  "obj_lab_powerswitch_299": "\\E3* I think they smelled&  the potato chips you&  had^1, and.../",
  "obj_lab_powerswitch_301": "\\E3* Anyway!/",
  "obj_lab_powerswitch_302": "\\E6* The power went out^1,&  and I've been trying&  to turn it back on!/",
  "obj_lab_powerswitch_303": "\\E4* But it seems like you&  were one step ahead&  of me./",
  "obj_lab_powerswitch_304": "\\E2* This was probably just&  a big inconvenience&  for you.../",
  "obj_lab_powerswitch_305": "\\E4* B-but I appreciate&  that you came here&  to back me up!/",
  "obj_lab_powerswitch_306": "\\E4* As I said^1, I was&  afraid I might.../",
  "obj_lab_powerswitch_307": "\\E8* Not come back.../",
  "obj_lab_powerswitch_308": "\\E5* But that's not because&  of these guys or&  anything!/",
  "obj_lab_powerswitch_309": "\\E4* I was just worried I&  would be too afraid.../",
  "obj_lab_powerswitch_310": "\\E9* To tell the truth.../",
  "obj_lab_powerswitch_311": "\\E8* That I might run away^1,&  or do something.../",
  "obj_lab_powerswitch_312": "\\E9* Cowardly./",
  "obj_lab_powerswitch_313": "* .../",
  "obj_lab_powerswitch_314": "*\\E8 Uh..^1. I..^1.&* I suppose I owe you&  an explanation./",
  "obj_lab_powerswitch_315": "\\E9* As you probably know^1,&  ASGORE asked me to study&  the nature of SOULs./",
  "obj_lab_powerswitch_316": "\\E3* During my research^1, I&  isolated a power I&  called \"determination.\"/",
  "obj_lab_powerswitch_317": "\\E6* I injected it into dying&  monsters so their SOULs&  would last after death./",
  "obj_lab_powerswitch_318": "\\E9* But the experiment&  failed./",
  "obj_lab_powerswitch_319": "* You see^1, unlike humans',&  monsters' bodies don't&  have enough.../",
  "obj_lab_powerswitch_320": "* Physical matter to take&  those concentrations&  of \"determination.\"/",
  "obj_lab_powerswitch_321": "* Their bodies started to&  melt^1, and lost what&  physicality they had./",
  "obj_lab_powerswitch_322": "\\E3* Pretty soon^1, all of the&  test subjects had melted&  together into.../",
  "obj_lab_powerswitch_323": "\\E8* Those./",
  "obj_lab_powerswitch_324": "\\E9* Seeing them like this^1,&  I knew.../",
  "obj_lab_powerswitch_325": "\\E8* I couldn't tell their&  families about it./",
  "obj_lab_powerswitch_326": "\\E8* I couldn't tell anyone&  about it./",
  "obj_lab_powerswitch_327": "\\E9* No matter how much&  everyone was asking me./",
  "obj_lab_powerswitch_328": "\\E9* And I was too afraid to&  do any more work^1,&  knowing.../",
  "obj_lab_powerswitch_329": "\\E8* ... everything I'd done&  so far had been such&  a horrific failure./",
  "obj_lab_powerswitch_330": "\\E9* ... but now./",
  "obj_lab_powerswitch_331": "\\E9* Now^1, I've changed my&  mind about all this./",
  "obj_lab_powerswitch_332": "\\E9* I'm going to tell&  everyone what I've done./",
  "obj_lab_powerswitch_333": "\\E9* .../",
  "obj_lab_powerswitch_335": "* It's going to be hard./",
  "obj_lab_powerswitch_336": "* Being honest..^1.&* Believing in myself.../",
  "obj_lab_powerswitch_337": "* I'm sure there will be&  times where I'll&  struggle./",
  "obj_lab_powerswitch_338": "* I'm sure there will be&  times where I screw&  up again./",
  "obj_lab_powerswitch_339": "\\E0* But knowing^1, deep down^1,&  that I have friends&  to fall back on.../",
  "obj_lab_powerswitch_340": "\\E7* I know it'll be a&  lot easier to stand&  on my own./",
  "obj_lab_powerswitch_341": "* Thank you./%%",
  "obj_lab_powerswitch_406": "* Come on^1, guys./",
  "obj_lab_powerswitch_407": "* It's time for everyone&  to go home./%%",
  "obj_labelevator_a_242": " WARNING! WARNING^6!%",
  "obj_labelevator_a_243": " ELEVATOR LOSING POWER^6!%",
  "obj_labelevator_a_244": " EM TETHER STABILITY LOST^6!%",
  "obj_labelevator_a_245": " ALTITUDE DROPPING^6!%%",
  "obj_labelevator_b_122": "* (Ring...)/",
  "obj_labelevator_b_123": "* (It's a voice you have&  never heard before.)/%%",
  "obj_labelevator_b_131": "* \\[C]..^1.&* Are you there?/",
  "obj_labelevator_b_132": "* It's been a long time^1,&  hasn't it...?/",
  "obj_labelevator_b_133": "* But you've done well./",
  "obj_labelevator_b_134": "* Thanks to you^1, everything&  has fallen into place./",
  "obj_labelevator_b_135": "* \\[C].../",
  "obj_labelevator_b_136": "* See you soon./%%",
  "obj_labtv_event_94": "* (There's a VHS player with a&  few tapes picked out beside&  it...)/",
  "obj_labtv_event_95": "* (They seem to be labelled&  in a specific order.)/",
  "obj_labtv_event_96": "* (Will you watch one...?)/%%",
  "obj_labtv_event_98": "* (Choose a tape to watch.)/%%",
  "obj_labtv_event_287": "* Psssst^1.&* Gorey^1, wake up. \\Ta/",
  "obj_labtv_event_288": "* Mmm^1?&* What is it^1, dear?/",
  "obj_labtv_event_289": "* ... err^1, and why do you&  have that video camera? \\TT/",
  "obj_labtv_event_290": "* Shush^1!&* I want to get your&  reaction./",
  "obj_labtv_event_291": "* Gorey^1, dearest^1.&* What is my favorite&  vegetable?\\Ta/",
  "obj_labtv_event_292": "* Hmmm..^1.&* Carrots^1, right?\\TT/",
  "obj_labtv_event_293": "* No no no^1!&* My FAVORITE vegetable is.../",
  "obj_labtv_event_294": "* Eda-MOM-e./",
  "obj_labtv_event_295": "* ... get it???\\Ta/",
  "obj_labtv_event_296": "* .../",
  "obj_labtv_event_297": "* Go back to bed^1, dear.\\TT/",
  "obj_labtv_event_298": "* No no!^1!&* Not yet^1!&* Hee hee hee./",
  "obj_labtv_event_299": "* Now^1, If I were a dog^1,&  what breed of dog would&  I be?\\Ta/",
  "obj_labtv_event_300": "* Hmmm..^1. I don't know^1, honey^1.&* What kind of dog would&  you be?\\TT/",
  "obj_labtv_event_301": "* I would be.../",
  "obj_labtv_event_302": "* A MOMERANIAN.\\Ta/",
  "obj_labtv_event_303": "* Hohoho!/",
  "obj_labtv_event_304": "* You sure are excited to&  have this child./",
  "obj_labtv_event_305": "* You know^1, if you keep&  making jokes like&  this.../",
  "obj_labtv_event_306": "* One day^1, you could be.../",
  "obj_labtv_event_307": "* ... a famous MOMedian.\\TT/",
  "obj_labtv_event_308": "* .../",
  "obj_labtv_event_309": "* Well^1, I am going to bed.\\Ta/",
  "obj_labtv_event_310": "* Hey^1!&* Come on^1, Tori^1!&* That one was funny!\\TT/",
  "obj_labtv_event_311": "* Hahaha^1, I know^1.&* I am just teasing you./",
  "obj_labtv_event_312": "* Goodnight^1, dear.\\Ta/",
  "obj_labtv_event_313": "* Goodnight, honey.\\TT/",
  "obj_labtv_event_314": "* .../",
  "obj_labtv_event_315": "* Oh dear^1, perhaps it is too&  dark in here for the&  video to come out.../%%",
  "obj_labtv_event_350": "* Okay^1, \\[C]^1, are you ready?/",
  "obj_labtv_event_351": "* Do your creepy face!/",
  "obj_labtv_event_352": "* AHHHHH!^1!&* Hee hee hee!/",
  "obj_labtv_event_353": "* Oh^1!&* Wait^1!&* I had the lens cap on.../",
  "obj_labtv_event_354": "* What!^1?&* You're not gonna do it&  again...?/",
  "obj_labtv_event_355": "* Come on^1, quit tricking me^1!&* Haha!/%%",
  "obj_labtv_event_391": "* Howdy^1, \\[C]^1!&* Smile for the camera!/",
  "obj_labtv_event_392": "* Ha^1, this time I got YOU^1!&* I left the cap on..^1.&* ON PURPOSE!/",
  "obj_labtv_event_393": "* Now you're smiling for&  noooo reason^1!&* Hee hee hee!/",
  "obj_labtv_event_394": "* What^1?&* Oh^1, yeah^1, I remember./",
  "obj_labtv_event_395": "* When we tried to make&  butterscotch pie for Dad^1,&  right?/",
  "obj_labtv_event_396": "* The recipe asked for cups&  of butter.../",
  "obj_labtv_event_397": "* But we accidentally put&  in buttercups instead./",
  "obj_labtv_event_398": "* Yeah^1!&* Those flowers got him&  really sick./",
  "obj_labtv_event_399": "* I felt so bad^1.&* We made Mom really upset./",
  "obj_labtv_event_400": "* I should have laughed it&  off^1, like you did.../",
  "obj_labtv_event_401": "* Um^1, anyway^1, where are you&  going with this?/",
  "obj_labtv_event_402": "* Huh^1?&* Turn off the camera...^1?&* OK./%%",
  "obj_labtv_event_435": "* I..^1. I don't like this idea^1,&  \\[C]./",
  "obj_labtv_event_436": "* Wh.^1. what^1?&* N-no, I'm not.../",
  "obj_labtv_event_437": "* ... big kids don't cry./",
  "obj_labtv_event_438": "* Yeah^1, you're right./",
  "obj_labtv_event_439": "* No^1!&* I'd never doubt you^1, \\[C]..^1.&* Never!/",
  "obj_labtv_event_440": "* Y..^1. yeah^1!&* We'll be strong^1!&* We'll free everyone./",
  "obj_labtv_event_441": "* I'll go get the flowers./%%",
  "obj_labtv_event_473": "* \\[C]..^1.&* Can you hear me^1?&* We want you to wake up...\\Ta/",
  "obj_labtv_event_474": "* \\[C]^1!&* You have to stay determined!/",
  "obj_labtv_event_475": "* You can't give up..^1.&* You are the future of humans&  and monsters...\\TR/",
  "obj_labtv_event_476": "* .../",
  "obj_labtv_event_477": "* Psst... \\[C]..^1.&* Please..^1. wake up.../",
  "obj_labtv_event_478": "* I don't like this plan&  anymore./",
  "obj_labtv_event_479": "* I..^1. I.../",
  "obj_labtv_event_480": "* ..^1. no^1, I said..^1.&* I said I'd never doubt you./",
  "obj_labtv_event_481": "* Six^1, right^1?&* We just have to get six.../",
  "obj_labtv_event_482": "* And we'll do it together^1,&  right?/%%",
  "obj_ladiesfishingrod_137": "* You send the line back out./%%",
  "obj_laserswitch1_90": "* (Didn't work.)/%%",
  "obj_laserswitch1_119": "* Ring.../",
  "obj_laserswitch1_120": "\\TS \\E3 \\F6 \\TA %",
  "obj_laserswitch1_121": "\\E3* H-hey^1, watch out^1!&* You're going to get&  really hurt!/",
  "obj_laserswitch1_122": "\\E8* I can't watch this^1.&* I'm disabling the&  lasers./%%",
  "obj_laserswitch1_161": "\\TS \\E3 \\F6 \\TA %",
  "obj_laserswitch1_162": "\\E6* Th..^1. there./",
  "obj_laserswitch1_163": "\\E3* Be careful^1, okay?/",
  "obj_laserswitch1_164": "\\E8* .../",
  "obj_laserswitch1_165": "\\E8* I-I'm sorry^1, it's&  m-my fault you&  got hurt./",
  "obj_laserswitch1_166": "\\E8* I didn't explain the&  lasers well enough^1,&  and../",
  "obj_laserswitch1_167": "\\E8* If I hadn't..^1.&* If I hadn't..^1./",
  "obj_laserswitch1_168": "\\E4* Um^1, delayed using&  my hacking skills^1,&  I mean.../",
  "obj_laserswitch1_169": "\\E8* ... sorry./",
  "obj_laserswitch1_170": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "obj_laserswitch1_171": "* Click.../%%",
  "obj_laserswitch1_174": "\\E8* I-I'm sorry^1, it's&  m-my fault you&  got hurt./",
  "obj_laserswitch1_175": "\\E8* I didn't explain the&  lasers well enough^1,&  and.../",
  "obj_laserswitch1_176": "\\E3* O-oh^1, there's no&  time for this now!/",
  "obj_laserswitch1_177": "\\E8* Sorry./",
  "obj_laserswitch1_178": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
  "obj_laserswitch1_179": "* Click.../%%",
  "obj_lastbeam_230": "STOP IT!!",
  "obj_lastbeam_255": "STOP IT NOW!!!",
  "obj_lastbeam_296": "* ...",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_187": "* So you finally made it./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_188": "* The end of your journey&  is at hand./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_189": "* In a few moments^1, you&  will meet the king./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_190": "* Together.../",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_191": "* You will determine the&  future of this world./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_192": "* That's then./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_193": "* Now./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_194": "* You will be judged./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_195": "* You will be judged for&  your every action./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_196": "* You will be judged for&  every EXP you've earned./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_197": "* What's EXP?/",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_198": "* It's an acronym./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_199": "\\W* It stands for \"\\Rexecution&  points\\W.\"/",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_200": "* A way of quantifying the&  pain you have inflicted on&  others./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_201": "* When you kill someone^1,&  your EXP increases./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_202": "* When you have enough EXP^1,&  your LOVE increases./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_203": "* LOVE^1, too^1, is an&  acronym./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_204": "\\W* It stands for \"\\RLevel of&  Violence\\W.\"/",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_205": "* A way of measuring someone's&  capacity to hurt./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_206": "* The more you kill^1, the&  easier it becomes to&  distance yourself./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_207": "* The more you distance&  yourself^1, the less you&  will hurt./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_208": "* The more easily you&  can bring yourself to&  hurt others./%%",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_214": "* So you finally made it.../%%",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_243": "* Now^1, you understand./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_244": "* It's time to begin your&  judgment./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_245": "* Look inside yourself./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_246": "* Have you really done the&  right thing?/",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_247": "* And^1, considering what&  you've done.../",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_248": "* What will you do now?/",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_249": "* Take a moment to think&  about this./%%",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_268": "\\TS* .../",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_269": "\\Ts*\\E0 ... but you^1.&* you never gained&  any LOVE./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_270": "\\E1* 'course^1, that doesn't&  mean you're completely&  innocent or naive./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_271": "\\E0* just that you kept&  a certain tenderness&  in your heart./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_274": "* no matter the struggles&  or hardships you&  faced.../",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_275": "* you strived to do the&  right thing./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_276": "* you refused to hurt&  anyone./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_277": "* even when you ran&  away^1, you did it&  with a smile./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_278": "* you never gained LOVE^1,&  but you gained love./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_279": "* does that make sense?/",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_280": "* maybe not./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_283": "\\E3* ..^1.&* now./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_284": "\\E0* you're about to face&  the greatest challenge&  of your entire journey./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_285": "* your actions here.../",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_286": "* will determine the&  fate of the entire&  world./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_287": "* if you refuse to&  fight.../",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_288": "* asgore will take&  your soul and&  destroy humanity./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_289": "* but if you kill&  asgore and go&  home.../",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_290": "* monsters will remain&  trapped underground./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_291": "* what will you do?/",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_292": "\\E3* .../",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_293": "* well^1, if i were you^1,&  i would have thrown&  in the towel by now./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_294": "\\E1* but you didn't get&  this far by giving&  up^1, did you?/",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_295": "\\E0* that's right./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_296": "* you have something&  called \"determination.\"/",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_297": "* so as long as you&  hold on.../",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_298": "* so as long as you&  do what's in your&  heart.../",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_299": "* i believe you can do&  the right thing./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_300": "\\E3* alright./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_301": "\\E0* we're all counting&  on you, kid./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_302": "\\E2* good luck./%%",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_361": "\\TS* .../",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_362": "\\Ts*\\E0 truthfully^1, it doesn't&  really matter what you&  said./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_363": "\\E0* all that's important is&  that you were honest&  with yourself./",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_364": "* what happens now.../",
  "obj_lastsans_trigger_365": "* we leave up to you./%%",
