  "obj_lesserdoge_433": "* Lesser Dog tucks its tail&  between its legs.",
  "obj_lesserdoge_449": "* LESSER DOG - ATK 12 DEF 2&* Wields a stone dogger made&  of pomer-granite./^",
  "obj_lesserdoge_457": "* You barely lifted your&  hand and Lesser Dog&  got excited./^",
  "obj_lesserdoge_458": "* You lightly touched the&  Dog^1.&* It's already overexcited.../^",
  "obj_lesserdoge_459": "* You pet the Dog.&* It raises its head up&  to meet your hand./^",
  "obj_lesserdoge_460": "* You pet the Dog.&* It was a good Dog./^",
  "obj_lesserdoge_461": "* You pet the Dog.&* Its excitement knows no&  bounds./^",
  "obj_lesserdoge_462": "* Critical pet!&* Dog excitement increased./^",
  "obj_lesserdoge_463": "* You have to jump up&  to pet the Dog./^",
  "obj_lesserdoge_464": "* You don't even pet it^1.&* It gets more excited./^",
  "obj_lesserdoge_465": "* There is no way to&  stop this madness./^",
  "obj_lesserdoge_466": "* Lesser Dog enters the&  realm of the clouds./^",
  "obj_lesserdoge_467": "* You call the Dog but it&  is too late^1.&* It cannot hear you./^",
  "obj_lesserdoge_468": "* .../^",
  "obj_lesserdoge_469": "* You can reach Lesser Dog&  again./^",
