  "obj_lesserdoge_472": "* Lesser Dog is unpettable&  but appreciates the attempt./^",
  "obj_lesserdoge_473": "* Perhaps mankind was not&  meant to pet this much./^",
  "obj_lesserdoge_474": "* It continues./^",
  "obj_lesserdoge_475": "* Lesser Dog is beyond&  your reach./^",
  "obj_lesserdoge_476": "* Really.../^",
