  "obj_librarynpc_jumbler_73": "* That look in your eye.../",
  "obj_librarynpc_jumbler_74": "* You're someone that has&  difficulty solving Junior&  Jumble^1, aren't you?/%%",
  "obj_librarynpc_jumbler_78": "* That look in your eye.../",
  "obj_librarynpc_jumbler_79": "* You're someone that has&  trouble doing crosswords^1,&  aren't you?/%%",
  "obj_librarynpc_jumbler_84": "* That look in your eye.../",
  "obj_librarynpc_jumbler_85": "* You think Sudoku is just&  moderately challenging^1,&  don't you?/%%",
  "obj_librarynpc_jumbler_92": "* The greatest struggle of&  my life is over.../",
  "obj_librarynpc_jumbler_93": "* I just solved today's&  Junior Jumble./%%",
  "obj_librarynpc_jumbler_97": "* The greatest struggle of&  my life is over.../",
  "obj_librarynpc_jumbler_98": "* I just solved today's&  crossword./%%",
