  "obj_mainend_984": "\\E3* so.^1.&* it's been a while./",
  "obj_mainend_985": "* since you left.../",
  "obj_mainend_986": "\\E1* things have gotten&  really strange./",
  "obj_mainend_987": "\\E0* overnight^1, a bunch of&  people mysteriously&  disappeared./",
  "obj_mainend_988": "\\E3* as well as the&  human souls./",
  "obj_mainend_989": "\\E3* people were heart-&  broken. everyone they&  looked up to.../",
  "obj_mainend_990": "* everything they were&  relying on^1, in one&  night, disappeared./",
  "obj_mainend_991": "* everyone clamored to&  elect a new ruler as&  fast as possible./",
  "obj_mainend_992": "\\E1* so^1, uh..^1.&* by process of&  elimination.../",
  "obj_mainend_993": "\\E2* papyrus became the&  ruler?/",
  "obj_mainend_994": "\\E1* why doesn't he talk&  to you about this.../",
  "obj_mainend_996": "\\E0HELLO!!^1!&HUMAN!!!/",
  "obj_mainend_997": "\\E3IT'S STRANGE./",
  "obj_mainend_998": "\\E3ASGORE^1, ALPHYS^1,&METTATON^1, AND&UNDYNE WENT AWAY./",
  "obj_mainend_999": "\\E0SANS SAYS THEY&WENT ON VACATION./",
  "obj_mainend_1000": "I HOPE THEY'RE&HAVING FUN!!!/",
  "obj_mainend_1001": "\\E3OH YEAH./",
  "obj_mainend_1002": "\\E0I'M THE RULER OF&THE UNDERGROUND&NOW!!!/",
  "obj_mainend_1003": "EVERYTHING IS&IMPROVING A LOT&HERE./",
  "obj_mainend_1004": "PRODUCTIVITY IS UP!/",
  "obj_mainend_1005": "BECAUSE I TELL&EVERYONE TO KEEP&WORKING./",
  "obj_mainend_1006": "AND^1, NO ONE GOES&HUNGRY!!!/",
  "obj_mainend_1007": "BECAUSE I COOK&EVERYONE&SPAGHETTI./",
  "obj_mainend_1008": "\\E3MEANWHILE^1, MY&BROTHER HANDLES&THE PAPERWORK./",
  "obj_mainend_1009": "\\E3STRANGELY..^1.&HE SEEMS TO BE&WORKING HARD?/",
  "obj_mainend_1010": "\\E3THIS SOUNDS MESSED&UP..^1. BUT.../",
  "obj_mainend_1011": "\\E5I'M PROUD..^1.&OF HIM???/",
  "obj_mainend_1012": "OH NO!!!!/",
  "obj_mainend_1013": "\\E0AS FOR OUR HUMAN&POLICY.../",
  "obj_mainend_1014": "\\E3WE'VE DECIDED^1, UM./",
  "obj_mainend_1015": "SANS^1, WHAT WAS IT?/",
  "obj_mainend_1017": "\\E2* we can't judge&  humans to be all&  good or all bad./",
  "obj_mainend_1019": "\\E0RIGHT^1!&SO IT'S CASE-BY-&CASE!/",
  "obj_mainend_1020": "IF THEY'RE EVIL..^1.&WE GIVE THEM&PUZZLES!/",
  "obj_mainend_1021": "IF THEY'RE GOOD..^1.&WE ALSO GIVE&THEM PUZZLES!/",
  "obj_mainend_1022": "THAT SEEMS TO BE&THE BEST WAY!/",
  "obj_mainend_1023": "\\E0.../",
  "obj_mainend_1024": "\\E3.../",
  "obj_mainend_1025": "IS SANS GONE?/",
  "obj_mainend_1026": "\\E6YOU KNOW.../",
  "obj_mainend_1027": "DON'T TELL MY&BROTHER, BUT.../",
  "obj_mainend_1028": "DESPITE THE&IMPROVEMENTS&WE'VE MADE.../",
  "obj_mainend_1029": "SOMETIMES THIS JOB&IS KIND OF HARD./",
  "obj_mainend_1030": "SINCE THE KING&WENT AWAY.../",
  "obj_mainend_1031": "LOTS OF PEOPLE&JUST WANT TO&GIVE UP./",
  "obj_mainend_1032": "SOMETIMES, EVEN MY&BEST&ENCOURAGEMENT.../",
  "obj_mainend_1033": "DOESN'T WORK./",
  "obj_mainend_1034": "AND^1, AND^1, I MISS&UNDYNE^1, TOO./",
  "obj_mainend_1035": "SHE NEVER ANSWERS&MY PHONE CALLS.../",
  "obj_mainend_1036": "\\E5SHE MUST BE& HAVING A LOT OF&FUN ON VACATION./",
  "obj_mainend_1037": "\\E6I JUST WISH SHE'D&SEND A POSTCARD./",
  "obj_mainend_1038": ".../",
  "obj_mainend_1039": "\\E5BUT HEY!!!/",
  "obj_mainend_1040": "\\E4I WON'T GIVE UP!/",
  "obj_mainend_1041": "I CAN'T GIVE UP!/",
  "obj_mainend_1042": "I HAVE TO MAKE&EVERYONE GIVE UP&GIVING UP!/",
  "obj_mainend_1043": "\\E0WE'LL GET OUT&OF HERE^1, SLOWLY!!!/",
  "obj_mainend_1044": "THEN WE CAN ALL&HANG OUT AGAIN!!!/",
  "obj_mainend_1045": "\\E0NYEH HEH HEH!!!/%%",
  "obj_mainend_1055": "\\E3* it's been a while^1,&  huh?/",
  "obj_mainend_1056": "* .../",
  "obj_mainend_1057": "* things have gotten&  pretty bad here./",
  "obj_mainend_1058": "\\E0* everyone considered a&  leader disappeared&  overnight./",
  "obj_mainend_1059": "\\E1* it's gotten so quiet./",
  "obj_mainend_1060": "\\E3* there's a bad feeling&  hanging over&  everyone./",
  "obj_mainend_1061": "* like everyone's just&  going to die here^1,&  trapped in the dark.../",
  "obj_mainend_1062": "\\E2* ... i bet you're&  wondering why i'm&  not the ruler./",
  "obj_mainend_1063": "\\E1* eh./",
  "obj_mainend_1064": "\\E1* i'm not cut out&  for something like&  that./",
  "obj_mainend_1065": "\\E2* i like to take it&  easy^1, you know?/",
  "obj_mainend_1066": "\\E2* .../",
  "obj_mainend_1067": "\\E3* ... that's a joke./",
  "obj_mainend_1068": "\\E3* this is what happens&  when people like me&  take it easy./",
  "obj_mainend_1069": "* .../",
  "obj_mainend_1070": "\\E4* see ya./%%",
  "obj_mainend_1074": "\\E0* hey^1, at least things&  are less crowded./",
  "obj_mainend_1075": "\\E1* 'cause of all the&  people you killed./",
  "obj_mainend_1076": "\\E2* hope that was a good&  experience for you./",
  "obj_mainend_1077": "\\E3* .../",
  "obj_mainend_1078": "\\E2* just kidding^1.&* i don't really hope&  that./",
  "obj_mainend_1079": "\\E4* go to hell./%%",
  "obj_mainend_1092": "\\E3* it's been a while^1,&  huh?/",
  "obj_mainend_1093": "* .../",
  "obj_mainend_1094": "\\E1* it seems a number of&  important people&  disappeared overnight./",
  "obj_mainend_1095": "* but no one else was&  harmed./",
  "obj_mainend_1096": "\\E0* the people were&  confused^1.&* it was complete bedlam./",
  "obj_mainend_1097": "\\E3* somehow^1, at the end of&  the day.../",
  "obj_mainend_1098": "\\E1* a small^1, white dog&  became president of&  the underground./",
  "obj_mainend_1099": "\\E0* it sleeps on the&  throne and does&  absolutely nothing./",
  "obj_mainend_1100": "\\E1* strangely^1, it seems&  this is the best&  life for everyone./",
  "obj_mainend_1101": "\\E2* thanks./%%",
  "obj_mainend_1112": "\\E3* it's been a while^1,&  huh?/",
  "obj_mainend_1113": "* .../",
  "obj_mainend_1114": "\\E1* i'll be honest./",
  "obj_mainend_1115": "\\E2* i have no idea what&  happened for you&  to get here./",
  "obj_mainend_1116": "\\E1* this is actually some&  sort of error-&  handling message./",
  "obj_mainend_1117": "\\E3* so^1, if you're getting&  this ending.../",
  "obj_mainend_1118": "\\E1* tell whoever made the&  game^1, okay?/",
  "obj_mainend_1119": "\\E2* they'll fix it^1, or&  if it's a novel&  situation.../",
  "obj_mainend_1120": "\\E1* they might even add&  another ending to&  the game./",
  "obj_mainend_1121": "\\E3* chances are^1, though.../",
  "obj_mainend_1122": "\\E4* you're just a dirty&  hacker^1, aren't you?/",
  "obj_mainend_1123": "\\E1* yeah^1, get outta here./%%",
  "obj_mainend_1136": "\\E1* H..^1. hey./",
  "obj_mainend_1137": "\\E0* So..^1. you're the one&  who killed all my&  friends./",
  "obj_mainend_1139": "\\E1* I just called to tell&  you./",
  "obj_mainend_1141": "\\E0* I hate you./",
  "obj_mainend_1143": "\\E1* Yet..^1. strangely..^1.&* It's because of you^1,&  that.../",
  "obj_mainend_1145": "\\E2* That I was forced to&  become a better&  person./",
  "obj_mainend_1147": "\\E0* When I first saw you&  hurting people.../",
  "obj_mainend_1148": "* I just sat there^1.&* Watching you./",
  "obj_mainend_1149": "\\E1* I felt so guilty knowing&  I hadn't do anything&  to stop you./",
  "obj_mainend_1150": "\\E3* I felt like all I&  do was.../",
  "obj_mainend_1151": "\\E4* Was hope you would&  destroy me^1, too./",
  "obj_mainend_1152": "\\E1* But when Undyne called^1,&  with crazed desperation&  in her voice.../",
  "obj_mainend_1153": "\\E0* I..^1.&* I realized I had to do&  something./",
  "obj_mainend_1154": "\\E1* Even if it meant&  everybody would.../",
  "obj_mainend_1155": "* Have to learn the&  truth about me./",
  "obj_mainend_1156": "\\E2* It's strange^1.&* You know?/",
  "obj_mainend_1157": "\\E5* Even after all the&  bad things I did./",
  "obj_mainend_1158": "* People treated me like&  a hero./",
  "obj_mainend_1159": "\\E2* And then they..^1.&* Asked me to run&  everything./",
  "obj_mainend_1160": "\\E5* So I'm trying my&  best^1, here./",
  "obj_mainend_1161": "\\E2* I think I have some&  good policies^1, but^1,&  y-you know.../",
  "obj_mainend_1162": "\\E1* Talking to people&  still makes me&  nervous./",
  "obj_mainend_1163": "\\E0* I'm no ASGORE^1,&  you know?/",
  "obj_mainend_1164": "\\E2* .../",
  "obj_mainend_1165": "\\E4* God..^1.&* I miss everyone./",
  "obj_mainend_1166": "\\E3* Now that they're&  gone^1, it.../",
  "obj_mainend_1167": "* It feels so clear what&  I should have done./",
  "obj_mainend_1168": "\\E3* What I should have&  said./",
  "obj_mainend_1169": "\\E6* Undyne..^1.&* Asgore.../",
  "obj_mainend_1170": "* Mettaton.../",
  "obj_mainend_1171": "\\E5* At least Sans is&  still here./",
  "obj_mainend_1172": "\\E4* He's..^1.&* He's a good guy^1.&* And with him around.../",
  "obj_mainend_1173": "\\E4* I.../",
  "obj_mainend_1174": "\\E2* Sigh./",
  "obj_mainend_1175": "\\E1* You know^1.&* Just daydreaming here^1.&* But.../",
  "obj_mainend_1176": "\\E5* I really should have&  killed you when I&  had the chance./%%",
  "obj_mandog_251": "Take my&wife...&'s fleas.",
  "obj_mandog_252": "Don't&touch my&hot dog.",
  "obj_mandog_253": "No. 2&Nuzzle&Champs&'98!!",
  "obj_mandog_254": "Let's&kick&human&tail!!",
  "obj_mandog_259": "Hm?&What's&that&smell?",
  "obj_mandog_260": "What!&Smells&like a&...",
  "obj_mandog_264": "Paws off&you&smelly&human.",
  "obj_mandog_267": "Wow!!!&Pet by&another&pup!!!",
  "obj_mandog_272": "Stop!&Don't&touch&her!",
  "obj_mandog_273": "What&about&me......&........",
  "obj_mandog_280": "Whine.",
  "obj_mandog_281": "Whimper.",
  "obj_mandog_284": "%%%",
  "obj_mandog_474": "* Dogamy is brokenhearted.",
  "obj_mandog_490": "* DOGAMY - ATK 14 DEF 5&* Husband of Dogaressa.&* Knows only what he smells./^",
  "obj_mandog_498": "* The Dogs sniff you again.../",
  "obj_mandog_499": "* But you smell just as&  weird as before!/^",
  "obj_mandog_500": "* The Dogs sniff you again.../",
  "obj_mandog_501": "* After rolling in the dirt^1,&  you smell all right!/^",
  "obj_mandog_502": "* The Dogs already know you&  smell fine./^",
  "obj_mandog_503": "* Dogamy won't even lift&  up his snout./^",
  "obj_mandog_513": "* Dogamy just growls at&  you./^",
  "obj_mandog_516": "* The Dogs are too suspicious&  of your smell./^",
  "obj_mandog_517": "* You pet Dogamy./^",
  "obj_mandog_527": "* You roll around in the&  dirt and snow./",
  "obj_mandog_528": "* You smell like a weird&  puppy./^",
  "obj_memoryhead_166": "Come&join&the&fun.",
  "obj_memoryhead_167": "It's a&real&get&together",
  "obj_memoryhead_168": "Lorem&ipsum&docet",
  "obj_memoryhead_169": "Become&one of&us!",
  "obj_memoryhead_171": "Come&join&the&fun.",
  "obj_memoryhead_181": "That's&a&shame.",
  "obj_memoryhead_182": "Oh&well.",
  "obj_memoryhead_183": "Be&seeing&you.",
  "obj_memoryhead_188": "Then,&hold&still.",
  "obj_memoryhead_189": "Just&a&moment.",
  "obj_memoryhead_190": "You'll&be with&us&shortly.",
  "obj_memoryhead_195": "%%%",
  "obj_memoryhead_420": "* But nobody came.",
  "obj_memoryhead_421": "* But nobody came.",
  "obj_memoryhead_422": "* But nobody came.",
  "obj_memoryhead_423": "* But nobody came.",
  "obj_memoryhead_424": "* Smells like batteries.",
  "obj_memoryhead_425": "* Seems like it doesn't&  care anymore.",
  "obj_memoryhead_426": "* Monster has low HP.",
  "obj_memoryhead_461": "* No data available./^",
  "obj_memoryhead_472": "* The enemy put a piece of&  itself in your inventory./^",
  "obj_memoryhead_474": "* But your inventory was full./^",
  "obj_memoryhead_484": "* AT - \\[1] DF - \\[2] /^",
  "obj_memoryhead_493": "* You take out your CELL PHONE^1.&* You can hear voices through&  the receiver...!/^",
  "obj_memoryhead_511": "* MEMORYHEAD/^",
  "obj_mett_bossintro_174": "Ohhhh my./",
  "obj_mett_bossintro_175": "If you flipped my&switch, that can&only mean one&thing./",
  "obj_mett_bossintro_176": "You're desperate&for the premiere&of my new body./",
  "obj_mett_bossintro_177": "How rude.../",
  "obj_mett_bossintro_178": "Lucky for you,&I've been aching&to show this off&for a long time./",
  "obj_mett_bossintro_179": "So..^1. as thanks^1,&I'll give you a&handsome reward./",
  "obj_mett_bossintro_180": "I'll make your&last living&moments.../%%",
  "obj_mett_bossintro_213": "ABSOLUTELY beautiful!/%%",
  "obj_mettaton_neo_449": "* Stage lights are blaring.",
  "obj_mettaton_neo_461": "* Stage lights are blaring.",
  "obj_mettaton_neo_482": "* METTATON NEO - 90 ATK 9 DEF&* Dr. Alphys's greatest&  invention./^",
  "obj_mettaton_neo_535": "\\E6G...&GUESS SHE SHOULD&HAVE WORKED MORE&ON THE DEFENSES.../",
  "obj_mettaton_neo_536": "\\E6.../",
  "obj_mettaton_neo_537": "\\E6YOU MAY HAVE&DEFEATED ME...&BUT.../",
  "obj_mettaton_neo_538": "\\E4I KNOW.&I CAN TELL FROM&THAT STRIKE, DARLING./",
  "obj_mettaton_neo_539": "\\E5YOU WERE HOLDING&BACK./",
  "obj_mettaton_neo_540": "\\E6YES, ASGORE WILL&FALL EASILY TO&YOU.../",
  "obj_mettaton_neo_541": "\\E5BUT YOU WON'T&HARM HUMANITY,&WILL YOU?/",
  "obj_mettaton_neo_542": "\\E1YOU AREN'T&ABSOLUTELY EVIL./",
  "obj_mettaton_neo_543": "\\E5IF YOU WERE&TRYING TO BE,&THEN YOU MESSED UP./",
  "obj_mettaton_neo_544": "\\E0AND SO LATE INTO&THE SHOW, TOO./",
  "obj_mettaton_neo_545": "\\E0HA... HA.&AT LEAST NOW,&I CAN REST EASY./",
  "obj_mettaton_neo_546": "\\E3KNOWING ALPHYS AND&THE HUMANS WILL&LIVE ON...!/%%",
  "obj_mettaton_neo_550": "\\E6GH.../",
  "obj_mettaton_neo_551": "\\E5GUESS YOU DON'T&WANNA JOIN MY&FAN CLUB...?/%%",
  "obj_mettaton_npc_63": "* Capital wenisberry./%%",
  "obj_mettaton_npc_69": "\\W* \\YMILK^1, SUGAR^1, \\WAND\\Y EGGS\\W!&* YOU SHOULD BE ABLE TO FIND&  THEM ON THE BACK COUNTER!/%%",
  "obj_mettaton_npc_77": "* GREAT JOB^1!&* JUST PUT THEM IN THE MIDDLE&  OF THIS COUNTER!/%%",
  "obj_mettaton_npc_82": "* WHAT'S THE MATTER?&* NOT A CAN FAN?&* THAT'S TOO BAD!/",
  "obj_mettaton_npc_83": "* MTT-BRAND USES ONLY THE&  FRESHEST ARTIFICIAL INGREDIENTS&  AND CHEMICALS!/%%",
  "obj_mettatonb_quiz_255": "LET'S START WITH&AN EASY ONE!!/%%",
  "obj_mettatonb_quiz_258": "HERE'S YOUR TERRIFIC&PRIZE!/%%",
  "obj_mettatonb_quiz_262": "ENOUGH ABOUT YOU.&LET'S TALK ABOUT ME!/%%",
  "obj_mettatonb_quiz_266": "HERE'S ANOTHER EASY&ONE FOR YOU!/%%",
  "obj_mettatonb_quiz_270": "DON'T 'COUNT'&ON YOUR VICTORY.../%%",
  "obj_mettatonb_quiz_274": "LET'S PLAY MEMORY&GAME./%%",
  "obj_mettatonb_quiz_278": "BUT CAN YOU GET&THIS ONE???/%%",
  "obj_mettatonb_quiz_282": "HERE'S A SIMPLE&ONE./%%",
  "obj_mettatonb_quiz_286": "TIME TO BREAK OUT&THE BIG GUNS!!/%%",
  "obj_mettatonb_quiz_294": "%%%",
  "obj_mettatonb_quiz_490": "* Mettaton.",
  "obj_mettatonb_quiz_514": "* METTATON - ATK 30 DEF 255&* His metal body renders him&  invulnerable to attack./^",
  "obj_mettatonb_quiz_524": "* Screaming is against the&  rules./^",
  "obj_mettatonb_second_256": "THIS IS IT, DARLING!&SAY GOODBYE!/%%",
  "obj_mettatonb_second_265": "HA!&THAT BUTTON WON'T&SAVE YOU NOW, DARLING!/%%",
  "obj_mettatonb_second_268": "YOU WOULDN'T DARE&USE THE [ACT] COMMAND&AND PRESS THAT&BUTTON!/%%",
  "obj_mettatonb_second_271": "THAT'S RIGHT!&DON'T PRESS IT!&I'LL DESTROY YOU!/%%",
  "obj_mettatonb_second_274": "WITHOUT THAT BUTTON,&YOU ARE INCHING&CLOSER AND CLOSER&TO YOUR DEMISE!/%%",
  "obj_mettatonb_second_277": "ANY MINUTE NOW!&    /%%",
  "obj_mettatonb_second_280": "ANY... MINUTE...&....NOW!/%%",
  "obj_mettatonb_second_284": ".............&............/%%",
  "obj_mettatonb_second_290": "..........&...(COUGH)/%%",
  "obj_mettatonb_second_299": "OH!!!&THAT YELLOW GLOW...!/%%",
  "obj_mettatonb_second_300": "TOOK YOU LONG&ENOUGH!/%%",
  "obj_mettatonb_second_542": "* Mettaton.",
  "obj_mettatonb_second_564": "* METTATON - ATK 30 DEF 255&* His metal body STILL renders&  him invulnerable to attack./^",
  "obj_mettatonb_second_574": "* You yell..^1.&* Nothing happened./^",
  "obj_mettatonb_second_579": "* You press the yellow button^1.&* The phone is resonating with&  Mettaton's presence...!/^",
  "obj_mettatonb_second_640": "IS THAT YOUR PHONE?&YOU'D BETTER ANSWER&IT!/%%",
  "obj_mettatonb_second_652": "H-hey!!&Th-this seems bad,&but don't worry!!/",
  "obj_mettatonb_second_653": "Th-there's one last&thing I installed&on your phone...!/",
  "obj_mettatonb_second_654": "\\WYou see that\\Y &yellow button\\W...?/",
  "obj_mettatonb_second_655": "Go to this phone's&[[ACT]] menu and&press it!!!/%%",
  "obj_mettatonb_second_662": "* Your phone's [[ACT]] menu is&  glowing.",
  "obj_mettatonb_second_703": "Now press \\*Z!!!",
  "obj_mettatonb_second_746": "OOOH!/",
  "obj_mettatonb_second_747": "OOOOOOOH!/",
  "obj_mettatonb_second_748": "YOU'VE DEFEATED ME!!/",
  "obj_mettatonb_second_749": "HOW CAN THIS BE,&YOU WERE STRONGER&THAN I THOUGHT, ETC./%%",
  "obj_mettatonb_second_757": "WHATEVER.",
  "obj_mettatonb_third_214": "THIS IS IT, DARLING!&SAY GOODBYE!/%%",
  "obj_mettatonb_third_224": "YES, I WAS THE ONE&THAT RE-ARRANGED&THE CORE!/",
  "obj_mettatonb_third_225": "I WAS THE ONE THAT&HIRED EVERYONE TO&KILL YOU!/",
  "obj_mettatonb_third_226": "THAT, HOWEVER, WAS A&SHORT-SIGHTED PLAN./",
  "obj_mettatonb_third_227": "YOU KNOW WHAT WOULD&BE A HUNDRED TIMES&BETTER?/",
  "obj_mettatonb_third_228": "KILLING YOU MYSELF!!/%%",
  "obj_mettatonb_third_233": "LISTEN, DARLING.&I'VE SEEN YOU FIGHT./",
  "obj_mettatonb_third_234": "YOU'RE WEAK./",
  "obj_mettatonb_third_235": "IF YOU CONTINUE&FORWARD, ASGORE WILL&TAKE YOUR SOUL./",
  "obj_mettatonb_third_236": "AND WITH YOUR SOUL,&ASGORE WILL DESTROY&HUMANITY./%%",
  "obj_mettatonb_third_241": "BUT IF I GET YOUR&SOUL, I CAN STOP&ASGORE'S PLAN!/",
  "obj_mettatonb_third_242": "I CAN SAVE HUMANITY&FROM DESTRUCTION!/%%",
  "obj_mettatonb_third_247": "THEN, USING YOUR SOUL,&I'LL CROSS THROUGH&THE BARRIER.../",
  "obj_mettatonb_third_248": "AND BECOME THE STAR&I'VE ALWAYS DREAMED&OF BEING!/",
  "obj_mettatonb_third_249": "HUNDREDS, THOUSANDS.../",
  "obj_mettatonb_third_250": "NO!&MILLIONS OF HUMANS&WILL WATCH ME!/%%",
  "obj_mettatonb_third_255": "GLITZ! GLAMOUR!&I'LL FINALLY HAVE&IT ALL!/",
  "obj_mettatonb_third_256": "SO WHAT IF A FEW&PEOPLE HAVE TO DIE?/",
  "obj_mettatonb_third_257": "THAT'S SHOW BUSINESS,&BABY!/%%",
  "obj_mettatonb_third_523": "* Mettaton.",
  "obj_mettatonb_third_545": "* METTATON - ATK 30 DEF 255&* Seriously^1, his metal body&  is invulnerable!/^",
  "obj_mettatonb_third_555": "* This is probably what you'll&  do if things continue in&  this manner./^",
  "obj_mettatonb_third_560": "* You tell Mettaton that there's&  a mirror behind him./%%",
  "obj_mettatonb_third_644": "U..uh... I can't see&what's going on in&there, but.../",
  "obj_mettatonb_third_645": "D-d-don't give up,&okay!?/",
  "obj_mettatonb_third_646": "Th... there's o-one&l-l-last way to beat&Mettaton.../",
  "obj_mettatonb_third_647": "It's... um... it's.../",
  "obj_mettatonb_third_648": "This is a work in-&progress, so don't&judge it too hard.../",
  "obj_mettatonb_third_649": "But, you know how&Mettaton always faces&f-f-forward?/",
  "obj_mettatonb_third_650": "That's because&there's a switch&on his backside./",
  "obj_mettatonb_third_651": "S-s-so if y-y-you&c-c-can turn him&around... um.../",
  "obj_mettatonb_third_652": "And, umm... press&th-th-th-the&switch.../",
  "obj_mettatonb_third_653": "He'll be... um...&He'll be.../",
  "obj_mettatonb_third_654": "Vulnerable./",
  "obj_mettatonb_third_655": "Well, g-g-gotta go!/%%",
  "obj_mettatonb_third_688": "* Seems like a good time to&  turn Mettaton around.",
  "obj_mettatonb_third_820": "OH???&A MIRROR???/",
  "obj_mettatonb_third_821": "RIGHT, I HAVE TO&LOOK PERFECT FOR&OUR GRAND FINALE!/%%",
  "obj_mettatonb_third_831": "HMMM...&I DON'T SEE IT...&WHERE IS IT...?/%%",
  "obj_mettatonb_third_848": "DID YOU./",
  "obj_mettatonb_third_849": "JUST FLIP./",
  "obj_mettatonb_third_850": "MY SWITCH?/%%",
  "obj_mettatonb_third_943": "THAT WORTHLESS PEA-&SHOOTER WON'T WORK&ON ME, DARLING. ^3 %",
  "obj_mettatonb_third_944": "DON'T YOU UNDERSTAND&WHAT ACTING IS!?^3 %%",
  "obj_mettatonb_third_952": "* Mettaton.",
  "obj_mettatonex_167": ".../%%",
  "obj_mettatonex_190": "Lights!&Camera!&Action!/%%",
  "obj_mettatonex_196": "Drama!&Romance!&Blood-&shed!/%%",
  "obj_mettatonex_202": "I'm the&idol&everyone&craves!/%%",
  "obj_mettatonex_208": "Smile&for the&camera!/%%",
  "obj_mettatonex_214": "Oooh, it's time&for a pop quiz!/",
  "obj_mettatonex_215": "I hope you brought&a keyboard.../",
  "obj_mettatonex_215_console": "Have fun with that&on-screen keyboard.../",
  "obj_mettatonex_216": "This one's an&essay question!/%%",
  "obj_mettatonex_222": "Your essay really&showed everyone&your heart./",
  "obj_mettatonex_223": "Why don't I show&you mine?/%%",
  "obj_mettatonex_231": "Ooooh,&I'm just&warming&up!/%%",
  "obj_mettatonex_237": "But how are you&on the dance floor!?/%%",
  "obj_mettatonex_244": "Can you&keep up&the&pace!?/%%",
  "obj_mettatonex_253": "Lights!&Camera&Bombs!/%%",
  "obj_mettatonex_259": "Things&are&blowing&up!/%%",
  "obj_mettatonex_267": "Time for our union-&regulated break!/%%",
  "obj_mettatonex_274": "We've grown so&distant, darling.../",
  "obj_mettatonex_275": "How about another&heart-to-heart?/%%",
  "obj_mettatonex_285": "A.. arms?&Wh... who needs arms&with legs like&these?/",
  "obj_mettatonex_286": "I'm still going&to win!/%%",
  "obj_mettatonex_297": "Come on&...!/%%",
  "obj_mettatonex_307": "The show&...&must go&on!/%%",
  "obj_mettatonex_317": "Dr...&Drama!&A...&Action!/%%",
  "obj_mettatonex_329": "\\E5L... lights...&C... camera.../",
  "obj_mettatonex_330": "Enough of this!&Do you really want&humanity to perish!?/",
  "obj_mettatonex_331": "\\E7... or do you just&believe in yourself&that much?/%%",
  "obj_mettatonex_353": "Haha, how inspiring!/",
  "obj_mettatonex_354": "Well, darling!&It's either me&or you!/",
  "obj_mettatonex_355": "\\E4But I think we both&already know who's&going to win./",
  "obj_mettatonex_356": "\\E8Witness the true&power of humanity's&star!/%%",
  "obj_mettatonex_368": "... then.../",
  "obj_mettatonex_369": "\\E8Are YOU the star?/",
  "obj_mettatonex_370": "Can you really&protect humanity!?/%%",
  "obj_mettatonex_638": "* Mettaton.",
  "obj_mettatonex_639": "* Mettaton.",
  "obj_mettatonex_640": "* Mettaton.",
  "obj_mettatonex_641": "* Mettaton.",
  "obj_mettatonex_642": "* Smells like Mettaton.",
  "obj_mettatonex_644": "* Mettaton has low HP.",
  "obj_mettatonex_677": "* METTATON EX - ATK 47 DEF 47&* His weak point is his&  heart-shaped core./^",
  "obj_mettatonex_691": "* You say you aren't going&  to get hit at ALL./",
  "obj_mettatonex_692": "* Ratings gradually increase&  during Mettaton's turn./^",
  "obj_mettatonex_706": "* You posed dramatically^1.&* The audience nods./^",
  "obj_mettatonex_708": "* Despite being hurt^1, you&  posed dramatically^1.&* The audience applauds./^",
  "obj_mettatonex_710": "* Despite being wounded^1, you&  posed dramatically^1.&* The audience gasps./^",
  "obj_mettatonex_712": "* With the last of your power^1,&  you pose dramatically^1.&* The audience screams./^",
  "obj_mettatonex_726": "* You turn and scoff at the&  audience./",
  "obj_mettatonex_727": "* They're rooting for your&  destruction this turn!/^",
  "obj_mettatonex_770": "H.. ha.../",
  "obj_mettatonex_771": "So I was wrong./",
  "obj_mettatonex_772": "Darling.../",
  "obj_mettatonex_773": "\\E1You really are&strong enough to&get past ASGORE./",
  "obj_mettatonex_774": "\\E0Well then.../",
  "obj_mettatonex_775": "It's time for&you to go./",
  "obj_mettatonex_776": "\\E0Don't worry about&me./",
  "obj_mettatonex_777": "I might seem like&I'm dying now^1,&but.../",
  "obj_mettatonex_778": "\\E1Dr. Alphys can&always repair me./",
  "obj_mettatonex_779": "\\E0And... besides.../",
  "obj_mettatonex_780": "Even if I'm not&cut out to be&a star.../",
  "obj_mettatonex_781": "\\E1I still got to&perform for a&human, didn't I?/",
  "obj_mettatonex_782": "So, thank you,&darling.../%%",
  "obj_mettatonex_804": "\\E1You've been a&great audience!/%%",
  "obj_mettatonex_836": "OOH^1, LOOK AT&THESE RATINGS!!!/",
  "obj_mettatonex_837": "\\E6THIS IS THE MOST&VIEWERS I'VE EVER&HAD!!!/",
  "obj_mettatonex_838": "WE'VE REACHED THE&VIEWER CALL-IN&MILESTONE!/",
  "obj_mettatonex_839": "\\E8ONE LUCKY VIEWER&WILL HAVE THE CHANCE&TO TALK TO ME.../",
  "obj_mettatonex_840": "\\E7... BEFORE I LEAVE&THE UNDERGROUND&FOREVER!!/",
  "obj_mettatonex_841": "\\E9LET'S SEE WHO&CALLS IN FIRST!/%%",
  "obj_mettatonex_866": "\\E0HI^1, YOU'RE ON TV!/",
  "obj_mettatonex_867": "WHAT DO YOU HAVE&TO SAY ON THIS^1,&OUR LAST SHOW???/%%",
  "obj_mettatonex_880": "...../",
  "obj_mettatonex_881": "oh......../",
  "obj_mettatonex_882": "\\E1hi..^1.&mettaton.../",
  "obj_mettatonex_883": "i really liked&watching your show.../",
  "obj_mettatonex_884": "my life is pretty&boring..^1. but.../",
  "obj_mettatonex_885": "seeing you on the&screen..^1. brought&excitement to my&life..^1. vicariously/",
  "obj_mettatonex_886": "i can't tell^1, but..^1.&i guess this is&the last episode...?/",
  "obj_mettatonex_887": "\\E3i'll miss you..^1.&mettaton....../",
  "obj_mettatonex_888": "... oh...^1. i didn't&mean to talk so&long.../",
  "obj_mettatonex_889": "\\E2oh........../%%",
  "obj_mettatonex_900": "NO^1, WAIT^1!&WAIT^1, BL.../",
  "obj_mettatonex_901": "\\E1H..^1.&THEY ALREADY HUNG&UP./",
  "obj_mettatonex_902": "\\E3.../",
  "obj_mettatonex_903": "\\E0I'LL TAKE ANOTHER&CALLER!!!/%%",
  "obj_mettatonex_915": "\\E1Mettaton^1, your show&made us so happy!/%%",
  "obj_mettatonex_928": "Mettaton^1, I don't&know what I'll&watch without you./%%",
  "obj_mettatonex_941": "Mettaton^1, there's&a Mettaton-shaped&hole in my Mettaton-&shaped heart./%%",
  "obj_mettatonex_964": "\\E3AH..^1. I.../",
  "obj_mettatonex_965": "I SEE.../",
  "obj_mettatonex_966": "\\E4.../",
  "obj_mettatonex_967": "EVERYONE..^1.&THANK YOU SO MUCH./",
  "obj_mettatonex_968": ".../",
  "obj_mettatonex_969": "\\E0DARLING./",
  "obj_mettatonex_970": "\\E1PERHAPS..^1. IT MIGHT BE&BETTER IF I STAY&HERE FOR A WHILE./",
  "obj_mettatonex_971": "\\E2HUMANS ALREADY HAVE&STARS AND IDOLS^1,&BUT MONSTERS.../",
  "obj_mettatonex_972": "\\E0THEY ONLY HAVE ME./",
  "obj_mettatonex_973": "\\E1IF I LEFT..^1.&THE UNDERGROUND WOULD&LOSE ITS SPARK./",
  "obj_mettatonex_974": "\\E3I'D LEAVE AN ACHING&VOID THAT CAN NEVER&BE FILLED./",
  "obj_mettatonex_975": "\\E0SO..^1. I THINK I'LL&HAVE TO DELAY MY&BIG DEBUT./",
  "obj_mettatonex_976": "\\E2BESIDES./",
  "obj_mettatonex_977": "\\E1YOU'VE PROVEN TO&BE VERY STRONG./",
  "obj_mettatonex_978": "\\E0PERHAPS..^1. EVEN STRONG&ENOUGH TO GET PAST&ASGORE./",
  "obj_mettatonex_979": "\\E0I'M SURE YOU'LL BE&ABLE TO PROTECT&HUMANITY./",
  "obj_mettatonex_980": "\\E4HA^1, HA.../",
  "obj_mettatonex_981": "IT'S ALL FOR THE&BEST^1, ANYWAY./",
  "obj_mettatonex_982": "\\E3THE TRUTH IS^1, THIS&FORM'S ENERGY&CONSUMPTION IS.../",
  "obj_mettatonex_983": "INEFFICIENT./",
  "obj_mettatonex_984": "IN A FEW MOMENTS^1,&I'LL RUN OUT OF&BATTERY POWER^1, AND.../",
  "obj_mettatonex_985": "\\E4WELL./",
  "obj_mettatonex_986": "\\E0I'LL BE ALRIGHT./",
  "obj_mettatonex_987": "\\E5KNOCK 'EM DEAD^1,&DARLING./",
  "obj_mettatonex_988": "\\E0AND EVERYONE..^1.&THANK YOU./",
  "obj_mettatonex_989": "YOU'VE BEEN A&GREAT AUDIENCE!/%%",
  "obj_mettboss_event_170": "* REALLY^1?&* WHERE?/%%",
  "obj_mettboss_event_187": "* CLEVER..^1.&* VERY CLEVER./%%",
  "obj_mettboss_event_230": "* OH YES.&* THERE YOU ARE, DARLING./",
  "obj_mettboss_event_231": "* IT'S TIME TO HAVE OUR&  LITTLE SHOWDOWN./",
  "obj_mettboss_event_232": "* IT'S TIME TO FINALLY STOP&  THE \"MALFUNCTIONING\" ROBOT./",
  "obj_mettboss_event_233": "* ... NOT!!!/",
  "obj_mettboss_event_234": "* MALFUNCTION?&* REPROGRAMMING?&* GET REAL./",
  "obj_mettboss_event_235": "* THIS WAS ALL JUST A BIG&  SHOW./",
  "obj_mettboss_event_236": "* AN ACT./",
  "obj_mettboss_event_237": "* ALPHYS HAS BEEN PLAYING&  YOU FOR A FOOL THE&  WHOLE TIME./",
  "obj_mettboss_event_238": "* AS SHE WATCHED YOU ON THE&  SCREEN^1, SHE GREW ATTACHED&  TO YOUR ADVENTURE./",
  "obj_mettboss_event_239": "* SHE DESPERATELY WANTED TO&  BE A PART OF IT./",
  "obj_mettboss_event_240": "* SO SHE DECIDED TO INSERT&  HERSELF INTO YOUR STORY./",
  "obj_mettboss_event_241": "* SHE REACTIVATED PUZZLES^1.&* SHE DISABLED ELEVATORS^1.&* SHE ENLISTED ME TO TORMENT YOU./",
  "obj_mettboss_event_242": "* ALL SO SHE COULD SAVE&  YOU FROM DANGERS THAT&  DIDN'T EXIST./",
  "obj_mettboss_event_243": "* ALL SO YOU WOULD THINK&  SHE'S THE GREAT PERSON.../",
  "obj_mettboss_event_244": "* THAT SHE'S NOT./",
  "obj_mettboss_event_245": "* AND NOW^1, IT'S TIME FOR&  HER FINEST HOUR./",
  "obj_mettboss_event_247": "* AT THIS VERY MOMENT,&  ALPHYS IS WAITING OUTSIDE&  THE ROOM./",
  "obj_mettboss_event_248": "* DURING OUR \"BATTLE,\" SHE&  WILL INTERRUPT./",
  "obj_mettboss_event_249": "* SHE WILL PRETEND TO&  \"DEACTIVATE\" ME, \"SAVING\" YOU&  ONE FINAL TIME./",
  "obj_mettboss_event_250": "* FINALLY.&* SHE'LL BE THE HEROINE OF&  YOUR ADVENTURE./",
  "obj_mettboss_event_251": "* YOU'LL REGARD HER SO HIGHLY&  SHE'LL EVEN BE ABLE TO&  CONVINCE YOU NOT TO LEAVE./",
  "obj_mettboss_event_252": "* ... OR NOT./",
  "obj_mettboss_event_253": "* YOU SEE, I'VE HAD ENOUGH OF&  THIS PREDICTABLE CHARADE./",
  "obj_mettboss_event_254": "* I HAVE NO DESIRE TO HARM&  HUMANS.&* FAR FROM IT, ACTUALLY./",
  "obj_mettboss_event_255": "* MY ONLY DESIRE IS TO&  ENTERTAIN./",
  "obj_mettboss_event_256": "* AFTER ALL, THE AUDIENCE&  DESERVES A GOOD SHOW,&  DON'T THEY?/",
  "obj_mettboss_event_257": "* AND WHAT'S A GOOD SHOW.../",
  "obj_mettboss_event_258": "* WITHOUT A PLOT TWIST?/%%",
  "obj_mettboss_event_263": "* MY^1, MY^1.&* SO YOU'VE FINALLY ARRIVED./",
  "obj_mettboss_event_264": "* AFTER OUR FIRST MEETING^1, I&  REALIZED..^1.&* SOMETHING GHASTLY./",
  "obj_mettboss_event_265": "* YOU'RE NOT JUST A THREAT&  TO MONSTERS..^1.&* BUT HUMANITY^1, AS WELL./",
  "obj_mettboss_event_266": "* OH MY^1.&* THAT'S AN ISSUE./",
  "obj_mettboss_event_267": "* YOU SEE^1, I CAN'T BE A&  STAR WITHOUT AN AUDIENCE./",
  "obj_mettboss_event_268": "* AND BESIDES.../",
  "obj_mettboss_event_269": "* THERE ARE SOME PEOPLE..^1.&* I WANT TO PROTECT./%%",
  "obj_mettboss_event_303": "* H-hey!!^1!&* Wh-wh-what's going on!?/",
  "obj_mettboss_event_304": "* Th-th-the door just&  locked itself!/%%",
  "obj_mettboss_event_321": "\\M1* SORRY^1, FOLKS^1!&* THE OLD PROGRAM'S BEEN&  CANCELLED!!!/",
  "obj_mettboss_event_322": "* BUT WE'VE GOT A FINALE&  THAT WILL DRIVE YOU WILD!!/%%",
  "obj_mettboss_event_341": "\\M5* REAL DRAMA!!&* REAL ACTION!!&* REAL BLOODSHED!!/",
  "obj_mettboss_event_342": "* ON OUR NEW SHOW.../",
  "obj_mettboss_event_343": "* \"ATTACK OF THE KILLER&  ROBOT!\"/%%",
  "obj_mettboss_event_411": "* AH HA HA^1.&* EAGER, AS ALWAYS, EH?/",
  "obj_mettboss_event_412": "* BUT DON'T TOUCH THAT DIAL.&* THERE'S SOMETHING YOU&  HAVEN'T ACCOUNTED FOR./",
  "obj_mettboss_event_413": "* AS ANY TRUE FAN WOULD KNOW,&  I WAS FIRST CREATED AS&  A HUMAN ERADICATION ROBOT./",
  "obj_mettboss_event_414": "* IT WAS ONLY AFTER BECOMING A&  STAR THAT I WAS GIVEN A&  MORE... PHOTOGENIC BODY./",
  "obj_mettboss_event_415": "* HOWEVER./",
  "obj_mettboss_event_416": "* THOSE ORIGINAL FUNCTIONS&  HAVE NEVER BEEN FULLY&  REMOVED.../",
  "obj_mettboss_event_417": "* COME ANY CLOSER, AND&  I'LL BE FORCED TO SHOW&  YOU.../",
  "obj_mettboss_event_418": "\\M5* MY TRUE FORM!/%%",
  "obj_mettboss_event_443": "\\M0* FINE THEN!/",
  "obj_mettboss_event_444": "\\M5* RRRRREADY^1?&* IIIIIIIT'S SHOWTIME!!!/%%",
  "obj_mettdestroyed_event_169": "* I..^1. I managed to open&  the lock^1!&* Are you two.../%%",
  "obj_mettdestroyed_event_197": "* Oh my god./%%",
  "obj_mettdestroyed_event_222": "* Mettaton!/",
  "obj_mettdestroyed_event_223": "\\E1* Mettaton^1, are you.../%%",
  "obj_mettdestroyed_event_244": "* H..^1. hey.../",
  "obj_mettdestroyed_event_245": "* D..^1. don't worry&  about it.../",
  "obj_mettdestroyed_event_246": "* I can always.../",
  "obj_mettdestroyed_event_247": "\\E5* I can always build&  a different robot!/",
  "obj_mettdestroyed_event_248": "\\E6* .../",
  "obj_mettdestroyed_event_249": "\\E5* Why don't you go&  on ahead?/%%",
  "obj_mettdestroyed_event_254": "* ... thank GOD^1, it's just&  the batteries./",
  "obj_mettdestroyed_event_255": "\\E9* Mettaton^1, if you were&  gone^1, I would have..^1.&* I would have.../",
  "obj_mettdestroyed_event_256": "\\E8* .../",
  "obj_mettdestroyed_event_257": "\\E6* I m-mean^1, h-hey^1, it's&  n-^1no problem^1, you&  know?/",
  "obj_mettdestroyed_event_258": "\\E5* He's just a robot^1, if&  you messed it up^1, I&  c-could always.../",
  "obj_mettdestroyed_event_259": "\\E6* J-just build another./",
  "obj_mettdestroyed_event_260": "\\E4* .../",
  "obj_mettdestroyed_event_261": "* Why don't you go&  on ahead?/%%",
  "obj_metteggs_58": "* (You found the eggs.)/%%",
  "obj_mettmilk_58": "* (You found the milk.)/%%",
  "obj_mettnews_artifact_117": "* Error Baby%%",
  "obj_mettnews_battleobj_199": "* Error./%%",
  "obj_mettnews_battleobj_204": "* Great job^1!&* Keep heading around the&  room!/",
  "obj_mettnews_battleobj_205": "* Try to go for the&  one in the bottom-&  left next!/%%",
  "obj_mettnews_battleobj_209": "* Great job^1!&* Keep heading around the&  room!/",
  "obj_mettnews_battleobj_210": "* Try to go for the&  one in the top-&  right next!/%%",
  "obj_mettnews_battleobj_214": "* Great job^1!&* Head to the left&  next!/%%",
  "obj_mettnews_battleobj_218": "* Great job^1!&* Head to the right&  next!/%%",
  "obj_mettnews_battleobj_223": "* You couldn't even&  get one bomb...!?/%%",
  "obj_mettnews_battleobj_246": "* Error,/%%",
  "obj_mettnews_battleobj_249": "* Great job^1!&* Head for the center^1!&* There's one left there!/%%",
  "obj_mettnews_battleobj_252": "* Great job^1!&* Head for the center!/",
  "obj_mettnews_battleobj_253": "* I'm using^1, uh^1, EM fields&  to trap the glass of&  water there!/%%",
  "obj_mettnews_battleobj_257": "* Great job^1!&* There's only one left&  in the bottom-right!/%%",
  "obj_mettnews_battleobj_261": "* Great job^1!&* There's only one left&  at the top!/%%",
  "obj_mettnews_battleobj_265": "* Great job^1!&* There's only one left&  at the top-right!/%%",
  "obj_mettnews_battleobj_269": "* Great job^1!&* There's only one left&  at the bottom-left!/%%",
  "obj_mettnews_battleobj_275": "* It's..^1. it's.../%%",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_88": "* Ring.../",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_89": "\\TS \\E3 \\F6 \\TA %",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_90": "* Okay^1, I'm back!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_91": "\\E0* A-another dark room^1,&  huh?/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_92": "\\E6* Don't worry!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_93": "\\E0* M-my hacking skills&  have got things&  covered!/%%",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_159": "\\E3* Are you serious?/%%",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_174": "* OHHHHHH YESSS!!!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_175": "* GOOD EVENING^1, BEAUTIES AND&  GENTLEBEAUTIES!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_176": "* THIS IS METTATON^1, REPORTING&  LIVE FROM MTT NEWS!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_177": "\\M2* AN INTERESTING SITUATION HAS&  ARISEN IN EASTERN HOTLAND!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_178": "\\M3* FORTUNATELY^1, OUR CORRESPONDENT&  IS OUT THERE^1, REPORTING LIVE!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_179": "\\M6* BRAVE CORRESPONDENT^1!&* PLEASE FIND SOMETHING&  NEWSWORTHY TO REPORT!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_180": "\\M4* OUR TEN WONDERFUL VIEWERS&  ARE WAITING FOR YOU!!/%%",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_229": "\\M3* ATTENTION^1, VIEWERS^1!&* OUR CORRESPONDENT HAS&  FOUND..^1. A DOG!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_230": "\\M4* (CUE AUDIENCE AWWS)/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_231": "\\M3* THAT'S RIGHT^1, FOLKS^1!&* IT'S THE FEEL-GOOD&  STORY OF THE YEAR!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_232": "\\M4* LOOK AT ITS LITTLE&  EARS^1, TINY PAWS^1, FLUFFY&  TAIL.../",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_233": "* .../",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_234": "* WAIT A SECOND./",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_235": "\\M5* THAT'S NOT A TAIL!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_236": "\\M3* THAT'S.../",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_237": "\\M5* A FUSE!!!/%%",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_264": "\\M4* THAT'S RIGHT..^1.&* THAT DOG.../",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_265": "\\M5* IS A BOMB!!!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_266": "\\M5* BUT DON'T PANIC!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_267": "\\M4* YOU HAVEN'T EVEN SEEN&  THE REST OF THE ROOM&  YET!!!/%%",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_283": "\\M3* ATTENTION^1, VIEWERS^1!&* OUR CORRESPONDENT HAS&  FOUND..^1. A GLASS OF WATER!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_284": "\\M4* BUT WHAT'S ASTONISHING&  ABOUT THIS GLASS OF&  WATER.../",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_285": "\\M3* IS HOW UNINTERESTING IT IS!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_286": "\\M4* LIKE ALL GLASSES OF WATER^1,&  IT'S COMPRISED OF WATER^1,&  GLASS^1, NITROGLYCERIN.../",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_287": "* .../",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_288": "* WAIT A SECOND./",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_289": "\\M5* THAT'S NOT A GLASS OF&  WATER!!!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_290": "\\M3* THAT'S.../",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_291": "\\M5* A BOMB!!!/%%",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_318": "\\M5* OH NO!!^1!&* THIS NEWS REPORT.../",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_319": "\\M5* IS TURNING INTO A DISASTER&  REPORT!!!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_320": "\\M3* BUT DON'T PANIC!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_321": "\\M4* YOU HAVEN'T EVEN SEEN&  THE REST OF THE ROOM&  YET!/%%",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_337": "\\M3* ATTENTION^1, VIEWERS^1!&* OUR CORRESPONDENT HAS&  FOUND..^1. A MOVIE SCRIPT!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_338": "\\M5* OH MY^1!&* AND IT LOOKS LIKE IT'S&  FOR MY LATEST FILM!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_339": "\\M3* LET'S NOT KEEP THEM WAITING^1!&* LET'S OPEN IT UP AND GET&  THE SCOOP!/%%",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_372": "\\M4* ... OH??^1?&* WHAT'S THAT INSIDE THE&  SCRIPT?/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_373": "\\M4* THAT TICKING SOUND..^1.&* THAT LIT FUSE.../",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_374": "\\M5* OH MY!!^1!&* LOOKS LIKE I WAS WRONG&  ABOUT THE MOVIE!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_375": "* WE DEFINITELY HAVE A BOX&  OFFICE BOMB ON OUR HANDS!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_376": "* AND IT'S ABOUT TO BLAST&  YOU TO BITS!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_377": "\\M3* BUT DON'T GET TOO EXCITED!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_378": "\\M4* YOU HAVEN'T EVEN SEEN&  THE REST OF THE ROOM&  YET!/%%",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_394": "\\M3* ATTENTION^1, VIEWERS^1!&* OUR CORRESPONDENT HAS&  FOUND..^1. A BASKETBALL!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_395": "\\M4* AH^1.&* BASKETBALLS./",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_396": "\\M3* CIRCLES OF FUN^1.&* ORBS OF JOY^1.&* SPHERES OF AMUSEMENT./",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_397": "\\M4* BUT YOU SHOULDN'T PLAY&  WITH THIS ONE^1.&* IT'S AN MTT-BRAND FASHIONBALL./",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_398": "\\M3* PROPER MAINTENANCE IS&  REQUIRED TO KEEP IT LOOKING&  GOOD./",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_399": "\\M3* AS YOU CAN SEE^1, EVEN EXPOSURE&  TO HUMAN BODY HEAT CAUSES&  THE PAINT TO SLOUGH OFF./",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_400": "* .../",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_401": "* WAIT A SECOND./",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_402": "* THAT'S NOT A BASKETBALL./%%",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_429": "\\M5* THAT'S A BOMB!!!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_430": "* OH NO!!^1!&* THIS SPORT REVIEW.../",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_431": "* IS TURNING INTO A SHORT&  REVIEW!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_432": "* BECAUSE IT'LL BE OVER^1.&* AFTER YOU BLOW UP./",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_434": "\\M3* BUT DON'T GET TOO EXCITED!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_435": "\\M4* YOU HAVEN'T EVEN SEEN&  THE REST OF THE ROOM&  YET!/%%",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_449": "\\M3* ATTENTION^1, VIEWERS^1!&* OUR CORRESPONDENT HAS&  FOUND..^1. A PRESENT!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_450": "\\M4* AND IT'S TIME FOR THE&  UNBOXING VIDEO!!!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_451": "\\M5* LET'S FIND OUT WHAT'S&  INSIDE!!/%%",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_479": "\\M2* THAT ROUND^1, BLACK SHAPE..^1.&* COULD IT BE???/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_480": "\\M4* LOOKS LIKE CHRISTMAS CAME&  EARLY THIS YEAR./",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_481": "\\M5* IF SANTA GAVE PEOPLE BOMBS&  INSTEAD OF PRESENTS!!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_482": "\\M2* REALLY THOUGH^1.&* A BOMB^1.&* WHAT A THOUGHTFUL GIFT./",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_483": "\\M4* THEY EVEN DECIDED TO&  LIGHT IT FOR YOU!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_484": "\\M3* BUT DON'T GET TOO EXCITED!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_485": "\\M4* YOU HAVEN'T EVEN SEEN&  THE REST OF THE ROOM&  YET!/%%",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_499": "\\M3* ATTENTION^1, VIEWERS^1!&* OUR CORRESPONDENT HAS&  FOUND..^1. A VIDEO GAME!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_500": "\\M4* THIS ACTION-PACKED GAME&  IS GUARANTEED TO BLOW YOU&  AWAY!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_501": "\\M3* STRANGE ENEMIES^1!&* STRANGE ALLIES^1!&* ATTRACTIVE ROBOTS!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_502": "\\M4* FEATURING UP TO SIX&  ARBITRARY DIALOGUE CHOICES&  AT ONCE!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_503": "\\M5* CORRESPONDENT^1!&* LET'S LOOK INSIDE THE CASE!/%%",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_531": "\\M4* ..^1.&* THOSE RED CYLINDERS WITH&  BURNING FUSES.../",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_532": "\\M5* OH NO^1!&* THIS GAME LITERALLY IS&  DYNAMITE!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_533": "\\M5* I GUESS THEY WERE RIGHT&  ALL ALONG!!!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_534": "\\M5* VIDEO-GAMES DO CAUSE&  VIOLENCE!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_535": "\\M4* OR AT LEAST THIS ONE'S&  ABOUT TO./",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_536": "\\M3* BUT DON'T GET TOO EXCITED!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_537": "\\M4* YOU HAVEN'T EVEN SEEN&  THE REST OF THE ROOM&  YET!/%%",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_609": "* OH MY!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_610": "* IT SEEMS EVERYTHING IN THIS&  AREA IS ACTUALLY A BOMB!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_613": "* THAT DOG'S A BOMB!/%%",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_618": "* THAT PRESENT'S A BOMB!/%%",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_649": "* THAT BASKETBALL'S A BOMB!/%%",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_654": "* THAT PRESENT'S A BOMB!/%%",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_684": "* EVEN MY WORDS ARE...!/%%",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_694": "\\TS ^7  %",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_695": " %%",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_708": "\\W* BRAVE CORRESPONDENT..^1.&* IF YOU DON'T DEFUSE ALL OF&  THE BOMBS.../%%",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_730": "\\W*\\M9 THIS BIG BOMB WILL BLOW&  YOU TO SMITHEREENS IN&  \\YTWO MINUTES\\W!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_731": "\\M8* THEN YOU WON'T BE REPORTING&  \"LIVE\" ANY LONGER!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_732": "* HOW TERRIBLE^1!&* HOW DISTURBING!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_733": "\\M9* OUR NINE VIEWERS ARE GOING&  TO LOVE WATCHING THIS!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_734": "* GOOD LUCK^1, DARLING!!/%%",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_827": "* Ring.../",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_828": "\\TS \\E3 \\F6 \\TA %",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_829": "* D-don't worry!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_830": "\\E6* I installed a&  bomb-defusing program&  on your phone!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_831": "\\W* Use the 'defuse' option&  when the bomb is in the&  \\GDEFUSE ZONE\\W!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_832": "\\E0* N-now^1, go get 'em!/%%",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_925": "* WELL DONE^1, DARLING!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_926": "* YOU'VE DEACTIVATED ALL OF&  THE BOMBS!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_927": "\\W* IF YOU DIDN'T DEACTIVATE&  THEM^1, THE BIG BOMB WOULD&  HAVE EXPLODED IN \\YTWO MINUTES\\W./",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_928": "\\W* NOW IT WON'T EXPLODE&  IN \\YTWO MINUTES\\W!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_929": "\\W*\\M9 INSTEAD IT'LL EXPLODE&  IN \\YTWO SECONDS\\W!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_930": "* GOODBYE^1, DARLING!/%%",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_934": "* TOO BAD^1, DARLING!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_935": "\\W* YOU FAILED TO DEFUSE ALL&  OF THE BOMBS WITHIN \\YTHREE&  MINUTES\\W!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_936": "* NOW THE BIG BOMB IS&  GOING TO BLOW YOU TO&  SMITHEREENS!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_937": "* READY^1, VIEWERS^1?&* HERE COMES THE MOMENT&  YOU'VE ALL BEEN WAITING FOR!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_938": "* AHAHAH!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_939": "* GOODBYE^1, DARLING!/%%",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_987": "\\M8* AH./",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_988": "* IT SEEMS THE BOMB ISN'T&  GOING OFF./",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_989": "\\S-\\Sp\\T0* Ring...\\S+/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_991": "* That's b-because!!!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_992": "* While you were&  monologuing... I...!!!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_993": "\\E4* I f..^1. fix..^1.&* Um..^1. I ch-change.../",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_994": "\\TS \\F0 \\E0 \\TM %",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_995": "* OH NO^1.&* YOU DEACTIVATED THE BOMB&  WITH YOUR HACKING SKILLS./",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_997": "* Yeah^1!&* That's what I did!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_998": "\\TS \\F0 \\E0 \\TM %",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_999": "\\M9* CURSES^1!&* IT SEEMS I'VE BEEN FOILED&  AGAIN!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_1000": "* CURSE YOU^1, HUMAN^1!&* CURSE YOU^1, DR. ALPHYS^1,&  FOR HELPING SO MUCH!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_1001": "\\M8* BUT I DON'T CURSE MY&  EIGHT WONDERFUL VIEWERS&  FOR TUNING IN!!!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_1002": "* UNTIL NEXT TIME^1, DARLING!/%%",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_1017": "* W-wow..^1.&* W-we really showed&  him^1, huh?/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_1018": "\\E2* .../",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_1019": "\\E4* H-hey^1, I know I was&  kind of weird at&  first.../",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_1020": "\\E0* But I really think&  I'm getting more.../",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_1021": "\\E4* Uh^1, more.../",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_1022": "\\E6* M-more confident about&  guiding you!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_1023": "\\E0* S-so don't worry&  about that b-big&  d-dumb robot.../",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_1024": "\\E6* I-I'll protect you&  from him!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_1025": "\\E3* A-and if it really&  c-came down to it^1,&  we could just t-turn.../",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_1026": "\\E5* Um^1, nevermind./",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_1027": "\\E0* Later!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_1028": "\\TS \\F0 \\E0 \\T0 %",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_1029": "* (Click...)/%%",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_1034": "* B-boy..^1.&* That was close^1, huh?/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_1035": "\\E8* I guess a little&  closer than I would&  have liked./",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_1036": "\\E9* I should have given&  you better directions.../",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_1037": "\\E8* A-and there j-just&  w-wasn't enough&  time.../",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_1038": "\\E6* W-well^1!&* That's Mettaton's fault^1,&  not mine!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_1039": "\\E9* I c-can't second&  guess myself now./",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_1040": "\\E4* I'm f-finally starting&  to f-feel confident&  about g-guiding you./",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_1041": "\\E6* I'll protect you from&  that mean old robot^1,&  n-no matter what!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_1042": "\\E3* If I have to^1,&  I'll even t-turn.../",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_1043": "\\E5* Um^1, nevermind./",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_1044": "\\E0* We're over halfway&  to the core!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_1045": "* Let's go!/",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_1046": "\\TS \\F0 \\E0 \\T0 %",
  "obj_mettnewsevent_1047": "* (Click...)/%%",
