  "obj_moldessa_447": "* MOLDESSA - ATK 27 DEF 23&* Can't decide on a face^1.&* Can't see friend from foe./^",
  "obj_moldessa_458": "* You encourage Moldessa to try&  a new look^1.&* Its face shifts.../^",
  "obj_moldessa_470": "* You adjust Moldessa's face./^",
  "obj_moldessa_471": "* You adjust Moldessa's face^1.&* It seems to be happy with its&  new look./^",
