  "obj_moldessa_495": "* You lie down and rest^1.&* Moldessa tucks you in with&  a blanket of moss./",
  "obj_moldessa_496": "* While you were sleeping^1, the&  other monsters get bored./^",
  "obj_moldessa_506": "* You lie down and rest^1.&* Moldessa tucks you in with&  a blanket of moss./^",
  "obj_moldsmal_193": "Burble&burb...",
