  "obj_monsterkidtrigger7_499": "* .../",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger7_500": "* W-warriors don't rest^1, huh?/",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger7_501": "* Undyne..^1. you're really cool./%%",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger7_643": "* Y..^1. y..^1. yo..^1. dude.../",
