  "obj_monsterkidtrigger7_645": "* You're gonna have to get&  through me^1, first./%%",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger7_714": "* She's gone.../",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger7_715": "* Yo^1, you really saved my skin./",
  "obj_monsterkidtrigger7_716": "* Guess being enemies was just&  a nice thought^1, haha./",
