  "obj_muffetnpc2_75": "* There you are^1, dearie^1.&* You are always welcome in&  my parlor!/",
  "obj_muffetnpc2_76": "* Just stay on your best&  behavior^1~&* Ueee hee hee hee~/%%",
  "obj_muffetnpc2_81": "* Bonjour^1, dearie^1~&* I just finished tallying up&  all of our donations!/",
  "obj_muffetnpc2_82": "* We've finally raised enough&  to rescue all the spiders&  inside of the RUINS./",
  "obj_muffetnpc2_83": "* And we'll also be able to&  afford...!/",
  "obj_muffetnpc2_84": "* ... nothing^1, because we&  only sold one donut./",
  "obj_muffetnpc2_85": "* What's wrong with everyone^1?&* Don't they like spiders~/%%",
  "obj_muffetnpc2_87": "* 4 pairs of stylish sunglasses&  for every spider!/%%",
  "obj_muffetnpc2_89": "* 4 pairs of waterproof booties&  for every spider!/%%",
  "obj_muffetnpc2_91": "* 4 pairs of stylish heels for&  every spider!/%%",
  "obj_muffetnpc2_93": "* A spider baseball field^1!&* We've already got the baseball&  donuts ready~/%%",
  "obj_muffetnpc2_95": "* A spider football stadium^1!&* We'll play with 4 balls on the&  field at once!/%%",
  "obj_muffetnpc2_99": "* A brand new bakery^1!&* Thank you so much^1, dearie!/",
  "obj_muffetnpc2_100": "* It's all because of you^2 &* (r money)./%%",
  "obj_muffetnpc2_105": "* A vacation anywhere in the&  entire world!/",
  "obj_muffetnpc2_106": "* Should we go to the tropics^1?&* Or a creepy abandoned house^1?&* We can't decide~/%%",
  "obj_multitileevent_121": "* OH NO!&* WHATEVER SHALL I DO?/",
  "obj_multitileevent_122": "* MY LOVE HAS BEEN CAST AWAY&  INTO THE DUNGEON./",
  "obj_multitileevent_123": "* A DUNGEON WITH A PUZZLE SO&  DASTARDLY^1, MY PARAMOUR WILL&  SURELY PERISH!/%%",
  "obj_multitileevent_144": "* O, HEAVENS HAVE MERCY!&* THE HORRIBLE COLORED TILE&  MAZE!/",
  "obj_multitileevent_145": "* EACH COLORED TILE HAS ITS&  OWN SADISTIC FUNCTION./",
  "obj_multitileevent_146": "* FOR EXAMPLE, A GREEN TILE&  SOUNDS A NOISE, AND THEN&  YOU MUST FIGHT A MONSTER./",
  "obj_multitileevent_147": "* RED TILES WILL...&* ACTUALLY, WAIT A SECOND./",
  "obj_multitileevent_148": "* DIDN'T WE SEE THIS PUZZLE&  ABOUT A HUNDRED ROOMS&  AGO?/",
  "obj_multitileevent_149": "* THAT'S RIGHT.&* YOU REMEMBER ALL THE&  RULES, DON'T YOU?/",
  "obj_multitileevent_150": "* GREAT...&* THEN I WON'T WASTE YOUR&  TIME REPEATING THEM!!/%%",
  "obj_multitileevent_163": "* OH, AND YOU'D BETTER HURRY./",
  "obj_multitileevent_164": "\\W* BECAUSE IF YOU DON'T GET&  THROUGH IN \\Y30 SECONDS\\W.../%%",
  "obj_multitileevent_192": "* YOU'LL BE INCINERATED BY&  THESE JETS OF FIRE!!/",
  "obj_multitileevent_193": "* AHAHAHAHAHAHA!&* AHAHA... HA... HA!/",
  "obj_multitileevent_194": "* MY POOR LOVE!&* I'M SO FILLED WITH GRIEF,&  I CAN'T STOP LAUGHING!/",
  "obj_multitileevent_195": "* GOOD LUCK, DARLING!/%%",
  "obj_multitileevent_279": "* OOOOH, I'M SO SORRY!&* LOOKS LIKE YOU'RE OUT OF&  TIME!!!/%%",
  "obj_multitileevent_304": "* HERE COME THE FLAMES, DARLING!/%%",
  "obj_multitileevent_330": "* THEY'RE CLOSING IN!/%%",
  "obj_multitileevent_356": "* GETTING!&* CLOSER!&* OH MY!/%%",
  "obj_multitileevent_382": "* ANY MINUTE NOW!!!/%%",
  "obj_multitileevent_409": "* ...&* ...&* (ROBOTIC COUGH)/%%",
  "obj_multitileevent_426": "* Ring.../",
  "obj_multitileevent_427": "* \\TS \\F6 \\TA %",
  "obj_multitileevent_428": "* Watch out!^1!&* I'll save you!!/",
  "obj_multitileevent_429": "* I'm hacking into the&  firewall right now!/%%",
  "obj_multitileevent_447": "* OH NO!!!&* HOW COULD THIS HAPPEN???/",
  "obj_multitileevent_448": "* FOILED AGAIN BY THE BRILLIANT&  DOCTOR ALPHYS!!/%%",
  "obj_multitileevent_464": "* THA-%",
  "obj_multitileevent_465": "\\TS \\F6 \\TA %",
  "obj_multitileevent_466": "\\E6* That's right!/",
