  "obj_multitileevent_471": "\\TS \\F0 \\TM %",
  "obj_multitileevent_472": "* PUZZLE^1?&* OVER?/",
  "obj_multitileevent_473": "* ALPHYS^1, DARLING^1, WHAT ARE YOU&  TALKING ABOUT...?/",
  "obj_multitileevent_474": "* DID YOU FORGET WHAT THE&  GREEN TILES DO?/",
  "obj_multitileevent_475": "* THEY MAKE A SOUND, THEN&  YOU HAVE TO FIGHT A MONSTER./",
  "obj_multitileevent_476": "* WELL, DARLING...&* THAT MONSTER.../",
