  "obj_multitileevent_592": "* CONGRATULATIONS!/",
  "obj_multitileevent_593": "* YOU MADE IT THROUGH THE&  PUZZLE!!!/",
  "obj_multitileevent_594": "* AND NOW, WITHOUT FURTHER ADO,&  THE FLAMES WILL BE DEACTIVATED!/%%",
  "obj_multitileevent_614": "* NO!&* MORE!&* FIRE!/",
  "obj_multitileevent_615": "* ... BUT IT'S AS THE PHRASE&  GOES./",
  "obj_multitileevent_616": "* \"OUT OF THE FIRE, AND INTO&  THE FRYING PAN.\"/",
