  "obj_napstablookdate_356": "* well^1, that was nice..^1.&* thank you.../%%",
  "obj_napstablookfriendtrigger_100": "* oh hey... you...&* followed me.../",
  "obj_napstablookfriendtrigger_101": "* my house is up here.../",
  "obj_napstablookfriendtrigger_102": "* so you probably don't want to&  come this way.../",
  "obj_napstablookfriendtrigger_103": "* hope that helps.../%%",
