  "obj_puzzlehater_76": "* Bahh!!^1!&* Nevermind!!/%%",
  "obj_puzzlehater_80": "* So^1?&* What are you waiting for!?/%%",
  "obj_puzzlehater_85": "* Bah^1! Today's monsters don't&  appreciate what makes&  puzzles great!/",
  "obj_puzzlehater_86": "* Nowadays \"puzzles\" are nothing&  but lasers and moving rocks.../",
  "obj_puzzlehater_87": "* Bahh!!!/",
  "obj_puzzlehater_88": "* There's no ART in that&  actiony^1, mindless schlock^1!&* It's just timing-based drivel!/",
  "obj_puzzlehater_89": "* Give me something that&  challenges the deepest&  reaches of my mind.../",
  "obj_puzzlehater_90": "* You^1!&* You're young^1!&* You've still got hope!/",
  "obj_puzzlehater_91": "* Geh heh heh...^1!&* Here..^1. try solving this&  block-pushing puzzle!/%%",
  "obj_puzzlehater_97": "* Geh^1?&* Who are you?/",
  "obj_puzzlehater_98": "* Freedom^1? What^1? Bah^1!&* You're pullin' my leg!/%%",
  "obj_puzzlehater_102": "* You again!^1?&* Bah^1! I don't care about&  going free!/",
  "obj_puzzlehater_103": "* .../",
  "obj_puzzlehater_104": "* Do you think humans could&  appreciate the details&  of classic puzzles...?/%%",
  "obj_puzzlehaterbox_78": "* (It's a box.^1)&* (Presumably to be pushed.)/%%",
  "obj_puzzlehaterbox_84": "* Bah!/%%",
  "obj_puzzlehaterbox_91": "* What...^1?&* WHAT are you doing!^1?&* You're pushing it ALL WRONG!/",
  "obj_puzzlehaterbox_92": "* Bah^1, forget it^1!&* This generation is REALLY&  hopeless!/%%",
