  "obj_pyrope_571": "* You invite Pyrope to hang&  out./^",
  "obj_pyropenpc_72": "* Haha^1, ha ha ha^1.&* Secret^1, secret^1.&* I've done up a trouble./",
  "obj_pyropenpc_73": "* I set the lava on fire./",
  "obj_pyropenpc_74": "* No one will EVER know^1.&* It's the perfect crime.../%%",
  "obj_pyropenpc_78": "* Haha^1, ha ha ha^1.&* If we leave^1, no one will&  REALLY ever know!!/%%",
