  "obj_pyropenpc_87": "* Haha^1, ha ha ha^1.&* Ya wanna \"hang\" out?/",
  "obj_pyropenpc_88": "* Haha^1, ha ha ha^1.&* Sorry^1, I'm all TIED UP!!!/",
  "obj_pyropenpc_89": "* Psyche^1! Owned^1!&* No one wants to be MY&  friend!!!/%%",
