  "obj_readable_room1_436": "* (It seems to be turned off.)/%%",
  "obj_readable_room1_441": "* ENTRY NUMBER 6/",
  "obj_readable_room1_442": "* ASGORE asked everyone&  outside the city for monsters&  that had \"fallen down.\"/",
  "obj_readable_room1_443": "* Their bodies came in today./",
  "obj_readable_room1_444": "* They're still comatose..^1.&* And soon^1, they'll all&  turn into dust./",
  "obj_readable_room1_445": "* But what happens if I&  inject \"determination\" into&  them?/",
  "obj_readable_room1_446": "* If their SOULS persist&  after they perish^1, then.../",
  "obj_readable_room1_447": "* Freedom might be closer&  than we all thought./%%",
  "obj_readable_room1_449": "* (It seems to be turned off.)/%%",
