  "obj_readable_room1_469": "* i'll just keep injecting&  everything with& \"determination.\"/",
  "obj_readable_room1_470": "* i want this to work./%%",
  "obj_readable_room1_471": "* (It seems to be turned off.)/%%",
  "obj_readable_room1_476": "* ENTRY NUMBER 14/",
  "obj_readable_room1_477": "* Everyone that had fallen&  down.../",
  "obj_readable_room1_478": "* ... has woken up./",
  "obj_readable_room1_479": "* They're all walking around&  and talking like nothing&  is wrong./",
  "obj_readable_room1_480": "* I thought they were&  goners...?/%%",
  "obj_readable_room1_481": "* (It seems to be turned off.)/%%",
  "obj_readable_room1_486": "* ENTRY NUMBER 7/",
  "obj_readable_room1_487": "* We'll need a vessel to&  wield the monster SOULs&  when the time comes./",
  "obj_readable_room1_488": "* After all^1, a monster&  cannot absorb the SOULs&  of other monsters./",
  "obj_readable_room1_489": "* Just as a human cannot&  absorb a human SOUL.../",
  "obj_readable_room1_490": "* So then.../",
  "obj_readable_room1_491": "* What about something that's&  neither human nor monster?/%%",
  "obj_readable_room1_492": "* (It seems to be turned off.)/%%",
  "obj_readable_room1_497": "* ENTRY NUMBER 15/",
  "obj_readable_room1_498": "* Seems like this research&  was a dead end.../",
  "obj_readable_room1_499": "* But at least we got a&  happy ending out of it...?/",
  "obj_readable_room1_500": "* I sent the SOULS back to&  ASGORE^1, returned the&  vessel to his garden..../",
  "obj_readable_room1_501": "* And I called all of the&  families and told them&  everyone's alive./",
  "obj_readable_room1_502": "* I'll send everyone back&  tomorrow. :) /%%",
  "obj_readable_room1_503": "* (It seems to be turned off.)/%%",
