  "obj_readable_room1_518": "* (It seems to be turned off.)/%%",
  "obj_readable_room1_523": "* ENTRY NUMBER 4/",
  "obj_readable_room1_524": "* I've been researching humans&  to see if I can find any&  info about their SOULS./",
  "obj_readable_room1_525": "* I ended up snooping around&  the castle...&* And found these weird tapes./",
  "obj_readable_room1_526": "* I don't feel like ASGORE's&  watched them.../",
  "obj_readable_room1_527": "* I don't think he should./%%",
