  "obj_readable_room2_295": "* Why did the humans attack^1?&* Indeed^1, it seemed that they&  had nothing to fear./",
  "obj_readable_room2_296": "* Humans are unbelievably strong.&* It would take the SOUL of&  nearly every monster.../",
