  "obj_readable_room2_302": "* This power has no counter.&* Indeed, a human cannot&  take a monster's SOUL./",
  "obj_readable_room2_303": "* When a monster dies, its&  SOUL disappears./",
  "obj_readable_room2_304": "* And an incredible power&  would be needed to take the&  SOUL of a living monster./%%",
  "obj_readable_room2_310": "* There is only one way to&  reverse this spell./",
  "obj_readable_room2_311": "* If a huge power, equivalent&  to seven human SOULs, attacks&  the barrier.../",
