  "obj_readable_room3_89": "* Because they are made of&  magic^1, monsters' bodies are&  attuned to their SOUL./",
  "obj_readable_room3_90": "* If a monster doesn't want&  to fight^1, its defenses will&  weaken./",
  "obj_readable_room3_91": "* And the crueller the intentions&  of our enemies^1, the more&  their attacks will hurt us./",
