  "obj_readable_room3_132": "* ...!^1?&* There's a camera hidden in&  the trees here./%%",
  "obj_readable_room3_139": "* When four Bridge Seeds align&  in the water^1, they will&  sprout./%%",
  "obj_readable_room3_141": "* If an error is made, the Bell&  Blossom can call Bridge Seeds&  back to where they started./%%",
  "obj_readable_room3_142": "* WISHING ROOM/%%",
  "obj_readable_room3_147": "* But humans have one weakness.&* Ironically, it is the strength&  of their SOUL./",
  "obj_readable_room3_148": "* Its power allows it to persist&  outside the human body, even&  after death./%%",
  "obj_readable_room3_154": "* There is only one exception./",
  "obj_readable_room3_155": "* The SOUL of a special species&  of monster called a&  \"Boss Monster.\"/",
  "obj_readable_room3_156": "* A Boss Monster's SOUL is&  strong enough to persist&  after death.../",
  "obj_readable_room3_157": "* If only for a few moments./",
  "obj_readable_room3_158": "* A human could absorb this&  SOUL.&* But this has never happened./",
  "obj_readable_room3_159": "* And now it never will./%%",
  "obj_readable_room3_165": "* But this cursed place has&  no entrances or exits./",
  "obj_readable_room3_166": "* There is no way a human&  could come here./",
  "obj_readable_room3_167": "* We will remain trapped&  down here forever./%%",
