  "obj_roundedge_135": "* \"The true final battle\" was&  finally beginning.",
  "obj_royal_rabbitbounce_87": "* Sorry..^1. UNDYNE^1, like^1, told&  us there was totally a&  human in the area./",
  "obj_royal_rabbitbounce_88": "* So^1, like^1, us Royal Guards are&  blocking off the elevators&  for now./",
  "obj_royal_rabbitbounce_89": "* Ngah^1! Even if the elevators&  aren't working anyway^1, we'll&  do our best^1, Ms. UNDYNE!/%%",
  "obj_royal_rabbitbounce_93": "* Like^1, NO WAY you're getting&  by us./",
  "obj_royal_rabbitbounce_94": "* But^1, between you and me...&* I think you could go through&  that creepy lab over there./",
  "obj_royal_rabbitbounce_95": "* Between you^1, me^1, and my&  bro here^1, I mean./",
  "obj_royal_rabbitbounce_96": "* I tell him ALL my secrets./%%",
  "obj_royal_rabbitbounce_101": "* Hey^1!&* No loitering!/",
  "obj_royal_rabbitbounce_102": "* Like^1, just kidding^1.&* I don't care^1.&* Like^1, loiter your heart out./%%",
  "obj_royal_rabbitbounce_107": "* Oh^1, hey./",
  "obj_royal_rabbitbounce_108": "* We're^1, like^1, taking a rain&  check on that killing-you&  thing./",
  "obj_royal_rabbitbounce_109": "* Like^1, don't tell Undyne&  about this^1, OK?/%%",
  "obj_royal_rabbitbounce_113": "* You didn't tell her^1, did&  you...?/%%",
  "obj_royal_rabbitbounce_118": "* Undyne told us that the&  Royal Guard is being disbanded./",
  "obj_royal_rabbitbounce_119": "* Like^1, bummer..^1.&* Guess we'll have to get&  used to Love and Peace./%%",
  "obj_saddragon_70": "* Yeah^1, I'm not gonna be home&  tonight... um.../",
  "obj_saddragon_71": "* I think there's some cold&  pizza in my treasure horde&  you can heat up.../%%",
  "obj_saddragon_75": "* Ummm^1, are you guys on your&  way out^1?/",
  "obj_saddragon_76": "* Guess I'll catch up with you&  later.../%%",
  "obj_saddragon_81": "* Yeah^1, I'm not gonna be home&  tonight... um.../",
  "obj_saddragon_82": "* In fact^1, I don't feel like&  I'll be home tomorrow^1,&  either^1, at this rate.../%%",
  "obj_sans_friendc_75": "* hey^1, frisk^1, what's&  with that weird&  expression?/",
  "obj_sans_friendc_77": "\\E2* Sans^1, did I tell you&  about the time Frisk&  flirted with me...?/",
  "obj_sans_friendc_79": "\\E8* And then asked to&  call me \"mother?\"/",
  "obj_sans_friendc_81": "\\E0* I felt so embarrassed&  for them./",
  "obj_sans_friendc_83": "\\E1* oh boy./",
  "obj_sans_friendc_85": "\\E3WOW^1, FRISK.../",
  "obj_sans_friendc_86": "\\E0THIS REALLY PUTS&OUR RELATIONSHIP&IN A NEW LIGHT./",
  "obj_sans_friendc_88": "\\E1* hey^1, tori^1, do you&  have any other&  embarrassing stories?/",
  "obj_sans_friendc_90": "\\E0* Oh^1, do I ever!/",
  "obj_sans_friendc_91": "\\E1* But, I think that&  story is one of the&  most unbelievable./",
  "obj_sans_friendc_92": "\\E0* It is hard to think&  anyone would want to&  flirt with me./",
  "obj_sans_friendc_94": "\\E0* Ehehe.../",
  "obj_sans_friendc_95": "\\E7* Ehehehe.../",
  "obj_sans_friendc_96": "\\E1* AHA^1! AHAHAH^1!&* HA!^1! HA!!!/",
  "obj_sans_friendc_97": "\\E2* Oh^1, Toriel^1.&* You have NO idea./%%",
  "obj_sans_friendc_102": "\\E0* oh hey^1, what's up^1,&  frisk?/",
  "obj_sans_friendc_103": "\\E2* we were just talking&  about you./",
  "obj_sans_friendc_104": "\\E1* apparently you asked&  to call tori \"mom\" right&  after meeting her?/",
  "obj_sans_friendc_106": "\\E1* Well^1, it was not&  RIGHT after./",
  "obj_sans_friendc_107": "\\E0* It took a couple&  minutes./",
  "obj_sans_friendc_109": "\\E0* frisk..^1.&* i gotta tell ya./",
  "obj_sans_friendc_110": "\\E2* that's^1, uh^1, not the&  best way to get&  to know someone./",
  "obj_sans_friendc_112": "\\E3IT'S NOT???/",
  "obj_sans_friendc_114": "\\E9* Papyrus^1, we've been&  over this./",
  "obj_sans_friendc_116": "\\E4WHATEVER^1, MOM!!!/",
  "obj_sans_friendc_118": "\\E1* Don't talk back to&  me like that!/",
  "obj_sans_friendc_119": "\\E6* Go to your room^1,&  Papyrus!/",
  "obj_sans_friendc_121": "\\E5OK^1, UNDYNE./",
  "obj_sans_friendc_123": "\\E1* Wait^1!&* Don't ACTUALLY go&  to your room!!/",
  "obj_sans_friendc_125": "\\E7I'M GETTING MIXED&  MESSAGES HERE!!!/%%",
  "obj_sans_friendc_131": "\\E0* frisk^1, tori was telling&  me how she made&  b'scotch pie for you./",
  "obj_sans_friendc_133": "\\E0* Oh^1, I should bake it&  for everyone sometime!/",
  "obj_sans_friendc_135": "* .../",
  "obj_sans_friendc_137": "\\E3* (O-oh^1, that sounds&  REALLY good.)/",
  "obj_sans_friendc_139": "\\E3COOKING???/",
  "obj_sans_friendc_140": "\\E0CAN I HELP?/",
  "obj_sans_friendc_142": "* Wait a second!!!/",
  "obj_sans_friendc_143": "\\E6* Can I help too!?/",
  "obj_sans_friendc_145": "\\E0* Certainly^1!&* It would be fun to&  cook together!/",
  "obj_sans_friendc_147": "\\E9* (On second thought^1,&  maybe I'll o-order&  a pizza.)/%%",
  "obj_sans_friendc_154": "\\E0* sorry..^1.&* i don't have time&  to talk^1, frisk./",
  "obj_sans_friendc_155": "\\E1* i'm supposed to be&  working right now./",
  "obj_sans_friendc_157": "\\E4BUT YOU AREN'T&  WORKING!!!/",
  "obj_sans_friendc_159": "\\E2* i know^1, and it's&  taking all my&  concentration./%%",
  "obj_sans_interactable1_68": "* you oughta get going^1.&* he might come back^1.&* and if he does.../",
  "obj_sans_interactable1_69": "\\E2* ... you'll have to&  sit through more of&  my hilarious jokes./%%",
  "obj_sans_interactable1_74": "* what's the holdup^1?&* look^1, there's nothin&  to be afraid of./",
  "obj_sans_interactable1_75": "\\E2* it's just a dark cavern&  filled with skeletons&  and horrible monsters./%%",
  "obj_sans_interactable1_79": "* well?/%%",
  "obj_sans_interactable1_85": "* ... are you just gonna&  stare at me^1, or...?/%%",
  "obj_sans_prefinaldate_127": "* grievous error/%%",
  "obj_sans_prefinaldate_297": "* over here^1.&* i know a shortcut./%%",
  "obj_sans_room_114": "* hey^1, here's something&  important to remember./",
  "obj_sans_room_115": "\\W* my brother has a very&  \\Bspecial attack\\W./",
  "obj_sans_room_116": "\\W* if you see a \\Lblue&  attack\\W,^1 don't move and&  it won't hurt you./",
  "obj_sans_room_117": "* here's an easy way to&  keep it in mind./",
  "obj_sans_room_118": "\\W* imagine a stop sign^1.&* when you see a stop&  sign^1, you \\Rstop^1,\\W right?/",
  "obj_sans_room_119": "\\W* stop signs are \\Rred\\W.&* so imagine a \\Lblue\\W stop&  sign instead./",
  "obj_sans_room_120": "\\W* simple^1, right^1?&* when fighting^1, think&  about \\Yblue stop signs\\W./%%",
  "obj_sans_room_123": "* remember..^1.&* blue stop signs./%%",
  "obj_sans_room_128": "* ... hi./%%",
  "obj_sans_room_135": "* hey^1, thanks..^1.&* my brother seems like&  he's having fun./",
  "obj_sans_room_136": "* by the way^1, did you&  see that weird outfit&  he's wearing?/",
  "obj_sans_room_137": "* we made that a few&  weeks ago for a costume&  party./",
  "obj_sans_room_138": "* he hasn't worn anything&  else since.../",
  "obj_sans_room_139": "* keeps calling it his&  \"battle body.\"/",
  "obj_sans_room_140": "* man./",
  "obj_sans_room_141": "\\E1* isn't my brother cool?/%%",
  "obj_sans_room_145": "* it would make my&  brother happy if you&  played along./%%",
  "obj_sans_room_160": "* thanks for saying&  \"junior jumble\" just&  to appease my brother./",
  "obj_sans_room_161": "\\E1* yesterday he got&  stumped trying to&  \"solve\" the horoscope./%%",
  "obj_sans_room_166": "* papyrus..^1.&* ... finds difficulty in&  interesting places./",
  "obj_sans_room_167": "\\E1* yesterday he got&  stumped trying to&  \"solve\" the horoscope./%%",
  "obj_sans_room_175": "* guess you don't like&  word searches^1, huh?/",
  "obj_sans_room_176": "\\E2* me neither^1.&* i'm more of a funny&  pages kind of guy./",
  "obj_sans_room_177": "\\E0* .../",
  "obj_sans_room_178": "\\E1* .../%%",
  "obj_sans_room_182": "\\E1* i guess despite all&  that^1, you still like&  word searches^1, huh...?/",
  "obj_sans_room_183": "\\E0* that means you can't&  be all bad./%%",
  "obj_sans_room_191": "* actually^1, that spaghetti&  from earlier..^1./",
  "obj_sans_room_192": "* it wasn't too bad for&  my brother./",
  "obj_sans_room_193": "* since he started cooking&  lessons^1, he's been&  improving a lot./",
  "obj_sans_room_194": "\\E1* i bet if he keeps it&  up^1, next year he'll even&  make something edible./%%",
  "obj_sans_room_198": "* hey..^1.&* puzzles might be fun^1.&* if you tried them./%%",
  "obj_sans_room_211": "* good job on solving it&  so quickly^1./",
  "obj_sans_room_212": "* you didn't even need&  my help./",
  "obj_sans_room_213": "* which is great^1, 'cause&  i love doing absolutely&  nothing./%%",
  "obj_sans_room_217": "* ... you must be really&  good at puzzles^1,&  huh?/",
  "obj_sans_room_218": "* i mean./",
  "obj_sans_room_219": "* it's impossible for&  you to have seen&  this one before./%%",
  "obj_sans_room_223": "* hey^1, why didn't you&  ask for help?/",
  "obj_sans_room_224": "\\E1* i was right here./%%",
  "obj_sans_room_229": "* no problem^1, huh?/%%",
  "obj_sans_room_237": "* what's up?/%%",
  "obj_sans_room_238": "* you sure do like to&  exercise./%%",
  "obj_sans_room_246": "* i don't know what my&  brother's going to do&  now./",
  "obj_sans_room_247": "\\W* if i were you^1, i would&  make sure i understand&  \\Bblue attacks\\W./%%",
  "obj_sans_room_250": "* here^1, i'll give you some&  advice about fighting&  my brother./",
  "obj_sans_room_251": "\\E1* don't^1.&* capiche?/%%",
  "obj_sans_room_256": "\\E1* hmmm.../",
  "obj_sans_room_257": "\\E2* guess we didn't need&  your help to have a&  good time after all./",
  "obj_sans_room_258": "\\E3* .../",
  "obj_sans_room_259": "\\E2* say^1, i've been&  thinking./",
  "obj_sans_room_260": "\\E1* seems like you're&  gonna fight my brother&  pretty soon./",
  "obj_sans_room_261": "\\E2* here's some friendly&  advice./",
  "obj_sans_room_262": "\\E3* if you keep going the&  way you are now.../",
  "obj_sans_room_263": "* .../",
  "obj_sans_room_264": "\\E4* you're gonna have a&  bad time./%%",
  "obj_sans_room_280": "\\E0* dang^1, i wish i brought&  a parasol./",
  "obj_sans_room_281": "\\E1* i'm getting a nasty burn&  from all this sun./%%",
  "obj_sans_sentry2_127": "* grievous error/%%",
  "obj_sans_sentry2_134": "* let's hang out again&  sometime./%%",
  "obj_sans_sentry2_141": "\\E3* hey^1, i really&  respect what you did&  back there./",
  "obj_sans_sentry2_142": "\\E2* thanks./%%",
  "obj_sans_sentry2_306": "* over here^1.&* i know a shortcut./%%",
  "obj_sansb_90": "* Skipped ahead.",
  "obj_sansb_252": "what^1?&you think i'm just&gonna stand there&and take it?/%%",
  "obj_sansb_256": "our reports showed&a massive anomaly&in the timespace&continuum./",
  "obj_sansb_257": "timelines jumping&left and right,&stopping and&starting.../%%",
  "obj_sansb_262": "\\E4until suddenly^1,&everything ends./%%",
  "obj_sansb_266": "\\E4heh heh heh.../",
  "obj_sansb_267": "\\E5that's your fault^1,&isn't it?/%%",
  "obj_sansb_272": "\\E1you can't understand&how this feels./%%",
  "obj_sansb_277": "\\E4knowing that one&day^1, without any&warning.../",
  "obj_sansb_278": "\\E9it's all going to&be reset./%%",
  "obj_sansb_284": "\\E9look^1.&i gave up trying&to go back a long&time ago./%%",
  "obj_sansb_290": "\\E4and getting to the&surface doesn't&really appeal&anymore^1, either./%%",
  "obj_sansb_296": "\\E4cause even if we&do.../",
  "obj_sansb_297": "\\E5we'll just end up&right back here^1,&without any memory&of it^1, right?/%%",
  "obj_sansb_303": "\\E1to be blunt.../",
  "obj_sansb_304": "\\E4it makes it kind&of hard to give&it my all./%%",
  "obj_sansb_310": "\\E1... or is that just&a poor excuse for&being lazy...?/",
  "obj_sansb_311": "\\E3hell if i know./%%",
  "obj_sansb_317": "\\E4all i know is..^1.&seeing what comes&next.../",
  "obj_sansb_318": "\\E9i can't afford not&to care anymore./%%",
  "obj_sansb_334": "\\E9ugh..^1.&that being said.../",
  "obj_sansb_335": "\\E1you^1, uh^1, really&like swinging that&thing around^1,&huh?/",
  "obj_sansb_336": "\\E0.../",
  "obj_sansb_337": "\\E4listen./",
  "obj_sansb_338": "i know you didn't&answer me before^1,&but.../",
  "obj_sansb_339": "\\E4somewhere in&there^1.&i can feel it./",
  "obj_sansb_340": "\\E0there's a glimmer&of a good person&inside of you./",
  "obj_sansb_341": "\\E4the memory of&someone who once&wanted to do the&right thing./",
  "obj_sansb_342": "\\E1someone who^1, in&another time^1,&might have even&been.../",
  "obj_sansb_343": "\\E4a friend?/",
  "obj_sansb_344": "\\E3c'mon^1, buddy./",
  "obj_sansb_345": "\\E0do you remember&me?/",
  "obj_sansb_346": "\\E4please^1, if you're&listening.../",
  "obj_sansb_347": "\\E9let's forget all&this^1, ok?/",
  "obj_sansb_348": "\\E3just lay down&your weapon^1, and.../",
  "obj_sansb_349": "\\E4well^1, my job&will be a lot&easier./%%",
  "obj_sansb_353": "\\E9ugh..^1.&that being said.../",
  "obj_sansb_354": "\\E1you^1, uh^1, really&like swinging that&thing around^1,&huh?/",
  "obj_sansb_355": "\\E0.../",
  "obj_sansb_356": "\\E4listen./",
  "obj_sansb_357": "friendship.../",
  "obj_sansb_358": "\\E3it's really great^1,&right?/",
  "obj_sansb_359": "let's quit fighting./%%",
  "obj_sansb_380": "\\E3welp^1, it was&worth a shot./",
  "obj_sansb_381": "\\E5guess you like&doing things the&hard way^1, huh?/%%",
  "obj_sansb_384": "\\E3woah^1, you look&REALLY pissed off.../",
  "obj_sansb_385": "\\E4heheheh.../",
  "obj_sansb_386": "\\E5did i getcha?/",
  "obj_sansb_387": "\\E4well^1, if you came&back anyway.../",
  "obj_sansb_388": "\\E1i guess that means&we never really&WERE friends^1, huh?/",
  "obj_sansb_389": "\\E4heh./",
  "obj_sansb_390": "\\E9don't tell that&to the other&sans-es^1, ok?/%%",
  "obj_sansb_398": "\\E4sounds strange^1, but&before all this i&was secretly hoping&we could be friends./",
  "obj_sansb_399": "\\E1i always thought the&anomaly was doing&this cause they&were unhappy./",
  "obj_sansb_400": "and when they got&what they wanted^1,&they would stop&all this./%%",
  "obj_sansb_405": "\\E3and maybe all they&needed was..^1.&i dunno./",
  "obj_sansb_406": "\\M1some good food^1,&some bad laughs^1,&some nice friends./%%",
  "obj_sansb_411": "\\E4but that's&ridiculous^1,&right?/",
  "obj_sansb_412": "\\E5yeah^1, you're the&type of person&who won't EVER&be happy./%%",
  "obj_sansb_417": "\\E5you'll keep&consuming timelines&over and over^1,&until.../",
  "obj_sansb_418": "\\E4well./",
  "obj_sansb_419": "\\M1hey./",
  "obj_sansb_420": "\\E3take it from me^1,&kid./",
  "obj_sansb_421": "someday.../",
  "obj_sansb_422": "you gotta learn&when to QUIT./%%",
  "obj_sansb_423": "%%%",
  "obj_sansb_427": "\\E3and that day's&TODAY./%%",
  "obj_sansb_433": "\\E4cause..^1.&y'see../",
  "obj_sansb_434": "\\E1all this fighting&is really tiring&me out./%%",
  "obj_sansb_441": "\\E4and if you keep&pushing me.../",
  "obj_sansb_442": "\\Xt\\E3hen i'll be&forced to use my\\R &special attack\\X./%%",
  "obj_sansb_448": "\\Xy\\E3eah^1, my \\Rspecial&attack\\X.&sound familiar?/",
  "obj_sansb_449": "\\Xw\\E1ell^1, get ready^1.&cause after the&next move^1, i'm&going to \\Ruse it\\X./",
  "obj_sansb_450": "\\E3so^1, if you don't&wanna see it^1, now&would be a good&time to die./%%",
  "obj_sansb_456": "\\E4well^1, here goes&nothing.../",
  "obj_sansb_457": "\\E3are you ready?/",
  "obj_sansb_458": "\\Xs\\E5urvive THIS^1, and&i'll show you my\\R &special attack\\X!/%%",
  "obj_sansb_477": ".../",
  "obj_sansb_478": "you're sparing me?/",
  "obj_sansb_479": "\\E1finally./",
  "obj_sansb_480": "\\E3buddy^1.&pal./",
  "obj_sansb_481": "\\E4i know how hard&it must be.../",
  "obj_sansb_482": "to make that&choice./",
  "obj_sansb_483": "to go back on&everything you've&worked up to./",
  "obj_sansb_484": "\\E0i want you to&know..^1.&i won't let it&go to waste./",
  "obj_sansb_485": "\\M1.../",
  "obj_sansb_486": "\\E3c'mere^1, pal./%%",
  "obj_sansb_954": "* Just keep attacking.",
  "obj_sansb_956": "* Sans's movements grow a&  little wearier.",
  "obj_sansb_958": "* Sans's movements seem to be&  slower.",
  "obj_sansb_960": "* Felt like a turning point.",
  "obj_sansb_962": "* You felt your sins crawling&  on your back.",
  "obj_sansb_963": "* You felt your sins weighing&  on your neck.",
  "obj_sansb_964": "* KARMA coursing through your&  veins.",
  "obj_sansb_965": "* Doomed to death of KARMA!",
  "obj_sansb_969": "* The REAL battle finally begins.",
  "obj_sansb_971": "* Reading this doesn't seem&  like the best use of time.",
  "obj_sansb_973": "* Sans is starting to look&  really tired.",
  "obj_sansb_975": "* Sans is preparing something.",
  "obj_sansb_977": "* Sans is getting ready to&  use his special attack.",
  "obj_sansb_985": "* Sans is sparing you.",
  "obj_sansb_1013": "* SANS 1 ATK 1 DEF&* The easiest enemy^1.&* Can only deal 1 damage./",
  "obj_sansb_1014": "* Can't keep dodging forever^1.&* Keep attacking./^",
  "obj_sansb_1018": "* SANS 1 ATK 1 DEF&* The easiest enemy^1.&* Can only deal 1 damage./^",
  "obj_sansb_1079": "it's a beautiful&day outside./",
  "obj_sansb_1080": "birds are singing^1,&flowers are&blooming.../",
  "obj_sansb_1081": "on days like these^1,&kids like you.../%%",
  "obj_sansb_1084": "it's a beautiful&day outside./",
  "obj_sansb_1085": "birds are singing^1,%%",
  "obj_sansb_1089": "ready?/%%",
  "obj_sansb_1152": "Should&be&burning&in hell./%%",
  "obj_sansb_body_1446": "\\E1huh./",
  "obj_sansb_body_1447": "\\M1always wondered why&people never use&their strongest&attack first./%%",
  "obj_sansb_body_1450": "\\E3anyway^1, as i was&saying^1, it's a&nice day out./",
  "obj_sansb_body_1451": "\\M1why not relax and&take a load off?/%%",
  "obj_sansb_body_1455": "here we go./%%",
  "obj_sansb_body_1468": "* You feel like you're going to&  have a bad time.",
  "obj_sansb_body_2091": "huff..^1. puff.../",
  "obj_sansb_body_2092": "all right^1.&that's it./",
  "obj_sansb_body_2093": "\\Xi\\M1t's time for my\\R &special attack\\X./",
  "obj_sansb_body_2094": "\\E3are you ready?/",
  "obj_sansb_body_2095": "\\E4here goes nothing./%%",
  "obj_sansb_body_2111": "\\E1yep./",
  "obj_sansb_body_2112": "\\E1that's right./",
  "obj_sansb_body_2113": "\\E3it's literally&nothing./",
  "obj_sansb_body_2114": "\\E1and it's not gonna&be anything^1,&either./",
  "obj_sansb_body_2115": "\\E4heh heh heh..^1.&ya get it?/",
  "obj_sansb_body_2116": "\\E1i know i can't&beat you./",
  "obj_sansb_body_2117": "\\E4one of your turns.../",
  "obj_sansb_body_2118": "\\E9you're just gonna&kill me./",
  "obj_sansb_body_2119": "\\E1so^1, uh./",
  "obj_sansb_body_2120": "\\E4i've decided.../",
  "obj_sansb_body_2121": "it's not gonna BE&your turn^1.&ever./",
  "obj_sansb_body_2122": "\\E3i'm just gonna&keep having MY&turn until you&give up./",
  "obj_sansb_body_2123": "\\E5even if it means&we have to stand&here until the&end of time./",
  "obj_sansb_body_2124": "\\E1capiche?/%%",
  "obj_sansb_body_2141": "\\E9you'll get bored&here./",
  "obj_sansb_body_2142": "\\E1if you haven't&gotten bored&already^1, i mean./",
  "obj_sansb_body_2143": "\\E5and then^1, you'll&finally quit./%%",
  "obj_sansb_body_2161": "\\E5i know your type./",
  "obj_sansb_body_2162": "\\E1you're^1, uh^1, very&determined^1, aren't&you?/",
  "obj_sansb_body_2163": "\\E4you'll never give&up^1, even if&there's^1, uh.../",
  "obj_sansb_body_2164": "\\E3absolutely NO&benefit to&persevering&whatsoever./",
  "obj_sansb_body_2165": "\\E1if i can make&that clear./",
  "obj_sansb_body_2166": "\\E4no matter what^1,&you'll just keep&going./",
  "obj_sansb_body_2167": "\\E9not out of any&desire for good&or evil.../",
  "obj_sansb_body_2168": "\\E3but just because&you think you&can./",
  "obj_sansb_body_2169": "\\E1and because you&\"can\".../",
  "obj_sansb_body_2170": "\\E9... you \"have to.\"/%%",
  "obj_sansb_body_2188": "\\E9but now^1, you've&reached the end./",
  "obj_sansb_body_2189": "\\E4there is nothing&left for you now./",
  "obj_sansb_body_2190": "\\E1so^1, uh^1, in my&personal opinion.../",
  "obj_sansb_body_2191": "\\E3the most&\"determined\"&thing you can&do here?/",
  "obj_sansb_body_2192": "\\E1is to^1, uh^1,&completely give&up./",
  "obj_sansb_body_2193": "\\E3and..^1. (yawn)&do literally&anything else./%%",
  "obj_sansb_body_2344": "heh^1, didja&really think you&would be able to",
  "obj_sansb_body_2495": ".../",
  "obj_sansb_body_2496": ".../",
  "obj_sansb_body_2497": ".../",
  "obj_sansb_body_2498": "so.../",
  "obj_sansb_body_2499": "guess that's it^1,&huh?/",
  "obj_sansb_body_2500": ".../",
  "obj_sansb_body_2501": "just.../",
  "obj_sansb_body_2502": "don't say i&didn't warn you./%%",
  "obj_sansb_body_2539": "welp./",
  "obj_sansb_body_2540": "i'm going to&grillby's./%%",
  "obj_sansb_body_2574": "papyrus^1, do you&want anything?/%%",
  "obj_sansbyetrigger_124": "* actually^1, hey..^1.&* hate to bother ya^1, but&  can you do me a favor?/",
  "obj_sansbyetrigger_125": "* i was thinking..^1.&* my brother's been&  kind of down lately.../",
  "obj_sansbyetrigger_126": "* he's never seen a human&  before^1. and seeing you&  might just make his day./",
  "obj_sansbyetrigger_127": "* don't worry^1, he's not&  dangerous./",
  "obj_sansbyetrigger_128": "\\E1* even if he tries to be./",
  "obj_sansbyetrigger_129": "\\E0* thanks a million^1.&* i'll be up ahead./%%",
  "obj_sansbyetrigger_132": "\\E0* well^1, i'll be straight-&  forward with you./",
  "obj_sansbyetrigger_133": "\\E1* my brother'd really&  like to see a human.../",
  "obj_sansbyetrigger_134": "\\E2* so^1, y'know^1, it'd&  really help me out.../",
  "obj_sansbyetrigger_135": "\\E1* if you kept pretending&  to be one./%%",
  "obj_sanscheckpoint_98": "* It's some sort of checkpoint&  or sentry-station./",
  "obj_sanscheckpoint_99": "* But there are bottles of&  ketchup^1, mustard^1, and relish&  sitting inside.../%%",
  "obj_sansdate3_116": "* well^1, here we are./%%",
  "obj_sansdate3_124": "* so./",
  "obj_sansdate3_125": "* your journey's&  almost over^1, huh?/",
  "obj_sansdate3_126": "\\E0* you must really&  wanna go home./",
  "obj_sansdate3_127": "\\E1* hey^1.&* i know the feeling^1,&  buddo./",
  "obj_sansdate3_128": "\\E0* though.../",
  "obj_sansdate3_129": "\\E1* maybe sometimes it's&  better to take what's&  given to you./",
  "obj_sansdate3_130": "\\E0* down here you've&  already got food^1,&  drink^1, friends.../",
  "obj_sansdate3_131": "* is what you have&  to do.../",
  "obj_sansdate3_132": "\\E1* really worth it?/%%",
  "obj_sansdate3_149": "* .../",
  "obj_sansdate3_150": "\\E1* ah^1, forget it./",
  "obj_sansdate3_151": "\\E0* i'm rootin' for&  ya^1, kid./%%",
  "obj_sansdate3_168": "* hey./",
  "obj_sansdate3_169": "\\E1* let me tell you&  a story./",
  "obj_sansdate3_170": "\\E0* so i'm a sentry in&  snowdin forest^1, right?/",
  "obj_sansdate3_171": "* i sit out there&  and watch for humans^1.&* it's kind of boring./",
  "obj_sansdate3_172": "\\E2* fortunately^1, deep in&  the forest.../",
  "obj_sansdate3_173": "\\E0* there's this HUGE&  locked door./",
  "obj_sansdate3_174": "* and it's perfect&  for practicing&  knock knock jokes./",
  "obj_sansdate3_175": "* so one day^1, i'm&  knocking 'em out^1,&  like usual./",
  "obj_sansdate3_176": "* i knock on the&  door and say&  \"knock knock.\"/",
  "obj_sansdate3_177": "* and suddenly^1, from&  the other side.../",
  "obj_sansdate3_178": "\\E1* i hear a woman's&  voice./",
  "obj_sansdate3_179": "\\Tt*\\E0 \"who is there?\" /",
  "obj_sansdate3_180": "\\Ts*\\E1 so^1, naturally^1, I&  respond:/",
  "obj_sansdate3_181": "\\E0* \"dishes.\"/",
  "obj_sansdate3_182": "\\Tt* \"dishes who?\"/",
  "obj_sansdate3_183": "\\Ts*\\E2 \"dishes a very&  bad joke.\"/",
  "obj_sansdate3_184": "\\E0* then she just&  howls with laughter./",
  "obj_sansdate3_185": "\\E1* like it's the best&  joke she's heard&  in a hundred years./",
  "obj_sansdate3_186": "\\E0* so I keep 'em&  coming^1, and she keeps&  laughing./",
  "obj_sansdate3_187": "\\E1* she's the best&  audience i've ever&  had./",
  "obj_sansdate3_188": "\\E0* then^1, after a&  dozen of 'em^1,&  SHE knocks and says.../",
  "obj_sansdate3_189": "\\Tt* \"Knock knock!\"/",
  "obj_sansdate3_190": "\\Ts* \\E1i say \"whos&  there?\"/",
  "obj_sansdate3_191": "\\Tt* \\E0\"old lady!\"/",
  "obj_sansdate3_192": "\\Ts*\\E1 \"old lady who?\"/",
  "obj_sansdate3_193": "\\Tt*\\E2 \"oh! I did not&  know you could&  yodel!\"/",
  "obj_sansdate3_194": "\\Ts*\\E1 wow./",
  "obj_sansdate3_195": "\\E2* needless to say^1,&  this woman was&  extremely good./",
  "obj_sansdate3_196": "\\E0* we kept telling&  each other jokes&  for hours./",
  "obj_sansdate3_197": "\\E0* eventually^1, i had&  to leave./",
  "obj_sansdate3_198": "\\E2* papyrus gets kind&  of cranky without&  his bedtime story./",
  "obj_sansdate3_199": "\\E0* but she told me&  to come by again^1,&  and so i did./",
  "obj_sansdate3_200": "\\E0* then i did again^1.&* and again^1.&* it's a thing now./",
  "obj_sansdate3_201": "* telling bad jokes&  through the door./",
  "obj_sansdate3_202": "\\E1* it rules./%%",
  "obj_sansdate3_221": "* .../",
  "obj_sansdate3_222": "\\E0* one day^1, though^1, i&  noticed she wasn't&  laughing very much./",
  "obj_sansdate3_223": "* i asked her what&  was up./",
  "obj_sansdate3_224": "* then she told me&  something strange./",
  "obj_sansdate3_225": "* \\Tt\"if a human ever&  comes through this&  door.../\"",
  "obj_sansdate3_226": "* \"... could you please^1,&  please promise&  something?\"/",
  "obj_sansdate3_227": "* \"watch over them^1,&  and protect them^1,&  will you not?\"/",
  "obj_sansdate3_228": "\\E0*\\Ts now^1, i hate making&  promises./",
  "obj_sansdate3_229": "\\E1* and this woman^1,&  i don't even know&  her name./",
  "obj_sansdate3_230": "\\E3* but.../",
  "obj_sansdate3_231": "\\E1* someone who sincerely&  likes bad jokes.../",
  "obj_sansdate3_232": "\\E2* has an integrity&  you can't say&  \"no\" to./%%",
  "obj_sansdate3_259": "\\E1* do you get what&  i'm saying?/",
  "obj_sansdate3_260": "\\E0* that promise i made&  to her.../",
  "obj_sansdate3_261": "\\E1* you know what would&  have happened if she&  hadn't said anything?/",
  "obj_sansdate3_262": "\\E3* ... buddy./%%",
  "obj_sansdate3_279": "* ... You'd be dead&  where you stand./%%",
  "obj_sansdate3_304": "\\E3* .../",
  "obj_sansdate3_305": "\\E1* hey^1, lighten up^1,&  bucko!/",
  "obj_sansdate3_306": "\\E2* i'm just joking&  with you./",
  "obj_sansdate3_307": "\\E1* besides.../",
  "obj_sansdate3_308": "\\E0* haven't i done a&  great job protecting&  you?/",
  "obj_sansdate3_309": "* i mean^1, look at&  yourself./",
  "obj_sansdate3_310": "\\E2* you haven't died&  a single time./",
  "obj_sansdate3_313": "\\E0* that's right^1, isn't&  it?/",
  "obj_sansdate3_314": "\\E2* well^1, chalk it&  up to my great&  skills./%%",
  "obj_sansdate3_317": "\\E0* hey^1, what's that&  look supposed to&  mean?/",
  "obj_sansdate3_318": "\\E1* am i wrong...?/%%",
  "obj_sansdate3_336": "* heh./%%",
  "obj_sansdate3_380": "* well^1, that's all./",
  "obj_sansdate3_381": "\\E1* take care of&  yourself^1, kid./",
  "obj_sansdate3_382": "\\E0* 'cause someone really&  cares about you./%%",
  "obj_sansdoor_98": "* (The door is locked.)/%%",
  "obj_sansdoor_102": "* (You unlock the door and&  enter...)/%%",
  "obj_sansmailbox_60": "* (It's a mailbox overflowing&  with unread junk mail.)/%%",
  "obj_sanssnowman_98": "* (It's a lump of snow with the&  word 'sans' written on it&  in red marker.)/%%",
  "obj_sanssteps_56": "* Seems like someone was&  walking in circles just&  to make noises.../%%",
  "obj_savepoint_97": "\\R* \\[1] left./%%",
  "obj_savepoint_99": "\\R* That comedian.../%%",
  "obj_savepoint_101": "* Determination./%%",
  "obj_savepoint_103": "* The comedian got away^1.&* Failure./%%",
  "obj_savepoint_118": "\\R* \\[1] left./%%",
  "obj_savepoint_120": "* Determination./%%",
  "obj_savepoint_135": "\\R* \\[1] left./%%",
  "obj_savepoint_137": "* Determination./%%",
  "obj_savepoint_145": "* Determination./%%",
  "obj_savepoint_fake_266": "Howdy!/",
  "obj_savepoint_fake_267": "It's me, FLOWEY./",
  "obj_savepoint_fake_268": "\\E2FLOWEY the FLOWER!/",
  "obj_savepoint_fake_269": "\\E0I owe you a HUGE thanks./",
  "obj_savepoint_fake_270": "\\E9You really did a number&on that old fool./",
  "obj_savepoint_fake_271": "\\E0Without you^1, I NEVER could&have gotten past him./",
  "obj_savepoint_fake_272": "\\E7But now^1, with YOUR help.../",
  "obj_savepoint_fake_273": "\\E8 %",
  "obj_savepoint_fake_274": "\\TFHe's DEAD./",
  "obj_savepoint_fake_275": "\\E6And I'VE got the human&SOULS!/%%",
  "obj_savepoint_fake_278": "%%%",
  "obj_savepoint_fake_332": "\\E0Boy!/",
  "obj_savepoint_fake_333": "\\E0I've been empty for so&long.../",
  "obj_savepoint_fake_334": "\\E4It feels great to have a&SOUL inside me again./",
  "obj_savepoint_fake_335": "\\E1Mmmm^1, I can feel them&wriggling.../",
  "obj_savepoint_fake_337": "\\E6Awww^1, you're feeling&left out^1, aren't you?/",
  "obj_savepoint_fake_338": "\\E1Well^1, that's just perfect./",
  "obj_savepoint_fake_339": "\\E0After all^1, I only have&six souls./",
  "obj_savepoint_fake_340": "\\E1I still need one more.../",
  "obj_savepoint_fake_341": "\\TFB\\E2efore I become GOD./",
  "obj_savepoint_fake_342": "\\E3And then^1, with my&newfound powers.../",
  "obj_savepoint_fake_343": "\\E7Monsters./",
  "obj_savepoint_fake_344": "\\E5Humans./",
  "obj_savepoint_fake_345": "\\E5Everyone^2./",
  "obj_savepoint_fake_346": "\\E8I'll show them all the REAL&meaning of this world./%%",
  "obj_savepoint_fake_347": "%%%",
  "obj_savepoint_fake_435": "\\E0Oh^1, and forget about escaping&to your old SAVE FILE./",
  "obj_savepoint_fake_436": "\\TFI\\E2t's gone FOREVER./",
  "obj_savepoint_fake_439": "\\E0Golly^1, if only you&had a SAVE FILE you&could run away to.../",
  "obj_savepoint_fake_440": "\\TFB\\E2ut you were just&too STUPID to make one!/",
  "obj_savepoint_fake_442": "\\TfB\\E3ut don't worry./",
  "obj_savepoint_fake_443": "\\E0Your old friend FLOWEY.../",
  "obj_savepoint_fake_444": "\\E1Has worked out a replacement&for you!/",
  "obj_savepoint_fake_445": "\\TFI\\E6'll SAVE over your own&death./",
  "obj_savepoint_fake_446": "\\E7So you can watch me tear&you to bloody pieces.../",
  "obj_savepoint_fake_447": "\\E8Over^1, and over^1, and over.../%%",
  "obj_savepoint_fake_490": "\\E9... what?/",
  "obj_savepoint_fake_491": "Do you really think&you can stop ME?/",
  "obj_savepoint_fake_492": "\\TfH\\E4ee hee hee.../%%",
  "obj_savepoint_fake_507": "\\E5You really ARE an idiot^4.%%",
  "obj_shamblingmass_70": "* As a slime^1, I'm outraged./%%",
  "obj_shamblingmass_74": "* As a slime^1, I'm overjoyed./%%",
  "obj_shamblingmass_79": "* As a slime^1, I'm saddened./%%",
  "obj_shop1_263": "\\E0* Take your time./*",
  "obj_shop1_264": "\\E0* Hello^1, traveller^1.&* How can I help you?/*",
  "obj_shop1_265": "* But nobody came./*",
  "obj_shop1_352": "\\E0What would&you like&to buy?/*",
  "obj_shop1_353": "\\E5Thanks for&your&purchase./*",
  "obj_shop1_354": "\\E0Just&looking?/*",
  "obj_shop1_355": "\\E6That's not&enough&money./*",
  "obj_shop1_356": "\\E6You're&carrying&too much./*",
  "obj_shop1_357": "/*",
  "obj_shop1_438": "\\E0Care to&chat?/*",
  "obj_shop1_476": "\\E3* Huh^1?&* Sell somethin'^1?&* Does this look like a&  pawn shop?/",
  "obj_shop1_477": "\\E4* I don't know how it works where&  you come from... but.../",
  "obj_shop1_478": "\\E0* If I started spending money&  on old branches and used&  bandages^1, I'd be out of business&  in a jiffy!/%%",
  "obj_shop1_480": "\\E4* If you're really hurtin' for&  cash^1, then maybe you could&  do some crowdfunding./",
  "obj_shop1_481": "* I hear people will pay for&  ANYTHING nowadays./%%",
  "obj_shop1_486": "* You took 758G from behind the&  counter./%%",
  "obj_shop1_492": "* Nothing left./%%",
  "obj_shop1_498": "\\E0* Bye now^1!&* Come again sometime!/%%",
  "obj_shop1_500": "* .../%%",
  "obj_shop1_504": "\\E0* Hiya^1! Welcome to Snowdin^1!&* I can't remember the last&  time I saw a fresh face around&  here./",
  "obj_shop1_505": "\\E4* Where did you come from^1?&* The capital?/",
  "obj_shop1_506": "\\E0* You don't look like a tourist^1.&* Are you here by yourself?/%%",
  "obj_shop1_511": "\\E0* I mean^1, it happened to you^1,&  right?/",
  "obj_shop1_512": "* There was a strange flash of&  white light..^1.&* Then I felt my body being pulled&  into..^1. something./",
  "obj_shop1_513": "* Then^1, suddenly^1, everything was&  back to normal./%%",
  "obj_shop1_518": "\\E0* You want to know what to do&  here in Snowdin?/",
  "obj_shop1_519": "\\E4* Grillby's has food^1, and the&  library has information.../",
  "obj_shop1_520": "* If you're tired^1, you can take&  a nap at the inn^1.&* It's right next door ^1- my sister&  runs it./",
  "obj_shop1_521": "\\E0* And if you're bored^1, you can&  sit outside and watch those wacky&  skeletons do their thing./",
  "obj_shop1_522": "\\E0* There's two of 'em..^1.&*\\E4 Brothers^1, I think^1.&* They just showed up one day&  and..^1.&*\\E0 ... asserted themselves./",
  "obj_shop1_523": "* The town has gotten a lot&  more interesting since then./%%",
  "obj_shop1_528": "\\E0* I heard that it was all 'cause&  a human came through here./",
  "obj_shop1_529": "* A human..^1.&* I can hardly believe it!/",
  "obj_shop1_530": "* Well if they decide to stop&  in^1, I'll be sure to give&  them a hero's welcome./%%",
  "obj_shop1_536": "\\E4* Think back to your history&  class.../",
  "obj_shop1_537": "\\E0* A long time ago^1, monsters lived&  in the RUINS back there in&  the forest./",
  "obj_shop1_538": "* Long story short^1, we all decided&  to leave the ruins and head&  for the end of the caverns./",
  "obj_shop1_539": "* Along the way^1, some fuzzy folk&  decided they liked the cold&  and set up camp in Snowdin./",
  "obj_shop1_540": "\\E6* Oh^1, and don't think about&  trying to explore the RUINS.../",
  "obj_shop1_541": "\\E0* The door's been locked for&  ages^1.&* So unless you're a ghost&  or can burrow under the door^1,&  forget about it./%%",
  "obj_shop1_545": "\\E0* Didja hear^1?&* The RUINS have been opened up^1,&  and get this.../",
  "obj_shop1_546": "* They were opened from the&  INSIDE./",
  "obj_shop1_547": "* Apparently the Queen had been&  staying inside there for God&  knows how long./",
  "obj_shop1_548": "* Pretty unbelievable^1, huh!?/%%",
  "obj_shop1_555": "\\E0* Life is the same as usual./",
  "obj_shop1_556": "\\E1* A little claustrophobic.../",
  "obj_shop1_557": "\\E2* But..^1. we all know deep down&  that freedom is coming^1, don't we?/",
  "obj_shop1_558": "\\E2* As long as we got that hope^1, we&  can grit our teeth and face the&  same struggles^1, day after day.../",
  "obj_shop1_559": "\\E5* That's life^1, ain't it?/%%",
  "obj_shop1_563": "\\E0* Well^1, I suppose I'll move&  my store to the overworld.../",
  "obj_shop1_564": "* ... haven't planned much&  more than that^1, I'm afraid./%%",
  "obj_shop1_570": "* (There's a note here.)/",
  "obj_shop1_571": "* Please don't hurt my family./%%",
  "obj_shop2_234": "* Don't be shy now./*",
  "obj_shop2_235": "* Woah there^1!&* I've got some neat&  junk for sale./*",
  "obj_shop2_236": "* Wah ha ha^1!&* I knew you could&  do it!/*",
  "obj_shop2_237": "* Wa ha ha..^1.&* So you came here^1.&* What a treat!/*",
  "obj_shop2_287": "What are&you lookin&for?/*",
  "obj_shop2_288": "Thanks!&Wa ha ha./*",
  "obj_shop2_289": "Careful&with that./*",
  "obj_shop2_290": "You're&a bit&short&on cash./*",
  "obj_shop2_291": "You're&carrying&too much!/*",
  "obj_shop2_295": "Don't&expect a&discount./*",
  "obj_shop2_296": "Here we&are./*",
  "obj_shop2_297": ".../*",
  "obj_shop2_298": "Eh^1?&You can't&afford&it?/*",
  "obj_shop2_299": "Don't you&have&enough?/*",
  "obj_shop2_390": "Anything&you&wanna&know?/*",
  "obj_shop2_392": "Really?&YOU&wanna&chat?/*",
  "obj_shop2_438": "\\E2* Ha^1!\\E0 &* I'm tryin' to get RID of&  my junk^1, not get more of it!/",
  "obj_shop2_439": "\\E4* Though^1, I've heard if you&  want to sell stuff^1, the Temmie&  Village is your best bet./",
  "obj_shop2_440": "\\E0* Where is it?/",
  "obj_shop2_441": "\\E3* .../",
  "obj_shop2_442": "\\E0* I don't remember./%%",
  "obj_shop2_444": "* For the last time^1, I'm not&  taking it!/%%",
  "obj_shop2_445": "* I hear people will pay for&  ANYTHING nowadays./%%",
  "obj_shop2_448": "\\E3* I wouldn't buy your chitzy&  garbage at knifepoint./%%",
  "obj_shop2_454": "* Be careful out there^1, kid!/%%",
  "obj_shop2_456": "* Good riddance./%%",
  "obj_shop2_462": "* I've been around a long time^1.&*\\E3 Maybe too long./",
  "obj_shop2_463": "\\E2* Studying history sure is&  easy when you've lived through&  so much of it yourself^1!&*\\E0 Wa ha ha!/%%",
  "obj_shop2_468": "\\E0* Long ago^1, ASGORE and I&  agreed that escaping would&  be pointless.../",
  "obj_shop2_469": "\\E3* Since once we left^1, humans&  would just kill us./",
  "obj_shop2_470": "\\E1* I felt a little betrayed when&  he eventually changed his&  mind./",
  "obj_shop2_471": "\\E4* But now^1, I think..^1.&* Maybe he was right to./",
  "obj_shop2_472": "\\E2* 'Cause after all^1, even though&  we never escaped.../",
  "obj_shop2_473": "\\E3* A human's killing us anyway^1,&  ain't that right?/%%",
  "obj_shop2_478": "* OK^1, OK^1!&* I remember it clearly now./",
  "obj_shop2_479": "\\E3* It was the monthly address at&  the castle^1, and the queen&  was giving her part on&  current events./",
  "obj_shop2_480": "\\E0* After finishing her update^1,&  she moved to pass the&  microphone to the king./",
  "obj_shop2_481": "\\E3* However^1, she didn't realize&  the microphone was still in&  her hands when she said:/",
  "obj_shop2_482": "\\E2* \"Your turn^1, Fluffybuns.\"/",
  "obj_shop2_483": "\\E0* The audience burst into&  laughter./",
  "obj_shop2_484": "\\E2* Realizing what she had said^1,&  she started laughing too./",
  "obj_shop2_485": "\\E0* After a few moments^1, the&  king held up his arms^1.&* The crowd grew silent./",
  "obj_shop2_486": "\\E3* He leaned towards the&  microphone^1, expression..^1.&* Stern./",
  "obj_shop2_487": "\\E0* \"Dear citizens.^1\"&* \"Thank you for coming&  here today.\"/",
  "obj_shop2_488": "\\E3* \"I..^1. King Fluffybuns...\"/",
  "obj_shop2_489": "\\E2* And the rest is history./%%",
  "obj_shop2_497": "\\E2* What's that^1?&* You want me to repeat myself?/",
  "obj_shop2_498": "\\E0* Heck no^1!&* Your eyes still work..^1.&* Go read a book or something^1!&* Wahaha!/%%",
  "obj_shop2_503": "\\E0* Oh yeah..^1.&* The prophecy./",
  "obj_shop2_504": "\\E4* Legend has it, an 'angel' who has&  seen the surface will descend&  from above and bring us freedom./",
  "obj_shop2_505": "\\E3* Lately^1, the people have been&  taking a bleaker outlook.../",
  "obj_shop2_506": "\\E4* Callin' that winged circle the&  'Angel of Death.'/",
  "obj_shop2_507": "\\E3* A harbinger of destruction^1,&  waitin' to 'free' us from&  this mortal realm.../",
  "obj_shop2_508": "* In my opinion^1, when I see&  that little circle.../",
  "obj_shop2_509": "\\E2* I jus' think it looks neat^1!&* Wahaha!/%%",
  "obj_shop2_516": "\\E0* That emblem actually predates&  written history^1.&* The original meaning has been&  lost to time.../",
  "obj_shop2_517": "\\E4* All we know is that the&  triangles symbolize us monsters&  below^1, and the winged circle&  above symbolizes.../",
  "obj_shop2_518": "\\E3* Somethin' else./",
  "obj_shop2_519": "\\E0* Most people say it's the&  'angel^1,' from the prophecy.../%%",
  "obj_shop2_524": "\\E0* Eh^1?&* You don't know what that is?/",
  "obj_shop2_525": "\\E1* What are they teaching you&  kids in school nowadays...^1?&*\\E2 Wa ha ha!/",
  "obj_shop2_526": "\\W*\\E0 That's the \\YDelta Rune^1,\\W the&  emblem of our kingdom^1.&* The Kingdom.../",
  "obj_shop2_527": "* ... of Monsters./",
  "obj_shop2_528": "* Wahaha^1!&* Great name^1, huh^1?&* It's as I always say.../",
  "obj_shop2_529": "* Ol' King Fluffybuns can't name&  for beans!/%%",
  "obj_shop2_537": "\\E3* Eh^1?&* Goat?/",
  "obj_shop2_538": "\\E2* Actually^1, that reminds me^1.&* Toriel once wore a flower-&  patterned muu-muu... /",
  "obj_shop2_539": "\\E0* Folks kept saying \"nice muu-&  muu\" to her^1, but she kept&  thinking they were calling&  her a cow./",
  "obj_shop2_540": "\\E1* So she never wore it again./",
  "obj_shop2_541": "\\E3* What was the question again?/",
  "obj_shop2_542": "\\E0* Oh^1.&* Right^1.&* ASGORE./",
  "obj_shop2_543": "\\E3* He's a real interesting&  type of monster^1.&* The strongest type of all./",
  "obj_shop2_544": "\\E0* We call 'em Boss Monsters./",
  "obj_shop2_545": "* When they have an offspring^1,&  the SOUL power of the&  parents flows into the&  child.../",
  "obj_shop2_546": "* Causing the child to grow&  as the parents age./",
  "obj_shop2_547": "\\E3* But ASGORE doesn't have a&  child^1.&* So he's been stuck at the&  same age..^1.&* And probably will be forever./",
  "obj_shop2_548": "\\E1* Huh^1?&* What if the child is a&  human...^1? What?/",
  "obj_shop2_549": "\\E1* Nah^1. That wouldn't work^1.&* So if ASGORE's your father^1,&  he'll definitely outlive&  you./%%",
  "obj_shop2_555": "\\E1* I've lived too long to&  be afraid of something&  like you./",
  "obj_shop2_556": "\\E2* Try it^1, kiddo!/",
  "obj_shop2_557": "\\E3* ... I know you can't here./",
  "obj_shop2_558": "\\E1* Wah ha..^1.&* Knowledge like that is&  the only reason I've&  survived so long./%%",
  "obj_shop2_564": "* King Fluffybuns^1?&* He's a friendly^1, happy-go-lucky&  kind of guy.../",
  "obj_shop2_565": "\\E4* If you keep walking around long&  enough^1, you'll probably meet him^1.&*\\E0 He loves to walk around and&  talk to people./",
  "obj_shop2_566": "\\E3* Eh^1?&* Why do I call Dreemurr&  'Fluffybuns?^1'&*\\E2 Oh^1, that's a great story!/",
  "obj_shop2_567": "\\E3* .../",
  "obj_shop2_568": "\\E0* I don't remember it./",
  "obj_shop2_569": "* But if you come back much&  later^1, I'm sure I'll have&  remembered by then./%%",
  "obj_shop2_573": "\\E2* Oh yeah^1!&* Of course^1.&* Toriel was queen^1, and&  Asgore was the king./",
  "obj_shop2_574": "\\E3* It was tragic when she left./",
  "obj_shop2_575": "\\E1* Since everyone knew she was&  really the brains behind the&  throne.../",
  "obj_shop2_576": "\\E0* But it was also just a&  teensy^1, teensy bit relieving^1,&  you know?/",
  "obj_shop2_577": "\\E3* Those two were really&  insufferable together..^1.&* Nuzzling noses^1, bein' all cute&  n' cuddly in public..^1.&* Embarrassing their children.../",
  "obj_shop2_578": "\\E0* They were so sweet it&  made me SICK^1.&* Thank god those days are&  over!/%%",
  "obj_shop2_584": "\\E3* Eh^1? Fight you?/",
  "obj_shop2_585": "\\E1* Nah..^1. I'm not a hero^1.&* Never was./",
  "obj_shop2_586": "\\E2* And b'sides..^1.&* These old bones aren't fit&  for fighting anyhoo./",
  "obj_shop2_587": "\\E3* One attack from you^1, and&  then I'd... well.../",
  "obj_shop2_588": "\\E2* At least by talking to&  you^1, I've bought enough time&  for some of them to escape./%%",
  "obj_shop2_595": "\\E0* Undyne^1?&* Yeah^1, she's a local hero&  around here./",
  "obj_shop2_596": "\\E4* Through grit and determination&  alone^1, she fought her way to&  the top of the Royal Guard./",
  "obj_shop2_597": "\\E3* Actually^1, she just came through&  here asking about someone who&  looked just like you.../",
  "obj_shop2_598": "\\E0* I'd watch your back^1, kid^1.&* And buy some items..^1.&* It might just save your hide^1!&* Wa ha ha!/%%",
  "obj_shop2_601": "\\E0* Undyne^1.&* She's really come a long way&  since she was a little&  urchin./",
  "obj_shop2_602": "\\E2* I used to be a hero myself^1,&  back in the old days^1.&* Gerson^1, the Hammer of Justice./",
  "obj_shop2_603": "\\E3* When she was younger^1, Undyne&  would follow me around^1, to&  watch me beat up bad guys.../",
  "obj_shop2_604": "\\E0* Sometimes she'd even try&  to help!/",
  "obj_shop2_605": "\\E3* Though^1, most of the time&  the folks she attacked weren't&  bad guys^1.&* It'd be the mailman or&  something like that./",
  "obj_shop2_606": "\\E2* Anyhoo^1, I appreciated it^1!&* Wah ha ha ha!!!/%%",
  "obj_shop2_612": "\\E1* I'm not a hero./",
  "obj_shop2_613": "\\E3* But I know there's someone&  out there./",
  "obj_shop2_614": "\\E0* Someone who'll never give&  up trying to do the&  right thing^1, no matter&  what./",
  "obj_shop2_615": "\\E4* There's no prophecy or&  legend 'bout anyone like&  that./",
  "obj_shop2_616": "\\E3* It's just something I know&  is true./",
  "obj_shop2_617": "\\E0* That someone like that&  will strike you down./%%",
  "obj_shop3_357": "* Don't be shy now./*",
  "obj_shop3_358": "* Hey^1!&* Check it&  out!/*",
  "obj_shop3_359": "* But^1, like./*",
  "obj_shop3_362": "* Yeah!&* Check it&  out!/*",
  "obj_shop3_363": "* Nobody&  came and&  stuff./*",
  "obj_shop3_474": "\\E0You should&buy ALL&our stuff!/*",
  "obj_shop3_475": "\\E4Bratty!&We're&gonna&be rich!/*",
  "obj_shop3_476": "\\E0So are&you gonna&buy it??/*",
  "obj_shop3_477": "\\E0You need&WAY more&money./*",
  "obj_shop3_478": "\\E0You have&TOO many&items!!!/*",
  "obj_shop3_479": "\\E4We're all&$$$$$old&out!&Mee-YOW!/*",
  "obj_shop3_481": "/*",
  "obj_shop3_599": "So, like,&what's up?/*",
  "obj_shop3_650": "* Thanks^1, but we^1,&  like^1, don't&  really need&  anything./*",
  "obj_shop3_658": "\\M2* Oh my God^1.&* Is that a&  glamburger?/*",
  "obj_shop3_668": "* Stole 5G&  from the&  till./%%",
  "obj_shop3_673": "* The till&  is empty./%%",
  "obj_shop3_683": "* Like^1, see&  you later!/*",
  "obj_shop3_685": "* Like^1, later&  and stuff!/*",
  "obj_shop3_690": "* .../*",
  "obj_shop3_692": "* .../*",
  "obj_shop3_710": "* I'm Bratty^1, and&  this is my&  best friend^1,&  Catty./*",
  "obj_shop3_713": "* I'm Catty^1, and&  this is my&  best friend^1,&  Bratty./*",
  "obj_shop3_726": "\\M3* Well^1, that kind&  of guy.../",
  "obj_shop3_727": "\\M5* You hang out&  with him once^1,&  then he wants&  to hang out.../",
  "obj_shop3_728": "\\M2* All^1.&* The^1.&* Time./%%",
  "obj_shop3_736": "\\M5* Oh^1, uh.../*",
  "obj_shop3_745": "\\M4* OK^1, like^1,&  the annoying&  thing is.../*",
  "obj_shop3_754": "\\M2* Oh^1, that guy&  from the&  store^1?&*\\M4 Yuck^1, what a&  creep./*",
  "obj_shop3_763": "\\M0* So^1, we're&  like^1,&  totally&  free now^1,&  huh?/*",
  "obj_shop3_778": "* Where do we&  get the&  garbage?/",
  "obj_shop3_779": "\\M4* Like^1, the&  garbage store^1,&  duh!!!/%%",
  "obj_shop3_788": "* I mean^1, like^1,&  where does&  anyone get guns^1,&  or food^1, or.../*",
  "obj_shop3_798": "* The stuff&  inside^1, is&  like.../*",
  "obj_shop3_807": "\\M2* Oh^1, oops^1,&  really?/",
  "obj_shop3_808": "\\M3* Uh^1, well^1,&  when we&  said^1, um.../",
  "obj_shop3_809": "* We were&  hyped for the&  destruction&  of humanity.../",
  "obj_shop3_810": "* We were^1,&  just^1, like^1,&  joking^1, you&  know?/%%",
  "obj_shop3_822": "* So^1, like^1,&  Dr. Alphys&  built Mettaton^1,&  right?/*",
  "obj_shop3_829": "\\M6* Oh my God^1.&* Mettaton./",
  "obj_shop3_830": "\\M6* He's like..^1.&* My robot&  husband.          /",
  "obj_shop3_831": "\\M4* I think we're&  like..^1. both&  going to marry&  him./*",
  "obj_shop3_833": "\\E2* Oh my GOD^1,&* METTATON./",
  "obj_shop3_834": "\\E2* Actually he's&  like..^1.&* MY robot&  husband./",
  "obj_shop3_835": "* We're both&  like^1, ALREADY&  married to&  him./*",
  "obj_shop3_836": "\\E6* He just^1, like^1,&  doesn't know&  it yet./%%",
  "obj_shop3_845": "* Hmmm..^1.&* Now that&  we're&  gonna be&  free.../*",
  "obj_shop3_859": "\\M5* Oh my God^1.&* Alphys./",
  "obj_shop3_860": "\\M0* She used to&  live on our&  street./*",
  "obj_shop3_862": "\\E7* Oh my god^1,&* ALPHYS./",
  "obj_shop3_863": "\\E0* She was like&  a big sister./*",
  "obj_shop3_870": "\\M0* So Alphys&  has always^1,&  like.../*",
  "obj_shop3_879": "\\M4* Oh my God^1.&* He's a total&  goober./",
  "obj_shop3_880": "\\M0* Like^1, I LOVE&  that guy./",
  "obj_shop3_881": "\\M5* God^1, we're&  like.../",
  "obj_shop3_882": "\\M1* SO hyped for&  the destruction&  of humanity./*",
  "obj_shop3_884": "\\E0* He's a big^1,&  fuzzy&  goofball!!   /",
  "obj_shop3_885": "\\E0* He's like^1,&  SO nice.  /",
  "obj_shop3_886": "\\E7* God^1, we're&  like.../",
  "obj_shop3_887": "\\E1* SO hyped for&  the destruction&  of humanity./*",
  "obj_shop3_898": "\\M0* Me^1?&* Yeah^1, I&  LOVE cats!/",
  "obj_shop3_899": "\\M1* They're^1,&  like^1,&  SO tasty!!/*",
  "obj_shop3_901": "\\E8* Me^1?&* Yeah^1, I&  LOVE cats!/",
  "obj_shop3_902": "\\E1* They're^1,&  like^1,&  SO cute!!!/*",
  "obj_shop3_910": "* Hey^1, this is&  Bratty!/*",
  "obj_shop3_912": "* Hey^1, this is&  Catty!/*",
  "obj_shop3_959": "\\E3* TOTALLY wicked&  expensive./%%",
  "obj_shop3_970": "* But^1, like^1, this&  stuff we found&  is like.../*",
  "obj_shop3_980": "\\E3* TOTALLY wicked&  cheap./%%",
  "obj_shop3_991": "\\M5* You should.../",
  "obj_shop3_992": "\\M1* TOTALLY wicked&  buy all of&  it?/*",
  "obj_shop3_994": "\\E7* Like...      /",
  "obj_shop3_995": "\\E4* TOTALLY wicked&  buy all of&  it?/*",
  "obj_shop3_1014": "\\E1* We found it in&  the garbage!/%%",
  "obj_shop3_1033": "\\M3* It's GOOD&  garbage./*",
  "obj_shop3_1035": "\\E4* It's like^1,&  really good&  garbage./%%",
  "obj_shop3_1055": "\\M5* ...../",
  "obj_shop3_1056": "\\M1* Waterfall&  mostly./*",
  "obj_shop3_1058": "\\E7* ...../",
  "obj_shop3_1059": "\\E1* I found a gun&  in a dumpster!/%%",
  "obj_shop3_1071": "\\E6* That's like^1,&  what they&  TELL you./%%",
  "obj_shop3_1082": "\\M2* But like..^1.&* Mettaton always&  acts like.../*",
  "obj_shop3_1093": "\\E5* ... being built&  was HIS&  idea somehow./%%",
  "obj_shop3_1104": "\\M5* And even right&  after he was&  built.../*",
  "obj_shop3_1115": "\\E7* ... he acted&  like Alphys was&  an old friend./%%",
  "obj_shop3_1126": "\\M4* But they're&  like..^1.&* Not friends&  anymore./*",
  "obj_shop3_1137": "\\E1* Yeah!!^1!&* Unlike me&  and Bratty!^1!&* Best friends&  for-EVER!!!/%%",
  "obj_shop3_1156": "\\M4* I mean^1, like^1,&  if your big&  sister.../*",
  "obj_shop3_1167": "\\E1* Takes you on&  trips to the&  dump./%%",
  "obj_shop3_1179": "\\M0* She showed us&  the coolest&  places to&  find trash./*",
  "obj_shop3_1189": "\\E7* She was always&  collecting&  these weird&  cartoons./%%",
  "obj_shop3_1201": "\\M5* Then she&  became the&  Royal&  Scientist.../*",
  "obj_shop3_1211": "\\E5* Yeah^1, we&  haven't seen&  her in&  forever.../%%",
  "obj_shop3_1231": "\\E2* Thought ASGORE&  is a SUPER&  cutie./%%",
