  "obj_shop3_2196": "* Signed^1,&  Bratty <3/*",
  "obj_shop3_2198": "* Signed^1,&  Catty <3/*",
  "obj_shop4_244": "\\E0* The customer is&  always right./*",
  "obj_shop4_245": "\\E0* Welcome to MTT-Brand&  Burger Emporium^1, home&  of the Glamburger^1.&* Sparkle up your&  day (TM)./*",
  "obj_shop4_249": "\\E3* Anything else you&  need?/*",
  "obj_shop4_250": "\\E3* What can I do for you^1,&  little buddy?/*",
  "obj_shop4_252": "\\E1* (Why do I always&  get the freaks?)/*",
  "obj_shop4_329": "\\E0How can&I help&you, O&customer?/*",
  "obj_shop4_330": "\\E2Thanksy!&Have a&FABU-FUL&day!!!/*",
  "obj_shop4_331": "\\E1So do&you want&it or&not???/*",
