  "obj_shop4_343": "\\E6Like I'm&making&THAT&again./*",
  "obj_shop4_347": "\\E3Are you&gonna&order or&what?/*",
  "obj_shop4_348": "\\E6Here you&go^1,&little&weirdo./*",
  "obj_shop4_349": "\\E1So do&you want&it or&not???/*",
  "obj_shop4_350": "\\E1That's not&the right&amount of&money./*",
  "obj_shop4_351": "\\E1You&don't&have&room./*",
  "obj_shop4_352": "\\E1We don't&HAVE&any&more./*",
  "obj_shop4_472": "\\E3Take it&from me^1,&little&buddy./*",
  "obj_shop4_473": "\\E3Nothing&else to&do!/*",
  "obj_shop4_519": "\\E1* (WHY IS THIS PERSON TRYING TO&  SELL ME SOMETHING THIS IS&  A HAMBURGER RESTAURANT I'M&  JUST TRYING TO SURVIVE)/%%",
  "obj_shop4_521": "\\E3* WHO DO YOU THINK YOU ARE./%%",
  "obj_shop4_525": "\\E6* Hmmm..^1.&* Why not try selling that to&  the two chicks in the alley?/%%",
  "obj_shop4_529": "\\E3* Ah^1. Yes^1.&* I really want to buy your&  weird dusty artifacts..^1.&* NOT./%%",
  "obj_shop4_535": "\\E2* Have a SPARKULAR day!/%%",
  "obj_shop4_538": "\\E6* Any time^1, little buddy./%%",
  "obj_shop4_539": "\\E6* Alone again.../%%",
  "obj_shop4_545": "\\E6* I'm getting on in years^1, so&  let me give you some&  advice^1, little buddy./",
  "obj_shop4_546": "\\E3* You've still got time^1.&* Don't live like me./",
  "obj_shop4_547": "\\E6* I'm 19 years old and I've&  already wasted my entire life./%%",
  "obj_shop4_551": "\\E0* So we're free^1, huh^1?&* Mettaton told us as much./",
  "obj_shop4_552": "\\E4* Then he told me^1, \"don't&  think that means you're&  getting out of work early.\"/",
  "obj_shop4_553": "\\E6* Ah..^1. my boss.&* I love that guy./",
  "obj_shop4_554": "\\E3* And by that I mean I hate&  him so^1, so much./%%",
  "obj_shop4_559": "\\E1* Evacuation^1?&* You're yanking my chain^1,&  little weirdo./",
  "obj_shop4_560": "\\E3* So WHAT if everybody else&  left work?&* So WHAT if nobody's buying&  anything?/",
  "obj_shop4_561": "\\E6* Par for the course^1,&  little weirdo^1.&* Par for the course./%%",
  "obj_shop4_566": "* I'm a goofy goober Yeah &  this errorr. message./%%",
  "obj_shop4_570": "\\E6* Thank you^1, little buddy./%%",
  "obj_shop4_575": "\\E5* They wanna hang out after&  work?/",
  "obj_shop4_576": "\\E3* Ha^1! Ahahaha!^1! Yes!!^1!&* I won't let you down!!/",
  "obj_shop4_577": "\\E6* Little buddy..^1. thank you./",
  "obj_shop4_578": "* You've brought a tear to the&  eye of this old man./",
  "obj_shop4_579": "\\E5* So^1, uh^1, where do they&  want to go?/",
  "obj_shop4_580": "\\E4* .../",
  "obj_shop4_581": "* They want to hang out at&  the garbage dump./",
  "obj_shop4_582": "* .../",
  "obj_shop4_583": "\\E6* Well^1, nowhere to go but&  up^1, right^1, little buddy?/%%",
  "obj_shop4_588": "\\E6* Hey little buddy^1, wanna help&  me pick a spicy outfit for&  my little shindig later?/",
  "obj_shop4_589": "\\E4* Though^1, now that I think&  about it^1, I had to throw away&  all of my clothes to make&  room for the outfits Mettaton&  gave me.../",
  "obj_shop4_590": "\\E5* Don't take it the wrong way^1.&* They're just all these.../",
  "obj_shop4_591": "\\E4* Weird getups./",
  "obj_shop4_592": "\\E1* \"Promotional\" costumes^1.&* For \"holidays.^1\"&* Or \"specials.^1\"&* Or \"because he felt like it.\"/",
  "obj_shop4_593": "\\E3* The thing IS though^1!&* Most of the time I'm the&  only employee who has to&  wear this stuff!/",
  "obj_shop4_594": "\\E3* Sometimes he even calls me&  into his office just to..^1.&* Make me put something on.../",
  "obj_shop4_595": "\\E4* Then he laughs and lets me&  go back to work as normal./",
  "obj_shop4_596": "\\E6* Anyways^1, I won't sweat it^1,&  little buddy^1.&* I'll take it casual./",
  "obj_shop4_597": "* NEVER let hot people think&  you care^1.&* That's how they GET you./%%",
  "obj_shop4_603": "\\E5* Well^1?&* Don't keep me waiting^1,&  little buddy!!/%%",
  "obj_shop4_608": "\\E4* The girls were..^1.&* Talking about me...?/",
  "obj_shop4_609": "* They say I should stop acting&  like they owe me.../",
  "obj_shop4_610": "\\E5* ... and if I want to be&  FRIENDS with them^1, I should&  just..^1. uh^1, try to see&  things from their&  perspective?/",
  "obj_shop4_611": "\\E4* Wow./",
  "obj_shop4_612": "\\E6* Poor^1, naive little buddy^1.&* They've brainwashed you./",
  "obj_shop4_613": "* \"Friendship\" is just a hot&  person's way of making you&  their slave./",
  "obj_shop4_614": "\\E4* .../",
  "obj_shop4_615": "\\E5* So^1, uh^1, what time would&  they wanna hang out?/%%",
  "obj_shop4_620": "\\E5* Huh^1?&* Yeah^1, those two vendors in back^1.&* The girls./",
  "obj_shop4_621": "\\E3* NOT the Nice Cream guy./",
  "obj_shop4_622": "\\E5* He keeps coming in here and&  asking me stuff like^1,&* \"Hey Burgy, what do you think&  of this joke for my next&  ice cream wrapper?\"/",
  "obj_shop4_623": "\\E4* Joke^1?&* Why are you calling it a JOKE?/",
  "obj_shop4_624": "\\E3* You drew a picture of two&  dudes hugging and wrote&  \"I love hugs!\" on it./",
  "obj_shop4_625": "\\E3* You somehow understand comedy&  EVEN LESS than that guy who&  keeps going on stage and&  crying about his family./",
  "obj_shop4_626": "\\E5* Anyway^1, I^1, uh^1, just tell him&  that they're good^1, because he&  gives me the nice cream for&  free afterward.../%%",
  "obj_shop4_631": "\\E4* Everyone calls me burgerpants&  now./",
  "obj_shop4_632": "\\E5* But you won't^1, will you^1,&  little buddy?/%%",
  "obj_shop4_638": "\\E6* So I went out to the alley&  to see those two ladies^1, and&  uh..^1. you know^1, see what'd&  happen next./",
  "obj_shop4_639": "\\E4* .../",
  "obj_shop4_640": "\\E5* Then my boss^1, uh^1, saw me and&  asked me what I was doing./",
  "obj_shop4_641": "\\E1* I was so startled^1, the hamburgers&  in my pockets tumbled out&  onto the ground./",
  "obj_shop4_642": "\\E3* Not wanting to lose face^1,&  I scrambled to pick them up!/",
  "obj_shop4_643": "\\E3* But^1, as I was leaning over^1,&  the weight of the remaining&  hamburgers.../",
  "obj_shop4_644": "\\E5* ... caused my pants to fall&  down./",
  "obj_shop4_645": "\\E4* Then the girls laughed at me./",
  "obj_shop4_646": "\\E4* Everyone calls me Burgerpants&  now./%%",
  "obj_shop4_647": "%%%",
  "obj_shop4_651": "\\E6* Listen^1.&* I like you^1, little buddy^1.&* So I'm gonna save you a lot&  of trouble./",
  "obj_shop4_652": "\\E3* Never interact with attractive&  people./",
  "obj_shop4_653": "\\E6* Unless you're \"one of them^1,\"&  they're just gonna take&  advantage of you./",
  "obj_shop4_654": "\\E3* Like that time those two&  chicks asked me to sneak them&  some glamburgers./",
  "obj_shop4_655": "\\E6* And I^1, naive teenager that&  I was^1, said yes to them./",
  "obj_shop4_656": "\\E4* Bad idea./%%",
  "obj_shop4_662": "\\E4* Those girls?&* The ones who saw my pants&  fall down?/",
  "obj_shop4_663": "\\E5* Well^1, we're all gonna be&  free^1, so I'll never see&  them again^1, at least!/%%",
  "obj_shop4_667": "\\E4* So we're free now./",
  "obj_shop4_668": "\\E5* Does that mean my double-&  date is cancelled...?/",
  "obj_shop4_669": "\\E4* .../",
  "obj_shop4_670": "\\E5* I know^1, it wasn't really&  a..^1.&* A date./",
  "obj_shop4_671": "\\E6* Here's a trick^1, little buddy^1:&* Lie to yourself all the time^1.&* It makes you feel better./%%",
  "obj_shop4_678": "\\E4* Well^1, Mettaton didn't tell me&  I HAD to work, I guess.../",
  "obj_shop4_679": "\\E3* But that's the thing^1!&* Sometimes he doesn't even&  call me into work until&  halfway into my shift!/",
  "obj_shop4_680": "\\E4* If I don't play it safe^1,&  he's going to yell at me./",
  "obj_shop4_681": "\\E6* Okay^1, maybe \"yell\" is the&  wrong term./",
  "obj_shop4_682": "\\E4* It's more like he has this..^1.&* CD album he plays.../",
  "obj_shop4_683": "\\E5* That's entirely full of&  songs about how bad I am&  at my job./%%",
  "obj_shop4_698": "\\E5* Let's not talk about this./%%",
  "obj_shop4_704": "\\E1* Why do people find him so&  attractive??/",
  "obj_shop4_705": "\\E3* He's literally just a freaking&  rectangle./",
  "obj_shop4_706": "\\E4* .../",
  "obj_shop4_707": "* You know^1, one time^1, I bought&  one of those^1, uh^1, kits&  online..^1. to.../",
  "obj_shop4_708": "\\E5* Uh^1, make yourself more&  rectangular./",
  "obj_shop4_709": "\\E4* .../",
  "obj_shop4_710": "\\E5* They don't work./%%",
  "obj_shop4_716": "\\E3* God^1, have you even looked&  around^1?&* This place is a labyrinth of&  bad choices./",
  "obj_shop4_717": "* And every time we try to change&  something for the better^1, he&  vetoes it and says \"that's not&  how they do it on the&  surface.\"/",
  "obj_shop4_718": "\\E1Oh! Right!/",
  "obj_shop4_719": "\\E3* Humans are always eating&  hamburgers made of SEQUINS&  AND GLUE./%%",
  "obj_shop4_724": "\\E5* When I first came to Hotland^1,&  it was my dream to work&  with Mettaton./",
  "obj_shop4_725": "\\E4* .../",
  "obj_shop4_726": "\\E3* Well^1, be careful what you&  wish for^1, little buddy!/%%",
  "obj_shop4_734": "\\E3* Don't tell anyone this^1, Little&  Buddy./",
  "obj_shop4_735": "\\E4* (Because they'll make fun&  of me,)/",
  "obj_shop4_736": "\\E5* But I..^1.&* I feel like I played a hand in&  everyone getting free&  somehow./",
  "obj_shop4_737": "\\E1* Even if it was just&  working this awful job.../",
  "obj_shop4_738": "\\E5* I think I did something!/",
  "obj_shop4_739": "\\E3* I don't know if it's true^1,&  but I'll believe it anyway!/%%",
  "obj_shop4_744": "\\E3* Huh?&* Everyone else is DEAD?/",
  "obj_shop4_745": "\\E4* .../",
  "obj_shop4_746": "\\E5* Does that mean I don't&  have to work today?/",
  "obj_shop4_747": "\\E6* God^1.&* That it were true^1,&  little weirdo^1.&* That it were true./%%",
  "obj_shop4_756": "\\E3* Future^1?&* WHAT future^1?&* Nothing down here EVER&  changes./",
  "obj_shop4_757": "\\E4* I'll probably be trapped&  at this stupid job forever./",
  "obj_shop4_758": "* .../",
  "obj_shop4_759": "\\E3* But wait^1!&* There's one thing that keeps&  me going!/",
  "obj_shop4_760": "* If ASGORE gets just one&  more SOUL^1, we'll finally get&  to go to the surface!/",
  "obj_shop4_761": "* It'll be a brand new world^1!&* There's gotta be a second&  chance out there for me^1!&* For everyone!/",
  "obj_shop4_762": "\\E6* So stay strong^1, little buddy^1.&* When I make it big^1, I'll&  keep you in mind./%%",
  "obj_shop4_767": "\\E3* Little buddy^1!&* There's a brand new world&  out there waiting&  for us./",
  "obj_shop4_768": "\\E6* I'm sure with my (ahem)&  qualifications^1, it won't&  be long before I'm a&  famous movie star.../",
  "obj_shop4_769": "\\E4* Or^1, maybe I'll just end up&  flipping burgers again./",
  "obj_shop4_770": "\\E3* But it's as I say^1!&* Nowhere to go but up^1!&* Literally^1, in this case!/%%",
  "obj_shop4_775": "\\E6* Sorry^1, little weirdo^1.&* Threats won't work on me./",
  "obj_shop4_776": "* I can't go to hell^1.&* I'm all out of vacation&  days./%%",
  "obj_shop4_785": "\\E0* I'm sorry^1, (Ha ha) it's against&  the rules to talk to customers&  who haven't bought anything./%%",
  "obj_shop4_790": "\\E1* What^1?&* Why do you keep trying to talk&  to me?/",
  "obj_shop4_792": "\\E1* I'll get in trouble if I get&  chummy with the customers./",
