  "obj_smallfrog_61": "* Ribbit^1, ribbit^1.&* (Excuse me^1, human.)/",
  "obj_smallfrog_62": "* (I have some advice&  for you about battling&  monsters.)/",
  "obj_smallfrog_63": "\\W* (If you \\YACT\\W a certain way&  or \\YFIGHT\\W until you&  almost defeat them...)/",
  "obj_smallfrog_64": "* (They might not want to&  battle you anymore.)/",
  "obj_smallfrog_65": "* (If a monster does not&  want to fight you^1, please...)/",
  "obj_smallfrog_66": "\\W* (Use some \\YMERCY^1,\\W human.^1)&* Ribbit./%%",
  "obj_smallfrog_70": "* Ribbit^1, ribbit^1.&* (Excuse me^1, human.)/",
  "obj_smallfrog_71": "* (I have some advice&  for you about battling&  monsters.)/",
  "obj_smallfrog_72": "* (The monsters in this world&  are very dangerous and&  aggressive.)/",
  "obj_smallfrog_73": "* (In this place^1, running away&  will not work on the&  first turn.)/",
  "obj_smallfrog_74": "* (It may be better to try&  another option.^1)&* Ribbit./%%",
  "obj_smallfrog_79": "* Ribbit^1, ribbit^1.&* (Excuse me^1, human.)/",
  "obj_smallfrog_80": "* (You seem like you have&  grown into a thoughtful and&  conscientious person.)/",
  "obj_smallfrog_81": "* (Whether that was from my&  advice or not...^1)&* (I'm quite proud.)/",
  "obj_smallfrog_82": "* Ribbit./%%",
  "obj_smallfrog_90": "* Ribbit^1, ribbit^1.&* (Just between you and me...)/",
  "obj_smallfrog_91": "\\W* (I saw \\BTORIEL\\W come out of&  here just a little&  while ago.)/",
  "obj_smallfrog_92": "* (She was carrying some&  groceries.)/",
  "obj_smallfrog_93": "* (I didn't ask what they&  were for...)/",
  "obj_smallfrog_94": "* (We're all too intimidated&  to talk to her.^1)&* Ribbit./%%",
  "obj_smallfrog_97": "* Ribbit^1, ribbit^1.&* (Seems like the RUINS have&  finally opened up.)/",
  "obj_smallfrog_98": "* (Maybe we should finally&  go out to the rest of&  the underground.)/",
  "obj_smallfrog_99": "* (Huh^1? The barrier's open^1,&  too...?)/",
  "obj_smallfrog_100": "* (... let's just take this&  one step at a time^1, OK?)/%%",
  "obj_smallfrog_105": "* Ribbit^1, ribbit^1.&* (Just between you and me...)/",
  "obj_smallfrog_106": "\\W* (I saw \\BTORIEL\\W come out of&  here just a little&  while ago.)/",
  "obj_smallfrog_107": "* (Normally^1, she carries&  groceries out of here.)/",
  "obj_smallfrog_108": "* (But this time^1, she wasn't&  carrying anything.)/",
  "obj_smallfrog_109": "* (She looked disappointed.^1)&* Ribbit./%%",
  "obj_smallfrog_117": "* Ribbit ribbit^1.&* (I heard using \"F4\" can make&  you have a \"full screen.\")/",
  "obj_smallfrog_118": "* (But what does \"F4\" stand for?^1)&* (\"Four frogs\"?)/",
  "obj_smallfrog_119": "* (I have only seen a maximum of&  three frogs in this room...)/",
  "obj_smallfrog_120": "* (This is troubling^1, to say&  the least.^1)&* Ribbit./%%",
  "obj_smallfrog_117_console": "* Ribbit ribbit^1.&* (I heard using \"Borders\" can&  add some color to the world.)/",
  "obj_smallfrog_118_console": "* (It seems you can choose&  them in the \"Settings\" menu&  before you load your game.)/",
  "obj_smallfrog_119_console": "* (However, there isn't a&  frog-themed border.)/",
  "obj_smallfrog_120_console": "* (So it's just pointless.^1)&* Ribbit./%%",
  "obj_smallfrog_124": "* Ribbit ribbit^1.&* (Did you ever find this&  room's fourth frog?)/%%",
  "obj_smallfrog_140": "* Ribbit ribbit^1.&* (Yellow names were nice for&  a while.)/",
  "obj_smallfrog_141": "* (Next time^1, we should try a&  relaxing shade of green.)/%%",
  "obj_smallfrog_145": "* Ribbit ribbit^1.&* (How was your adventure?)/",
  "obj_smallfrog_146": "* (It must have been difficult&  without being able to tell&  the enemy's feelings.)/%%",
  "obj_smallfrog_150": "* Ribbit ribbit^1.&* (Finally^1, we can all remove&  these aging pink names.)/",
  "obj_smallfrog_151": "* (Everyone gave you a big favor&  today.^1)&* (Try to respect that!)/%%",
  "obj_smallfrog_xadvice_59": "* Ribbit^1, ribbit^1.&* (Sigh...)/",
  "obj_smallfrog_xadvice_60": "* (My friend never listens to&  me.)/",
  "obj_smallfrog_xadvice_61": "* (Whenever I talk^1, they skip&  through my words by pressing&  \\*X.)/",
  "obj_smallfrog_xadvice_62": "* (That's right.......^1)&* (Pressing \\*X............^1)&* (................)/",
  "obj_smallfrog_xadvice_63": "* (Well^1, at least you listen&  to me.)/%%",
  "obj_smallfrog_xadvice_67": "* Ribbit^1, ribbit^1.&* (Say...)/",
  "obj_smallfrog_xadvice_68": "* (Now that your journey's&  over^1, maybe you'll have&  time to listen to me.)/",
  "obj_smallfrog_xadvice_69": "* (Since most people just&  press \\*X to skip through&  my dialogue.)/",
  "obj_smallfrog_xadvice_70": "* (That's right.......^1)&* (Pressing \\*X............^1)&* (................)/",
  "obj_smallfrog_xadvice_71": "* (You've really matured^1,&  haven't you?)/%%",
  "obj_smallfrog_xadvice_150": "* (Oh^1, not you too!)/%%",
  "obj_smallfrog_xadvice_153": "* (... I suppose some things&  never change.)/%%",
  "obj_smallweb_64": "* (It's a spider web.)/",
  "obj_smallweb_65": "* (There's a flyer for a&  bake sale on it.)/%%",
  "obj_snail2_70": "* (Someone has meticulously&  cleaned all the slime off of&  this snail.)/%%",
  "obj_snail2_73": "* (The snail has covered&  itself in slime again...^1)&* (Happy ending...)/%%",
  "obj_snail3_70": "* (This snail is counting dollar&  bills.)/%%",
  "obj_snail3_73": "* (Using its money^1, the&  snail bought a hat.)/%%",
  "obj_snailguy_70": "* I've been long overdue for&  a second house.../%%",
  "obj_snailguy_73": "* The housing market will&  probably crash now./",
  "obj_snailguy_74": "* But you know^1, home&  is where the heart is./%%",
  "obj_snowdecahedron_102": "* (It looks like a snow ball...)/",
  "obj_snowdecahedron_103": "* (Actually^1, it's a&  snowdecahedron.)/%%",
  "obj_snowdecahedron_104": "* (It's a snow ball.)/%%",
  "obj_snowdinlogo_70": "* (Welcome to Snowdin Town!)/%%",
  "obj_snowdrake_248": "\"Ice\"&to meet&you.",
  "obj_snowdrake_249": "Ice puns&are&\"snow\"&problem",
  "obj_snowdrake_250": "Fights&you in&\"cold\"&blood.",
  "obj_snowdrake_251": "Better&not snow&\"flake\"&out!",
  "obj_snowdrake_252": "My fave&ice&cereals:&\"frosted\"",
  "obj_snowdrake_253": "\"Chill\"&out...",
  "obj_snowdrake_254": "M.. m..&macaroni&and&\"freeze\"",
  "obj_snowdrake_257": "Do I&really&...",
  "obj_snowdrake_258": "Hey...",
  "obj_snowdrake_259": "Guys...&guys...",
  "obj_snowdrake_265": "You have&good&taste!!&(In jokes)",
  "obj_snowdrake_266": "See!?&Laughs!&Dad was&wrong!",
  "obj_snowdrake_267": "Thanks,&you're&all&great.",
  "obj_snowdrake_268": "See!?&Laughs!&Dad was&wrong!",
  "obj_snowdrake_271": "What are&YOU&laughin'&at?!?",
  "obj_snowdrake_278": "Is that&s'posed&to be&funny?",
  "obj_snowdrake_279": "Ha...&Ha...&Nice&try.",
  "obj_snowdrake_280": "I've&heard&that&one.",
  "obj_snowdrake_285": "THIS&won't be&funny&either!",
  "obj_snowdrake_286": "Is your&flesh&rotten&as you?",
  "obj_snowdrake_287": "(Insults&towards&humans)",
  "obj_snowdrake_292": "IT'S&JUST&LIKE&'EM",
  "obj_snowdrake_293": "HAHA&YOU'RE&BETTER",
  "obj_snowdrake_294": "YOU&NAILED&IT",
  "obj_snowdrake_299": "That's&not&like&me...",
  "obj_snowdrake_300": "I don't&do it&that&way...",
  "obj_snowdrake_301": "It's&better&when I&do it...",
  "obj_snowdrake_309": "%%%",
  "obj_snowdrake_507": "* Snowdrake is assessing the&  crowd.",
  "obj_snowdrake_508": "* Snowdrake is practicing&  its next pun.",
  "obj_snowdrake_509": "* Snowdrake is smiling at its&  own bad joke.",
  "obj_snowdrake_510": "* It smells like a wet&  pillow.",
  "obj_snowdrake_511": "* Snowdrake realized its own&  name is a pun and is&  freaking out.",
  "obj_snowdrake_512": "* Snowdrake is pleased with&  its \"cool\" joke.",
  "obj_snowdrake_513": "* Snowdrake is laughing at&  your imitation of its&  cohort.",
  "obj_snowdrake_514": "* Snowdrake pretends not to&  care.",
  "obj_snowdrake_515": "* Snowdrake is puffed up..",
  "obj_snowdrake_516": "* Snowdrake is flaking&  apart.",
  "obj_snowdrake_533": "* SNOWDRAKE - ATK 12 DEF 7&* This teen comedian fights to&  keep a captive audience./^",
  "obj_snowdrake_542": "* You boo the Snowdrake./^",
  "obj_snowdrake_543": "* You tell the Snowdrake that&  they aren't funny./^",
  "obj_snowdrake_545": "* You tell the Snowdrake that&  no one will ever love&  them the way they are.../",
  "obj_snowdrake_546": "* They struggle to make a&  retort^1, and slink away&  utterly crushed.../^",
  "obj_snowdrake_559": "* You laugh at Snowdrake before&  it says anything funny./^",
  "obj_snowdrake_560": "* You laugh at Snowdrake's&  pun./^",
  "obj_snowdrake_568": "* You make a bad ice pun./^",
  "obj_snowdrake_570": "* You make a bad ice pun./",
  "obj_snowdrake_571": "* The other monsters think&  it's hilarious.../^",
  "obj_snowdrakedad_75": "* I'm the resort comedian.&* I'm very funny^1.&* People laugh at my jokes./",
  "obj_snowdrakedad_76": "* Now^1, my son^1.&* He wants to be a comedian&  like his fathah./",
  "obj_snowdrakedad_77": "* But his jokes^1.&* Aren't funny./",
  "obj_snowdrakedad_78": "* He tells these awful puns^1.&* He's an embarrassment to&  our family./",
  "obj_snowdrakedad_79": "* Ha ha ha ha.../",
  "obj_snowdrakedad_80": "* That's not funny./",
  "obj_snowdrakedad_81": "* Since his mothah passed on^1,&  he couldn't stand^1.&* Living at home anymore./",
  "obj_snowdrakedad_82": "* So he ran away^1.&* I haven't seen him since./",
  "obj_snowdrakedad_83": "* I'm a terrible fathah^1.&* Ha ha ha ha.../",
  "obj_snowdrakedad_84": "* That's not funny./%%",
  "obj_snowdrakedad_87": "* Talking to you about&  this..^1.&* It's breakin' my heart./",
  "obj_snowdrakedad_88": "* Ha ha ha ha.../",
  "obj_snowdrakedad_89": "* That's not funny./%%",
  "obj_snowdrakedad_94": "* The doctah^1.&* She brought my wife.&* Back from the dead./",
  "obj_snowdrakedad_95": "* My son^1.&* He seems happy again./",
  "obj_snowdrakedad_96": "* Our family^1.&* It's biggah than evah./",
  "obj_snowdrakedad_97": "* Now that my wife^1.&* Is combined^1.&* With 16 othah people./%%",
  "obj_snowdrakedad_102": "* My boss stopped answering my&  calls./",
  "obj_snowdrakedad_103": "* I don't know when my next&  performance will be./",
  "obj_snowdrakedad_104": "* Maybe I shouldn't try to be&  a comedian anymore.../",
  "obj_snowdrakedad_105": "* It's tearing my family apart./%%",
  "obj_snowdrakedad_110": "* My son..^1.&* He was always making these&  weird ice puns./",
  "obj_snowdrakedad_111": "* I hated them^1, so he ran&  away from home.../",
  "obj_snowdrakedad_112": "* I think I should try to&  patch things up with him./",
  "obj_snowdrakedad_113": "* Have you seen him^1?&* Have you seen my son?/%%",
  "obj_snowdrakemom_158": " sn...& o...& wy...",
  "obj_snowdrakemom_165": " haha...& i...& remem..&  ber...",
  "obj_snowdrakemom_167": " haha...& thank...& you...",
  "obj_snowdrakemom_173": "%%%",
  "obj_snowdrakemom_387": "* It's so cold.",
  "obj_snowdrakemom_388": "* It's so cold.",
  "obj_snowdrakemom_389": "* It's so cold.",
  "obj_snowdrakemom_390": "* It's so cold.",
  "obj_snowdrakemom_391": "* Smells like salty slush.",
  "obj_snowdrakemom_392": "* Seems calmed down.",
  "obj_snowdrakemom_393": "* Monster has low HP.",
  "obj_snowdrakemom_426": "* AMALGAMATE - ATK -12 DEF -5&* Seems like it's losing itself./^",
  "obj_snowdrakemom_435": "* You laugh^1, and keep laughing^1.&* It's SO funny^1, you can't stop^1.&* Tears run down your face./",
  "obj_snowdrakemom_436": "* ... what^1?&* You didn't do that?/^",
  "obj_snowdrakemom_439": "* But it's not funny./^",
  "obj_snowdrakemom_451": "* You said something like..^1.&* \"You look horrible.^1\"&* \"Why are you even alive?^1\"/",
  "obj_snowdrakemom_452": "* ... what^1?&* You didn't say that?/^",
  "obj_snowdrakemom_455": "* You call this a performance?/^",
  "obj_snowdrakemom_467": "* You told a bad pun about&  snow^1.&* Her expression starts to shift./^",
  "obj_snowdrakemom_469": "* You told a bad pun about&  snow^1.&* Her expression changes more./^",
  "obj_snowdrakemom_472": "* You told a bad pun about&  snow^1.&* She's completely calmed down./^",
  "obj_snowdrakenpc_76": "* I ran away from home^1.&* Why?/",
  "obj_snowdrakenpc_77": "* 'Cause my father was so&  \"cold\" to me.../",
  "obj_snowdrakenpc_78": "* WHAT!^1?&* It's a JOKE!^1!&* LAUGH at it!!/%%",
  "obj_snowdrakenpc_82": "* I really don't^1!&* I don't care if he doesn't&  like my jokes!/%%",
  "obj_snowdrakenpc_87": "* Mom might have to share her&  mind with other people now^1,&  but she's still my mom./",
  "obj_snowdrakenpc_88": "* And that's \"cool!\"/",
  "obj_snowdrakenpc_89": "* 'Cause^1, uhh^1, we're made&  of ice and stuff./",
  "obj_snowdrakenpc_90": "* WHAT!?!^1?&* It's a JOKE!^1!&* LAUGH at it!!/%%",
  "obj_snowpoff_100": "* It's a snow poff./%%",
  "obj_snowpoff_101": "* And this..^1.&* Is a snow poff./%%",
  "obj_snowpoff_102": "* This^1, however^1, is a snow poff./%%",
  "obj_snowpoff_103": "* Surprisingly^1, it's a snow poff./%%",
  "obj_snowpoff_104": "* Snow poff.../%%",
  "obj_snowpoff_105": "* Is it really a snow poff?/%%",
  "obj_snowpoff_106": "* Behold^1!&* A snow poff./%%",
  "obj_snowpoff_107": "* What's this called?/%%",
  "obj_snowpoff_108": "* Eh^1?&* There's 30 G inside&  this..^1. what is this?/%%",
  "obj_sockdrawer_60": "%%",
  "obj_sockdrawer_66": "* You peek inside..^2.&* Scandalous!/",
  "obj_sockdrawer_67": "* It's TORIEL's sock drawer./%%",
  "obj_sockdrawer_68": "* You can't stop looking&  at the socks./%%",
  "obj_sosorry_269": "AHHHHHHH!!!!!/%%",
  "obj_sosorry_274": "\\E1AHHHHH!!!/%%",
  "obj_sosorry_279": "\\E1Oh!&Whoops!&That hurt!/",
  "obj_sosorry_280": "\\E2So sorry^1, I must&have gotten in the&way!/",
  "obj_sosorry_281": "\\E1I really shouldn't&stand so close/",
  "obj_sosorry_282": "\\E4Ah I'm just being&troublesome/%%",
  "obj_sosorry_287": "\\E4Darn it, I keep&getting in the way/",
  "obj_sosorry_288": "\\E2So sorry, I'm such&an oaf/",
  "obj_sosorry_289": "\\E2Wandering in front&of you.../%%",
  "obj_sosorry_294": "\\E1.../",
  "obj_sosorry_295": "Are you...&trying to KILL me?/",
  "obj_sosorry_296": "\\E4... so sorry, but&I've had a really&tough year./",
  "obj_sosorry_297": "I don't know if I&could take you&killing me on top&of everything./",
  "obj_sosorry_298": "\\E2You should find&someone else to&kill.&So sorry./%%",
  "obj_sosorry_303": "\\E1?????/",
  "obj_sosorry_304": "\\E5I just said I'm&not interested in&the offer!!/",
  "obj_sosorry_305": "\\E5.../",
  "obj_sosorry_306": "\\E2Sorry, I must not&have enunciated&clearly enough./",
  "obj_sosorry_307": "\\E2I am not interested&in being killed.&Thank you very much./%%",
  "obj_sosorry_312": "\\E5Look, stranger/",
  "obj_sosorry_313": "\\E4I... I guess I'm&going to have to&tell the truth./",
  "obj_sosorry_314": "My whole life, I've&never been worth a&lot of EXP./",
  "obj_sosorry_315": "Everyone else at my&work, in my classes,/",
  "obj_sosorry_316": "Would raise a&person's LV by 4&or 5 when&destroyed.../",
  "obj_sosorry_317": "\\E1But me?/",
  "obj_sosorry_318": "\\E6I wouldn't even&increase your LV&at LV 1./",
  "obj_sosorry_319": "\\E4For this reason...&I...&I've always been.../",
  "obj_sosorry_320": "I've never been&very good at&getting killed.&So.../",
  "obj_sosorry_321": "\\E3I'm flattered&that you...&Want to destroy me./",
  "obj_sosorry_322": "\\E8But you are making&a big waste of&your time!!/",
  "obj_sosorry_323": "\\E8Stop killing me!!!/%%",
  "obj_sosorry_328": "\\E2OK, OK. Hm./",
  "obj_sosorry_329": ".../",
  "obj_sosorry_330": "\\E7If you stop killing&me, I'll pay you&200G./%%",
  "obj_sosorry_335": "\\E8220G?/%%",
  "obj_sosorry_340": "\\E9.../",
  "obj_sosorry_341": "\\E8300G?/%%",
  "obj_sosorry_346": "\\E1W..^1.&Wait a second./",
  "obj_sosorry_347": "\\E1You trying to&kill me...&C...&could it be...?/",
  "obj_sosorry_348": "\\E6Because you&don't like me&very much...?/",
  "obj_sosorry_349": "\\E2No, no, that&can't be!/",
  "obj_sosorry_350": "This is just a&friendly, um,&killing between&acquaintances!!!/",
  "obj_sosorry_351": "\\E8Pals... we're...&we're still pals,&right!!/",
  "obj_sosorry_352": "\\E1OK, maybe not&PALS, but, uh,/",
  "obj_sosorry_353": "\\E2Friendly strangers?/",
  "obj_sosorry_354": "\\E8You know, just&one step away from&being buds!!!/",
  "obj_sosorry_355": "\\E0I mean, I was&practically.../",
  "obj_sosorry_356": "\\E0I was about to&crack open the&sparkling cider!/",
  "obj_sosorry_357": "\\E2Pull out some&baguettes and some&swiss cheese!/",
  "obj_sosorry_358": "\\E8BLOW ON A FREAKING&PARTY HORN!!!/%%",
  "obj_sosorry_363": "\\E1N... no, you don't&like me either,&huh...?/",
  "obj_sosorry_364": "\\E4Nobody likes me...&they're just putting&up with me/",
  "obj_sosorry_365": "\\E6I'm just annoying&you... I should just&leave/",
  "obj_sosorry_366": "\\E1ARRRRRGHHHH!!!&Why am I such an&idiot??!?!!!!/",
  "obj_sosorry_367": "How did I not&see it before!!!/",
  "obj_sosorry_368": "\\E1You weren't killing&me because you&LIKED me!!!/",
  "obj_sosorry_369": "\\E6NOBODY does that!/",
  "obj_sosorry_370": " That's NOT a thing!/%%",
  "obj_sosorry_376": "\\E2Oh. Sorry. I was&being too loud.&Ugh./",
  "obj_sosorry_377": "\\E4I'm wasting your&time, aren't I...?/",
  "obj_sosorry_378": "\\E9.../",
  "obj_sosorry_379": "\\E1... whew, I feel&really...&strange./",
  "obj_sosorry_380": "\\E2I think I need to&go home and lie&down./%%",
  "obj_sosorry_392": "\\E1Oh, I'm so sorry!&How clumsy of me...&I've bumped into you/",
  "obj_sosorry_393": "\\E6I'm such a klutz./",
  "obj_sosorry_394": "I was just here to&find something to&draw, and.../",
  "obj_sosorry_395": "\\E2Oh no, it's ok!&It's OK!/",
  "obj_sosorry_396": "\\E0I'll give you a&gift to make up&for your troubles./",
  "obj_sosorry_397": "\\E0Let me look in&my vest!/%%",
  "obj_sosorry_402": "\\E6Ummm, I couldn't&find anything I&want to give away./",
  "obj_sosorry_403": "\\E2Wait, wait!/",
  "obj_sosorry_404": "\\M4I've got my notebook!/",
  "obj_sosorry_405": "\\E0I can draw you a&picture in it!/",
  "obj_sosorry_406": "\\E7I'm quite the artist,&you know./",
  "obj_sosorry_407": "\\E8I'll draw you a&GREAT picture!!!/%%",
  "obj_sosorry_413": "\\E6S.. sorry...&The drawing didn't&come out very well./",
  "obj_sosorry_414": "\\E2Wait^1!&I know the problem!/",
  "obj_sosorry_415": "\\M0I just have to&find a better piece&of paper for it!/%%",
  "obj_sosorry_420": "\\E6None of my papers&are good enough to&use.../",
  "obj_sosorry_421": "\\E2IT'S OK!!!/",
  "obj_sosorry_422": "\\E8I know what I&can do!^1!&I'll use my magic&pencil!/",
  "obj_sosorry_423": "\\E0It has to be under&some of these papers&somewhere!!!!/%%",
  "obj_sosorry_429": "\\E1AHHHHH!!!/%%",
  "obj_sosorry_434": "\\M5H\\E8ere!&I got it!/",
  "obj_sosorry_435": "My magic pencil is&amazing!/",
  "obj_sosorry_436": "\\E2Everything I draw&with it looks.../",
  "obj_sosorry_437": "\\E8COMPLETELY REAL!/%%",
  "obj_sosorry_445": "\\E1I've messed up.&I've really messed up.&Oh no./",
  "obj_sosorry_446": "\\E2I'll just use a&regular pencil!&I'll try my best!/%%",
  "obj_sosorry_453": "\\E8Are you ready!?/",
  "obj_sosorry_454": "\\E0I just finished./",
  "obj_sosorry_455": "\\M6Here's your picture!&What do you think!?/",
  "obj_sosorry_456": "\\E2It's a representation&of your deepest&essence.../",
  "obj_sosorry_457": "\\E7It's great^1, right!?/",
  "obj_sosorry_458": ".../",
  "obj_sosorry_459": "\\E8(They think my art&is terrible.)/",
  "obj_sosorry_460": "\\M0Well!/",
  "obj_sosorry_461": "\\E2I'll leave you with&that thought!/",
  "obj_sosorry_462": "\\E7Goodbye!/",
  "obj_sosorry_463": "\\E8See you later!/",
  "obj_sosorry_464": "\\E2Sayonara!/",
  "obj_sosorry_465": "\\E1Nice knowing ya!/",
  "obj_sosorry_466": "\\E7Hasta la vista./",
  "obj_sosorry_467": "\\E9.../",
  "obj_sosorry_468": "\\E2I should leave./%%",
  "obj_sosorry_785": "* The enemy looks nervous.",
  "obj_sosorry_786": "* The enemy looks anxious.",
  "obj_sosorry_787": "* The enemy taps his fingers&  together like jackhammers.",
  "obj_sosorry_788": "* The enemy looks perturbed.",
  "obj_sosorry_789": "* The enemy tries to copy your&  movements so it fits in.",
  "obj_sosorry_790": "* The enemy uses a hypnotizing&  3D-tush-wiggle attack.",
  "obj_sosorry_791": "* Smells... furry.",
  "obj_sosorry_792": "* Are we good here!?.",
  "obj_sosorry_793": "* The enemy is apologizing to&  its visions of the Reaper.",
  "obj_sosorry_826": "* SO SORRY&* This creature is definitely&  in the wrong time and space!/^",
  "obj_sosorry_838": "* You wave^1.&* They're a bit preoccupied./^",
  "obj_sosorry_841": "* You say hello^1.&* They're a bit preoccupied./^",
  "obj_sosorry_844": "* You smile^1.&* They're a bit preoccupied./^",
  "obj_sosorry_847": "* You cough^1.&* They're a bit preoccupied./^",
  "obj_sosorry_850": "* You weep^1.&* They're a bit preoccupied./^",
  "obj_sosorry_950": "\\E0Oh^1, and.../",
  "obj_sosorry_951": "\\E1About all this./",
  "obj_sosorry_952": "\\E4Um./",
  "obj_sosorry_953": "\\E2Sorry./%%",
  "obj_sosorry_1007": "\\E1Uuuuhhhh, oh no!!&That's a little too&real!/%%",
  "obj_spaghetti_98": "* (It's a plate of frozen&  spaghetti.)/",
  "obj_spaghetti_99": "* (It's so cold^1, it's stuck&  to the table...)/%%",
  "obj_spaghetti_102": "* (It's a plate of lukewarm&  spaghetti.)/",
  "obj_spaghetti_103": "* (Seems like something tried&  eating it and just..^1.)&* (Gave up.)/%%",
  "obj_spagnot_98": "* It's a note from Papyrus.../",
  "obj_spagnot_99": "\\TP %",
  "obj_spagnot_100": "HUMAN!^1!&PLEASE ENJOY THIS&SPAGHETTI./",
  "obj_spagnot_101": "(LITTLE DO YOU KNOW^1,&THIS SPAGHETTI IS&A TRAP...)/",
  "obj_spagnot_102": "(DESIGNED TO ENTICE&YOU!!!)/",
  "obj_spagnot_103": "(YOU'LL BE SO BUSY&EATING IT...)/",
  "obj_spagnot_104": "(THAT YOU WON'T&REALIZE THAT YOU&AREN'T PROGRESSING!!)/",
  "obj_spagnot_105": "(THOROUGHLY JAPED&AGAIN BY THE GREAT&PAPYRUS!!!)/",
  "obj_spagnot_106": " &      NYEH-HEH-HEH^1,&         PAPYRUS/%%",
  "obj_spagnot_110": "* It's a note from Papyrus.../",
  "obj_spagnot_111": "\\TP %",
  "obj_spagnot_112": "SEEING AS THIS&SPAGHETTI IS STILL&HERE SOMEHOW.../",
  "obj_spagnot_113": "I HEREBY DONATE IT&TO THE PUBLIC./",
  "obj_spagnot_114": "IT'S LIKE A&PLAYGROUND FOR&YOUR MOUTH!/",
  "obj_spagnot_115": " &      NYEH-HEH-HEH^1,&         PAPYRUS/%%",
  "obj_spagnot_120": "* It's illegible chicken-&  scratch./%%",
  "obj_spagnot_124": "WHAT!^1?&THAT'S IMPOSSIBLE./%%",
  "obj_spagnot_127": "SORRY^1, I HAVE TO LOCK&YOU IN THE GUEST ROOM&UNTIL UNDYNE ARRIVES./",
  "obj_spagnot_128": "FEEL FREE TO MAKE&YOURSELF AT HOME!!!/",
  "obj_spagnot_129": "REFRESHMENTS AND&ACCOMODATIONS HAVE&BEEN PROVIDED./",
  "obj_spagnot_130": " & - NYEHFULLY YOURS^1,&        PAPYRUS/%%",
  "obj_spagnot_134": "PLEASE ASK BEFORE&YOU ESCAPE!!!/",
  "obj_spagnot_135": "WHEN YOU WENT&MISSING I GOT&WORRIED SICK!!!/",
  "obj_spagnot_136": "  - SLIGHTLY&  BONETROUSLED^1,&  PAPYRUS/%%",
  "obj_spagnot_140": "IF YOU'RE JUST&LOOKING FOR A&PLACE TO STAY.../",
  "obj_spagnot_141": "JUST ASK!!^1!&YOU DON'T NEED&TO FIGHT ME!!!/",
  "obj_spagnot_142": " & - YOUR HOST^1,&   PAPYRUS/%%",
  "obj_spagnot_147": "* (This note is written&  very oddly^1, as if the paper was&  moving while it was written.)/",
  "obj_spagnot_148": "* (It says...^1)&* (Out to lunch...?)/%%",
  "obj_spagnot_153": "* (Shoot the opposing ship!^1)&* (Move the boxes to complete&  your mission.)/%%",
  "obj_spagnot_158": "* (Shoot the opposing ship!^1)&* (You have just one shot.)/%%",
  "obj_spagnot_163": "* (Hey^1!)/",
  "obj_spagnot_164": "* (Go up the creepy alleyway&  on the right for some&  great deals!)/%%",
  "obj_spiderb_220": "What is it,&deary?/%%",
  "obj_spiderb_224": ".../%%",
  "obj_spiderb_225": "No, no, it's&time to go~/%%",
  "obj_spiderb_226": "...&well... maybe&ONE little&nibble~~/%%",
  "obj_spiderb_227": "Just kidding,&of course~/%%",
  "obj_spiderb_228": "If you don't mind&being gobbled up~&Ahuhuhu~/%%",
  "obj_spiderb_229": "Ahuhuhuhu~&Well, I don't&mind keeping&you here~/%%",
  "obj_spiderb_230": "Feeling comfortable&trapped in that&web?/%%",
  "obj_spiderb_231": "It's time to go~/%%",
  "obj_spiderb_232": "Ahuhuhu~&What are you&doing~/%%",
  "obj_spiderb_236": "%%%",
  "obj_spiderb_240": "Why so pale?&You should be proud~/%%",
  "obj_spiderb_245": "Proud that you're&going to make a&delicious cake~&Ahuhuhu~/%%",
  "obj_spiderb_250": "Let you go^1?&Don't be silly~/%%",
  "obj_spiderb_255": "Your SOUL is going&to make every spider&very happy~~~/%%",
  "obj_spiderb_256": "You're scaring off&all my customers!/%%",
  "obj_spiderb_261": "Oh, how rude of me!&I almost forgot&to introduce you&to my pet~/",
  "obj_spiderb_262": "It's breakfast time,&isn't it?&Have fun, you two~ /%%",
  "obj_spiderb_267": "The person who warned&us about you.../%%",
  "obj_spiderb_272": "Offered us a LOT of&money for your SOUL./%%",
  "obj_spiderb_273": "Looked like a total&nerd./%%",
  "obj_spiderb_278": "They had such a sweet&smile~ and... ahuhu~/%%",
  "obj_spiderb_279": "She was very&adamant I run away&with her~~~&Ahuhuhu~~~/%%",
  "obj_spiderb_284": "It's strange, but&I swore I saw them&in the shadows...&Changing shape...?/%%",
  "obj_spiderb_285": "She even left a&route for me to&escape from~/%%",
  "obj_spiderb_291": "Oh, it's lunch time,&isn't it?&And I forgot to&feed my pet~/%%",
  "obj_spiderb_296": "With that money,&the spider clans&can finally be&reunited~/%%",
  "obj_spiderb_297": "She said she would&block off the rest&of Hotland after I&followed her~/%%",
  "obj_spiderb_302": "You haven't heard?&Spiders have been&trapped in the RUINS&for generations!/%%",
  "obj_spiderb_303": "Foolish nerd~&A spider NEVER leaves&her web~/",
  "obj_spiderb_304": "(Except to sell&pastries~)/%%",
  "obj_spiderb_309": "Even if they go&under the door,&Snowdin's fatal cold&is impassable alone./%%",
  "obj_spiderb_310": "Ah^1, but I do feel&a little regret&over it now.../%%",
  "obj_spiderb_315": "But with the money&from your SOUL, we'll&be able to rent&them a heated limo~/%%",
  "obj_spiderb_316": "Yes^1, I should have&wrapped her up when&I had the chance~/%%",
  "obj_spiderb_321": "And with all of&the leftovers...^1?&We could have a&nice vacation~/",
  "obj_spiderb_322": "Or even build a&spider baseball&field~/%%",
  "obj_spiderb_323": "She looked like she&would have made a&juicy donut~~~/%%",
  "obj_spiderb_328": "But enough of that...&It's time for&dinner, isn't it?&Ahuhuhu~/%%",
  "obj_spiderb_336": "Don't look so&blue^1, my deary~/%%",
  "obj_spiderb_599": "* Muffet pours you a cup of&  spiders.",
  "obj_spiderb_600": "* All the spiders clap along to&  the music.",
  "obj_spiderb_601": "* Muffet does a synchronized&  dance with the other spiders.",
  "obj_spiderb_602": "* Muffet tidies up the web&  around you.",
  "obj_spiderb_603": "* Smells like freshly baked&  cobwebs.",
  "obj_spiderb_636": "* MUFFET - ATK 38.8 DEF 18.8&* If she invites you to her&  parlor^1, excuse yourself./^",
  "obj_spiderb_646": "* You struggle to escape the web^1.&* Nothing happened./^",
  "obj_spiderb_647": "* You struggle to escape the web^1.&* Muffet covers her mouth&  and giggles at you./^",
  "obj_spiderb_648": "* You struggle to escape the web^1.&* Muffet laughs and claps&  her hands./^",
  "obj_spiderb_649": "* You struggle to escape the web./",
  "obj_spiderb_650": "* Muffet is so amused by your&  antics that she gives you a&  discount!/^",
  "obj_spiderb_656": "* You struggle to escape the web^1.&* Nothing happened./^",
  "obj_spiderb_678": "* You pay \\[1]G^1.&* Muffet reduces her ATTACK&  for this turn!/^",
  "obj_spiderb_693": "* You empty your pockets^1, but you&  don't have enough money.&* Muffet lowers the price./^",
  "obj_spiderb_710": "* You're out of money^1.&* Muffet shakes her head./^",
  "obj_spiderb_714": "* You empty your pockets..^1.&* But you don't have any&  money at all!/",
  "obj_spiderb_715": "* Muffet takes pity on you&  and reduces her ATTACK for&  this turn./^",
  "obj_spiderb_722": "* Muffet refuses your money./^",
  "obj_spiderb_762": "... I think purple is&a better look on&you! Ahuhuhu~/%%",
  "obj_spiderb_774": "* You're trapped in a strange&  purple web!",
  "obj_spiderb_783": "You're still alive^1?&Ahuhuhu~/",
  "obj_spiderb_784": "Oh, my pet~&Looks like it's&time for dessert~/%%",
  "obj_spiderb_787": "Huh^1?&Where did you get&that...?/",
  "obj_spiderb_788": "Did you steal it?/",
  "obj_spiderb_789": "Oh^1, my pet^1~&It's time to show&them what we do&with thieves~/%%",
  "obj_spiderb_805": "Huh?&A telegram from&the spiders in&the RUINS?/",
  "obj_spiderb_806": "What?&They're saying&that they saw&you, and.../",
  "obj_spiderb_807": "... that this is&an error message!?/",
  "obj_spiderb_811": "... even if you&are stingy, you&never hurt a&single spider!/",
  "obj_spiderb_814": "... even if you&hurt others, you&never hurt a&single spider!/",
  "obj_spiderb_819": "... you helped donate&to their cause!/",
  "obj_spiderb_823": "... you were&really passionate&about spiders!/",
  "obj_spiderb_827": "... you're a total&spider fanatic!/",
  "obj_spiderb_832": "They say even if&you are a hyper-&violent murderer.../",
  "obj_spiderb_833": "You never laid a&single finger on a&spider!/",
  "obj_spiderb_836": "Oh my, this has&all been a big&misunderstanding~/",
  "obj_spiderb_837": "I thought you&were someone that&hated spiders~/",
  "obj_spiderb_838": "The person who&asked for that SOUL.../",
  "obj_spiderb_839": "They must have&meant a DIFFERENT&human in a&striped shirt~/",
  "obj_spiderb_842": "The person who&warned me about&you.../",
  "obj_spiderb_843": "They really had&no idea what they&were talking about~/",
  "obj_spiderb_846": "Sorry for all the&trouble~&Ahuhuhu~/",
  "obj_spiderb_847": "I'll make it up&to you~/",
  "obj_spiderb_848": "You can come back&here any time...&And, for no charge&at all.../",
  "obj_spiderb_849": "I'll wrap you&up and let you&play with my pet&again!/",
  "obj_spiderb_850": "Ahuhuhuhuhuhu~&Just kidding~/",
  "obj_spiderb_851": "I'll SPARE you&now~/%%",
  "obj_spiderb_859": "* Muffet is sparing you.",
  "obj_spidergirl_shop_74": "* Welcome to our parlor^1, dearie^1~&* Interested in some spider&  pastries?/",
  "obj_spidergirl_shop_75": "* All proceeds go to real&  spiders~/%%",
  "obj_spidergirl_shop_76": "* Check out the webs to&  make a purchase~/%%",
  "obj_spidertalkevent_103": "* Ahuhuhuhu.../",
  "obj_spidertalkevent_104": "* Did you hear what they&  just said?/%%",
  "obj_spidertalkevent_106": "* Did you hear what she&  said?/%%",
  "obj_spidertalkevent_114": "* They said a human wearing a&  striped shirt will come&  through./%%",
  "obj_spidertalkevent_122": "* I heard that they hate&  spiders./%%",
  "obj_spidertalkevent_130": "* I heard that they love to&  stomp on them./%%",
  "obj_spidertalkevent_132": "* I heard that they hate&  everybody./%%",
  "obj_spidertalkevent_140": "* I heard that they like to&  tear their legs off./%%",
  "obj_spidertalkevent_149": "* I heard.../%%",
  "obj_spidertalkevent_152": "* However.../%%",
  "obj_spidertalkevent_154": "* And even if they gave us&  money^1, I heard.../%%",
  "obj_spidertalkevent_267": "* ... that they're awfully&  stingy with their money./",
  "obj_spidertalkevent_271": "* ... a certain stingy human&  hates spiders./%%",
  "obj_spidertalkevent_273": "* Ahuhuhuhu.../",
  "obj_spidertalkevent_274": "* You think your taste&  is too refined for our&  pastries^1, don't you^1, deary?/",
  "obj_spidertalkevent_275": "* Ahuhuhu..^1.&* I disagree with that&  notion./",
  "obj_spidertalkevent_276": "* I think your taste.../",
  "obj_spidertalkevent_277": "* Is exactly what this&  next batch needs!/%%",
  "obj_spidertalkevent_283": "* ... that can't be true^1,&  can it?/",
  "obj_spidertalkevent_284": "* Ahuhuhu.../",
  "obj_spidertalkevent_285": "* You donated so much money&  to us./",
  "obj_spidertalkevent_286": "* All the spiders want you&  to know how thankful&  they are!/",
  "obj_spidertalkevent_287": "* We're in your debt^1, dearie~/%%",
  "obj_spidertalkevent_293": "* ... that they have some awful&  taste./",
  "obj_spidertalkevent_294": "* What a shame^1.&* A human comes through and they&  aren't even fit to be eaten~/",
  "obj_spidertalkevent_295": "* Oh well^1!&* Rotten ingredients can&  always be discarded~/%%",
  "obj_spidertalkevent_392": "* Ahuhuhuhu.../",
  "obj_spidertalkevent_393": "* That was fun^1!&* See you again^1, dearie!/%%",
  "obj_stick_95": "* (It's a tough-looking branch.)&* (It's too heavy to pick up.)/%%",
  "obj_stick_99": "* (It's been smashed like it&  was nothing...)/%%",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_295": "A long time ago,&a human fell&into the RUINS./*",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_307": "Injured by its&fall, the human&called out for&help./%%",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_333": "ASRIEL^1, the king's&son^1, heard the&human's call./*",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_345": "He brought the&human back to&the castle./%%",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_370": "Over time^1, ASRIEL&and the human&became like&siblings./*",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_383": "The King and&Queen treated the&human child as&their own./*",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_395": "The underground&was full of&hope./%%",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_421": "Then..^1.&One day.../*",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_433": "The human became&very ill./%%",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_459": "The sick human&had only one&request./*",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_472": "To see the&flowers from&their village./*",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_484": "But there was&nothing we could&do./%%",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_511": "The next day./*",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_523": "The next day./%%",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_546": ".../*",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_558": "The human died./%%",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_583": "ASRIEL^1, wracked&with grief^1,&absorbed the&human's SOUL./*",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_594": "He transformed&into a being&with incredible&power./%%",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_609": "With the human&SOUL^1, ASRIEL&crossed through&the barrier./*",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_622": "He carried the&human's body&into the sunset./*",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_634": "Back to the&village of the&humans./%%",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_649": "ASRIEL reached&the center of&the village./*",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_662": "There^1, he&found a bed of&golden flowers./*",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_674": "He carried&the human&onto it./%%",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_689": "Suddenly^1, screams&rang out./*",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_702": "The villagers&saw ASRIEL&holding the&human's body./*",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_714": "They thought&that he had&killed the&child./%%",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_727": "The humans&attacked him&with everything&they had./*",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_740": "He was struck&with blow after&blow./*",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_752": "ASRIEL had the&power to destroy&them all./%%",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_767": "But.../*",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_778": "ASRIEL did not&fight back./%%",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_805": "Clutching the&human.../*",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_816": "ASRIEL smiled^1,&and walked away./%%",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_832": "Wounded^1, ASRIEL&stumbled home./*",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_845": "He entered the&castle and&collapsed./*",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_857": "His dust spread&across the&garden./%%",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_872": "The kingdom fell&into despair./*",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_885": "The king and&queen had lost&two children&in one night./*",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_897": "The humans had&once again taken&everything&from us./%%",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_911": "The king decided&it was time to&end our&suffering./*",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_924": "Every human who&falls down here&must die./*",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_936": "With enough souls^1,&we can shatter&the barrier&forever./%%",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_951": "It's not long&now./%%",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_965": "King ASGORE&will let us&go.   /*",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_971": "King ASGORE&will give us&hope./*",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_976": "King ASGORE&will save us&all. /%%",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1004": "You should be&smiling^1, too./*",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1014": "Aren't&you&excited?/*",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1023": "Aren't&you&happy?/%%",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1047": "You're going&to be free./%%",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1073": "\\E0Howdy^1, \\[C]!/",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1074": "You finally made&it home./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1075": "\\E0Remember when we&used to play here?/",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1076": "\\E0Hee hee hee.../",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1077": "Boy!/",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1078": "\\E9Today's gonna be&just as fun./%%",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1093": "\\E1I remember when I&first woke up here^1,&in the garden./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1094": "I was so scared./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1095": "\\E2I couldn't feel my&arms or my legs.../",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1096": "\\E1My entire body had&turned into a&flower!/",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1097": "\\E5\"Mom^1! Dad^1!&Somebody help me^1!\"&I called out./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1098": "\\E9But nobody came./%%",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1107": "\\E1Eventually^1, the king&found me^1, crying in&the garden./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1108": "I explained what had&happened to him./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1109": "Then he held me^1,&\\[C]./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1110": "He held me with&tears in his eyes^1,&saying.../",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1111": "\"There^1, there^1.&Everything is going&to be alright.\"/",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1112": "He was so..^1.&Emotional./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1113": "\\E1But..^1.&For some reason.../",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1114": "\\E1I didn't feel&anything at all./%%",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1123": "\\E1I soon realized I&didn't feel ANYTHING&about ANYONE./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1124": "My compassion had&disappeared!/",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1125": "\\E7And believe me^1,&it's not like I&wasn't trying./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1126": "\\E3I wasted weeks with&that stupid king^1,&vainly hoping I would&feel something./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1127": "\\E1But it became too&much for me./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1128": "I ran away from&home./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1129": "Eventually^1, I reached&the RUINS./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1130": "\\E0Inside I found HER^1,&\\[C]./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1131": "I thought of all&people^1, SHE could&make me feel whole&again./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1132": "\\E1.../",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1133": "\\E7She failed./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1134": "\\E6Ha ha.../%%",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1144": "\\E1I realized those two&were useless./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1145": "I became despondent./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1146": "I just wanted to&love someone./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1147": "I just wanted to&care about someone./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1148": "\\[C]^1, you might&not believe this.../",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1149": "\\E2But I decided..^1.&It wasn't worth&living anymore./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1150": "\\E7Not in a world&without love./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1151": "\\E6Not in a world&without you./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1152": "\\E1So.../",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1153": "\\E0I decided to follow&in your footsteps./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1154": "\\E1I would erase myself&from existence./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1155": "\\E1And you know what?/",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1156": "\\E0I succeeded./%%",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1165": "\\E1But as I left this&mortal coil.../",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1166": "I started to feel&apprehensive./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1167": "\\E9If you don't have&a SOUL^1, what happens&when you...?/",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1168": "\\E1Something primal&started to burn&inside me./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1169": "\"No^1,\" I thought^1.&\"I don't want to&die!\"/",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1170": ".../",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1171": "Then I woke up./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1172": "Like it was all&just a bad dream./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1173": "I was back at the&garden./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1174": "\\E0Back at my&\"save point.\"/%%",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1183": "Interested^1, I decided&to experiment./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1184": "Again and again^1, I&brought myself to&the edge of death./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1185": "At any point^1, I&could have let this&world continue on&without me./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1186": "But as long as I&was determined to&live.../",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1187": "\\E0I could go back./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1188": "\\E6Amazing^1, isn't it^1,&\\[C]?/",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1189": "\\E0I was amazed^1, too./%%",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1197": "\\E1At first^1, I used my&powers for good./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1198": "\\E0I became \"friends\"&with everyone./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1199": "I solved all their&problems flawlessly./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1200": "Their companionship&was amusing.../",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1201": "\\E1For a while. /",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1202": "\\E1As time repeated^1,&people proved&themselves&predictable./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1203": "What would this&person say if I&gave them this?/",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1204": "What would they do&if I said this to&them?/",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1205": "Once you know the&answer^1, that's it./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1206": "That's all they are./%%",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1217": "\\E1It all started&because I was&curious./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1218": "\\E0Curious what would&happen if I killed&them./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1219": "\\E2\"I don't like this^1,\"&I told myself./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1220": "\\E1\"I'm just doing this&because I HAVE to&know what happens./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1221": "\\E8Ha ha ha..^1.&What an excuse!/",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1222": "\\E9You of all people&must know how&liberating it is to&act this way./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1223": "\\E8At least we're better&than those sickos&that stand around and&WATCH it happen.../",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1224": "\\E9Those pathetic people&that want to see it^1,&but are too weak to&do it themselves./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1225": "\\E0I bet someone like&that's watching right&now^1, aren't they...?/%%",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1235": "\\E1Nowadays^1, even that's&grown tiring./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1236": "\\E7You understand^1,&\\[C]./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1237": "\\E6I've done everything&this world has to&offer./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1238": "\\E1I've read every book^1.&I've burned every&book./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1239": "I've won every game^1.&I've lost every game./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1240": "I've appeased&everyone^1.&I've killed everyone./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1241": "Sets of numbers..^1.&Lines of dialogue..^1.&I've seen them all./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1242": "\\E1But you..^1.&YOU'RE different./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1243": "\\E0I never could&predict YOU^1, \\[C]./%%",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1252": "\\E1When I saw you in&the RUINS^1, I didn't&recognize you./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1253": "\\E8I thought I could&frighten you^1, then&steal your SOUL./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1254": "\\E1I failed./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1255": "\\E0And when I tried&to load my save&file.../",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1256": "\\E1It didn't work./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1257": "\\E9\\[C]..^1.&Your DETERMINATION!/",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1258": "\\E8Somehow^1, it's even&greater than mine!/%%",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1267": "\\E1I just have one&question for you^1,&\\[C]./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1268": "How did you get&back to the RUINS&from here...?/",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1269": "\\E0... wait^1, I know./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1270": "She must have taken&you when she left./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1271": "\\E1And decided to give&you a proper burial^1,&rather than.../",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1272": "\\E0Hanging out in the&basement forever./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1273": "\\E1... but^1, why then...?/",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1274": "What made you wake&up?/",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1275": "\\E6Did you hear me&calling you...?/%%",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1286": "\\E1It doesn't matter&now./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1287": "\\E1I'm so tired of&this^1, \\[C]./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1288": "I'm tired of all&these people./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1289": "I'm tired of all&these places./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1290": "I'm tired of being&a flower./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1291": "\\[C]./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1292": "\\E0There's just one&thing left I want&to do./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1293": "Let's finish what we&started./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1294": "Let's free everyone./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1295": "\\E8Then..^1. let's let&them see what&humanity is&REALLY like!/",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1296": "\\E6That despite it all.../",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1297": "\\E9This world is still&\"kill or be killed!!\"/%%",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1307": "\\E1Then...?/",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1308": "\\E7Well^1.&I had.../",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1309": "\\E9Been entertaining a&few ways to use&that power./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1310": "\\E8Hee hee hee.../",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1311": "\\E1.../",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1312": "\\E1But seeing you here&changed my mind./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1313": "\\E6\\[C]..^1.&I think if you're&around.../",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1314": "\\E7Just living in the&surface world&doesn't seem so bad./%%",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1324": "\\E0We don't even need&to leave to get&them this time./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1325": "The king has six of&them locked away./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1326": "\\E1I've tried hundreds&of ways to get him&to show me them.../",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1327": "\\E3But he just won't./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1328": "\\E1\\[C].../",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1329": "\\E0I know he'll do it&for YOU./%%",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1339": "\\E0Why am I telling&you all of this?/",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1340": "\\E6\\[C]^1, I said it&before./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1341": "\\E1Even after all this&time.../",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1342": "\\E0You're still the&only one that&understands me./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1343": "\\E8You won't give me&any worthless pity!/%%",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1353": "\\E9Creatures like us.../",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1354": "\\E0Wouldn't hesitate to&KILL each other if&we got in each&other's way./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1355": "\\E0So that's.../",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1356": "\\E1So..^1. that's..^1.&Why.../%%",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1383": "\\E2.../",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1384": "\\E2... ha..^1.&Ha.../",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1385": "\\E6... what's this..^1.&... feeling?/",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1386": "Why am I..^1.&Shaking?/",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1387": ".../",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1388": "Hey..^1. \\[C]..^1.&No hard feelings about&back then^1, right?/",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1389": ".../",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1390": "\\E4H-Hey^1, what are you&doing!?/",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1391": "B..^1. back off!!/%%",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1412": "I..^1. I've changed&my mind about all&this./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1413": "This isn't a good&idea anymore./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1414": "Y-you should go back^1,&\\[C]./",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1415": "\\E0This place is fine&the way it is!/",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1416": ".../",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1417": "\\E4S-s-stop making that&creepy face!/",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1418": "This isn't funny!/",
  "obj_storybattle_gen_1419": "You've got a SICK&sense of humor!/%%",
  "obj_switch_100": "* (The machine isn't working.)/%%",
  "obj_switchadvice1_61": "* Please press this switch.& &            - TORIEL/%%",
  "obj_switchadvice2_61": "* Please press this switch&  too.&             - TORIEL/%%",
  "obj_switchhelptrigger_69": "* (You noticed there was&  a blue switch behind the&  top pillar.)/%%",
  "obj_telescope_71": "* Come on! What are you doing!/%%",
  "obj_telescope_75": "* (It's an odd-looking&  telescope.)/%%",
  "obj_tembattle_282": "awwAwa&cute!!&(pets u)",
  "obj_tembattle_283": "OMG!!&humans&TOO CUTE&(dies)",
  "obj_tembattle_284": "hOI!!!&i'm&TEMMIE!!",
  "obj_tembattle_285": "fhsdhjf&dsfjsd&dshjfsd",
  "obj_tembattle_288": "NO!!!!!&muscles&......&NOT CUTE",
  "obj_tembattle_292": "NO!!!&so&hungr...&(dies)",
  "obj_tembattle_298": "hOI!!!&i'm&tEMMIE!!",
  "obj_tembattle_302": "FOOB!!!",
  "obj_tembattle_307": "%%%",
  "obj_tembattle_504": "* Temmie is trying to glomp&  you.",
  "obj_tembattle_505": "* Temmie forgot her other&  attack.",
  "obj_tembattle_506": "* Temmie vibrates intensely.",
  "obj_tembattle_507": "* Temmie is doing her hairs.",
  "obj_tembattle_508": "* Temmiy accidentally misspells&  her own name.",
  "obj_tembattle_509": "* Smells like Temmie Flakes.",
  "obj_tembattle_511": "* How'd you do that?",
  "obj_tembattle_527": "* TEMMIE - RATED TEM OUTTA TEM&* Loves to pet cute humans^1.&* But you're allergic!/^",
  "obj_tembattle_539": "* Temmie only wants the&  Temmie Flakes./^",
  "obj_tembattle_550": "   Give the Temmie Flakes?& &   Yas             NO!!!!!!!\\C",
  "obj_tembattle_561": "* You flex at Temmie.../%%",
  "obj_tembattle_573": "* You say hello to Temmie./^",
  "obj_tembattle_617": "NO!!!!!&muscles&r.....&NOT CUTE/%%",
  "obj_tembattle_621": "%%%",
  "obj_tembattle_635": "Ooh, I&have to&disagree&; )/%%",
  "obj_tembattle_636": "Temmie^1,&are you&okay?&; )/%%",
  "obj_tembattle_637": "%%%",
