  "obj_tordogcall_84": "* Ring..\\E1.\\TT /",
  "obj_tordogcall_85": "\\F1 %",
  "obj_tordogcall_86": "* Hello..^1.&* This is TORIEL./",
  "obj_tordogcall_87": "\\E1* I found what I was&  looking for./",
  "obj_tordogcall_88": "* But before I could&  take it.../",
  "obj_tordogcall_89": "* A small^1, white puppy&  snatched it away./",
  "obj_tordogcall_90": "\\E0* How odd./",
  "obj_tordogcall_91": "\\E1* Do dogs even LIKE&  flour?/",
  "obj_tordogcall_92": "\\E8* Err^1, that is an&  unrelated question^1,&  of course./",
  "obj_tordogcall_93": "\\E1* It will take a little&  longer^1.&* Please understand./",
  "obj_tordogcall_94": "\\TS \\F0 \\T0 %",
