  "mettnews_ticker_4": "TINY VOLCANO MONSTER TRIES ITS BEST, RECEIVES TINY APPLAUSE ||    ",
  "mettnews_ticker_5": "PYROPE IRONICALLY MISSES INVITATION TO THIS SCENARIO \"WOULD HAVE LOVED IT\"  ||    ",
