  "scr_battlegroup_1547": "* You tripped over some&  Moldessas.",
  "scr_battlegroup_1563": "* A line of Moldessas block the&  path.",
  "scr_battlegroup_1580": "* Can you believe it?",
  "scr_battlegroup_1595": "* Final Froggit hopped in...?",
  "scr_battlegroup_1609": "* Whimsalot and Parsnik appeared.",
  "scr_battlegroup_1624": "* Migospel flutters in^1, carrying&  Moldessa.",
  "scr_battlegroup_1639": "* Migospel flutters in^1, carrying&  Parsnik.",
