  "obj_napstablook_189": "* YOU WON!&* You lost 1 experience point./%",
  "obj_torielboss_240": "* YOU WON!&* You lost 1 experience point./%",
  "SCR_TEXT_2510": "* You..^1.&* You came from outside^1,&  didn't you?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_2511": "* People like you are so&  rare.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_2512": "* Please^1!* Stranger!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_2513": "* Tell me about outside...?& &         Yes         No\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_2514": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_2535": "* Huh^1?&* \"SURFACE\"^1?&* What do you mean?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_2536": "* I just meant outside this&  room./",
  "SCR_TEXT_2537": "* If you haven't noticed^1, my&  mycelium have bound me&  to the ground./",
  "SCR_TEXT_2538": "* Please^1!&* Stranger!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_2539": "* I'll make this simple./",
  "SCR_TEXT_2540": "* I've spent my whole life&  in the same spot^1,&  in the same room./",
  "SCR_TEXT_2541": "* But I've long wondered&  what lies inside the&  room to the right./",
  "SCR_TEXT_2542": "* Long I've fantasized&  about entering^1, and&  changing my scenery.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_2543": "* No..^1.&* Changing my LIFE!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_2544": "* Please^1.&* Go and tell me what's&  inside./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_2553": "* Is everyone out there&  like you^1?&* How terrible./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_2518": "* Well^1, what are you&  waiting for?/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_2522": "* Oh^1!&* You're back!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_2523": "* How's the room?& &         Different   Same\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_2524": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_2561": "* Oh^1, that's a relief^1!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_2562": "* That's all I need to&  continue my fantasies^1.&* Thank you^1, stranger./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_2506": "* My mind is running wild^1!&* I haven't felt like this&  in a long time.../%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_2567": "* So it's the same./",
  "SCR_TEXT_2568": "* The same.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_2569": "* Same.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_2570": "* .../",
  "SCR_TEXT_2571": "* OK./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_2507": "* Please leave./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_2780": "* (It's a horse stable.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_2781": "* (Do you want to go&  inside?)&         Yes         No \\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_2782": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_2788": "* (You jostle the door.)&* (It's locked.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_2789": "* (Suddenly^1, from inside&  the [redacted], you hear a&/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3358": "* (It's a book labelled&  Monster History Part 6.)&         Read it     Do not\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_3359": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_3363": "* Unfortunately^1, monsters are&  not experienced with&  illness./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3364": "* However^1, when monsters are&  about to expire of age^1,&  they lie down^1, immobile./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3365": "* We call this state&  \"Fallen Down.\"/",
  "SCR_TEXT_3366": "* A person who has Fallen&  Down will soon perish./",
  "SCR_TEXT_3367": "* In a way^1, this confusing&  situation was all too&  familiar./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_3370": "* (You decide not to read it.)/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4551": "* \\YMETTATON has sent you a&  Mortal Enemy request.\\W /",
  "SCR_TEXT_4552": "* Accept the request?& &         Accept      Reject\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4553": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4559": "* Congratulations^1!&* You are now Mortal Enemies&  with Mettaton./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4560": "* \\YCOOLSKELETON95\\W has posted&  a comment on this change./",
  "SCR_TEXT_4561": "* CONGRATULATIONS^1, YOU TWO^1!&* WISH YOU A LONG AND&  HORRIBLE RIVALRY./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4565": "* You rejected the request./%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4571": "* \\YMETTATON has sent you an&  invitation to \"Die.\"\\W /",
  "SCR_TEXT_4572": "* RSVP?& &         Respond     Ignore\\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_4573": " ",
  "SCR_TEXT_4579": "* Bepis valley Granola Bars/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_4583": "* Bepis valley Granola Bars/%%",
