  "obj_ds3_numberpicker_7": "* (Your donated Coins squished&  back into normal money!^1)&* (You received ",
  "obj_ds3_numberpicker_8": "G.)/%",
  "obj_ds3_numberpicker_9": "* (Some of the Coins turned back&  into normal money^1, but you&  couldn't carry it all.)/%",
  "obj_ds3_numberpicker_10": "* (Felt like you passed a certain&  threshold.^1)&* (Leave the room and return...?)/%",
