  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_0": "* (It's 25G for 5 Dog Coins.)&* (Exchange?)&         Yes         No \\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_1": "* (You received a pittance&  of Coine.)/%",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_2": "* (You seem to have collected&  all the Collectible Coins in&  the vicinity.)/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_3": "* (What will you do now...)/%",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_4": "* (You lack the funds to buy&  basic essentials^1, such as&  money.)/%",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_5": "* (You realized that the Coins&  are just G, squished by a&  Collectible Coin machine.)/%",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_6": "* if you win anything,&  take a look at it&  and talk to me./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_7": "\\E1* someone's gotta roast&  you for all your&  hard work./%",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_8": "* well^1?&* got anything?/%",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_9": "* speaking of tall^1, my&  brother increased the&  height of the sink./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_10": "\\E1* the original height just&  wasn't challenging&  enough anymore./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_11": "\\E2* yep^1. he's not someone&  that takes shortcuts./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_12": "\\E0* ... guess he wanted to&  show they aren't&  necessary./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_13": "\\E1* in his own kind of^1,&  special^1, inconveniencing&  way./%",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_14": "* fried dog food^1?&* nah^1, don't ya know&  fried food's unhealthy?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_15": "\\E2* don't trust anyone who&  tries to sell you that&  stuff./%",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_16": "* fast food^1?&* from that hotland joint?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_17": "\\E1* sure^1, i like a good burg^1,&  but the restaurant one&  over's where it's at./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_18": "\\E0* got a nice atmosphere^1.&* done some comedy shows&  there on the stage./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_19": "\\E1* the king even came once.&* i said one pun and he&  just started going wild./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_20": "\\E3* so i just stood there^1,&  waiting for him to stop&  laughing.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_21": "\\E1* but he didn't^1, so after&  a while they just closed&  the curtains on me./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_22": "\\E2* probably my best show./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_23": "\\E0* anyway^1.&* i'll treat ya some time&  if you're in the area./%",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_24": "* hey^1, a game list^1.&* pretty sure i know&  who made that./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_25": "* i was asking her if she&  had any old game&  recs for a friend./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_26": "\\E1* like maybe some easy&  ones about farming^1,&  or snails^1, or something./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_27": "\\E0* but i forgot that she's&  the kind of person&  who only, uh.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_28": "\\E1* recommends whatever it&  is she's currently&  obsessed with./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_29": "\\E0* so she just told me&  the same rpg as always./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_30": "\\E3* heh./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_31": "\\E2* told her i'd try it&  if it ever came out on&  gamerbox./%",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_32": "* skin cream^1?&* no thanks./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_33": "\\E1* pretty sure that's my&  brother's stuff anyway./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_34": "\\E0* he loves skin care^1.&* if you couldn't tell&  just by looking./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_35": "\\E1* never had a pimple&  ever since he started^1,&  he says./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_36": "\\E0* i'll intimidate the&  humans with my spotless&  face^1, he says./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_37": "\\E1* sans^1, don't bother me&  when i'm in the hyper-&  bolic cucumber chamber,/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_38": "\\E0* he says^1, but i couldn't&  tell you what it&  means./%",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_39": "* what^1, you wanna see&  me put on that hat?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_40": "\\E3* nah^1. two reasons./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_41": "\\E1* first^1, i just combed./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_42": "\\E2* and second^1, do i look&  like the kind of guy&  to wear a hat?/%",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_43": "* a ticket to mtt's live&  gaming show^1, huh^1?&* nice./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_44": "\\E1* those are always a hoot./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_45": "\\E0* he only plays games with&  mods that make him&  the main character./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_46": "\\E1* but^1, uh^1, all the&  animations stay the&  same^1, so.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_47": "\\E2* kinda funny when he's&  supposed to be^1, say^1, a&  long-tongued lizard?/%",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_48": "* what's that^1, some&  kinda camera?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_49": "\\E2* yeah^1, papyrus's been&  really into taking&  'selfies' lately./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_50": "\\E0* he just can't wait&  for the^1, uh^1, 'results&  of his training.'/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_51": "\\E1* so he's been editing&  them to^1, uh^1, make&  his muscles look bigger./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_52": "\\E2* it's not false^1, he&  says^1. it's just a&  glimpse of the future./%",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_53": "* a gamerbox^1.&* wow./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_54": "\\E1* can't believe you got&  one in real life./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_55": "\\E0* even if there's some&  kinda exclusive game&  for it or something.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_56": "\\E2* couldn't you just watch&  a video instead of&  playing it yourself?/%",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_57": "* wow^1. the 'perfect&  combo of monsters&  and energy.'/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_58": "* i know someone who&  was always downing&  that stuff./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_59": "* she was saving the&  cans as scrap metal&  for something big.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_60": "* it's 'flavored after&  a famous cherry.'/%",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_61": "* wow^1, look at all&  that fuzz./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_62": "\\E1* looks like our house&  after a certain&  dog comes by./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_63": "\\E3* then papyrus gets&  out his broom^1, stomps&  his feet^1, and goes.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_64": "\\E2* sans^1, you have&  got to stop shedding!/%",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_65": "* wow^1, that fluffy&  stuff is really&  coming down./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_66": "\\E3* when it snows^1, papyrus&  always puts his face&  to the window.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_67": "\\E0* and goes^1, sans^1, look^1,&  it's snowing^1! isn't it&  beautiful!?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_68": "\\E0* and i say.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_69": "\\E1* you know it snows&  almost every day^1,&  right?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_70": "\\E3* but he's already out&  the door making a&  snow angel./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_71": "\\E1* and then^1, uh^1, fixing&  up its muscles to&  make them bigger./%",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_72": "* woah^1, it's looking&  like a blizzard&  in here./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_73": "* i've only seen it&  snow as bad as&  this once./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_74": "\\E3* you could barely see&  your bones in front&  of your face./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_75": "\\E0* but even so^1, the&  king was out there&  in red and white,/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_76": "\\E2* putting down the&  presents for everyone./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_77": "\\E3* papyrus^1, the yellow&  kid^1, the antlered girl&  and her big sis.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_78": "\\E2* he even had a little&  something for me./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_79": "\\E1* even though he didn't&  really know me./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_80": "\\E3* .../",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_81": "\\E0* you're gonna have to&  meet him^1, huh./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_82": "\\E1* bet that's a lot&  of pressure./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_83": "\\E0* so^1, i guess if it&  makes anything&  easier.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_84": "\\E3* don't think of him&  as the king./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_85": "\\E2* just think of him as&  the guy who gave me&  some socks./%",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_86": "* those were the days&  before i took sock&  collecting seriously./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_87": "\\E3* hate to say it^1,&  but.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_88": "\\E2* i was a noob back&  then./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_89": "\\E1* i knew absolutely&  nothing about the&  competitive scene./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_90": "\\E2* but things changed^1.&* things changed^1, kid./%",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_91": "* heya./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_92": "\\E2* how about a game of&  dog poker?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_93": "\\E0* it's only 10G.& &  Yes         No \\C",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_94": "* too bad poker wasn't&  in the cards./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_95": "\\E1* tell you what though^1.&* if you win any prizes.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_96": "\\E0* take a look at 'em&  and talk to me./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_97": "\\E2* someone's gotta roast&  you for all your&  hard work./%",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_98": "\\E0* whoops^1, looks like&  you can't reach the&  table./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_99": "\\E1* sorry^1, i keep forgetting&  how much taller i&  am than everyone./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_100": "\\E0* guess we can't play./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_101": "\\E2* i'll try putting up a&  sign next time./%",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_102": "\\E2* what^1, intimidated by&  the height of my table?/%",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_103": "* Got anything to set&  my peepers on!?/%",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_104": "* What^1, what^1, WHAT!^1?&* Check something you want&  my thoughts on!/%",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_105": "* This is one of the highest&  paying jobs I've ever had^1,&  mew!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_106": "* Er^1, I don't technically&  have a salary^1, on&  account of.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_107": "* Just finding this place&  and randomly deciding&  I work here./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_108": "* BUT I've been replicating&  this canine residue I found^1,&  and I'm gonna sell it ALL!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_109": "* HAHA^1! Then I'll be ROLLING&  in FLAKES^1! ROLLING around on&  my back with my paws up!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_110": "* ME and my ANIMATRONIC&  VOICEBOX both LAUGHING&  IN SYNC!/%",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_111": "* Nice sign huh!?/%",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_112": "* Nice sign huh!?&* I found it myself!/%",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_113": "* Hmm..^1.&* A humanoid statue...?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_114": "* Hey^1, hey^1, HEY^1!&* I know this nice ghost that&  could REALLY use a body!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_115": "* Just replace the face^1,&  and you've got a WINNER!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_116": "* Just THINK about how many&  KNIVES it could hold in&  its arms^1, mew!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_117": "* KNIVES!^1!&* Physical^1, CORPOREAL KNIVES!/%",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_118": "* Fast food^1?&* Is that from that&  WORTHLESS MTT store?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_119": "* Pass^1. Pass^1! PASS!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_120": "* The guy working there is&  SUCH a creep^1, it's not&  even funny!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_121": "* He just kept STARING^1!&* Like you've never seen a&  pretty girl.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_122": "* ... turn her head around&  270 degrees?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_123": "* While^1, cutting all the&  pictures of your boss^1,&  out of the menu?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_124": "* And replacing them^1, with&  pictures^1, of herself?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_125": "* It's absolutely normal for&  girls to do that is what&  I'm saying./%",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_126": "* Good games^1? Yeah^1, you mean&  Mew Mew 2 Super Cutey&  Darkness Dress Up!?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_127": "* Someone made up a game&  where you dress ME up^1.&* Sooooo cute^1, mew!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_128": "* And DON'T listen to any&  fool who says it's&  'non-canon.'/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_129": "* That SAME person^1, would say&  I'm 'degenerating Mew&  Mew's character,'/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_130": "* JUST for how I walk^1,&  how I talk^1, or.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_131": "* Even just innocently&  brandishing some&  knives!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_132": "* Well^1, MEWS FLASH^1!&* I'M Mew Mew now^1, you&  futile fools!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_133": "* You see me blowing a big&  cloud of smoke out of&  my mouth at an event?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_134": "* That's canon!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_135": "* And because my body is&  shoddily made and emits&  smoke constantly!/%",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_136": "* Mmmm^1, Beauty Creams^1!&* I love that stuff^1, nya!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_137": "* Of course^1, I can't taste&  anything yet^1, but.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_138": "* The feeling of my&  teeth grinding it up is&  great!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_139": "* But don't let the MTT&  branding fool you^1.&* Oh^1, don't^1! Don't^1! DON'T!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_140": "* When I went to the MTT&  burger place^1, ONCE AGAIN^1,&  the FREAK working there.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_141": "* Just STARED at me when I&  asked him to make ICE&  CREAM out of it for me!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_142": "* Like^1, HELLO^1, is your head&  screwed on right^1?&* NO?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_143": "* And I'M BAD for TRYING&  to HELP him re-screw&  his head on!^1? WHAT?/%",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_144": "* Wouldn't Undyne look&  GREAT in a baseball&  cap^1, mew?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_145": "* Her hair'd go PERFECTLY&  through the hole in&  the back!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_146": "* Wait^1.&* Wait^1!&* WAIT!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_147": "* That's a BACKWARDS cap^1!&* No^1, that wouldn't work^1!&* If she wore it backwards.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_148": "* You'd have to cut a hole&  above the bill for her&  hair to come out of!/%",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_149": "* That ticket^1? N-no^1, I haven't&  seen it before!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_150": "* What^1? No^1, I don't know&  if it's originally&  Blooky's^1! No idea!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_151": "* Just^1, don't you think it's&  a bad influence on Blooky if&  they watch that weird robot!?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_152": "* He's just so..^1.&* Inappropriately..^1.&* Corporeal!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_153": "* What!^1? I-it's not my fault&  if I can't face them since I&  left to try to find a body.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_154": "* E-even if it means^1, not&  letting them find out^1,&  I've been their neighbor.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_155": "* Look^1! It's just something&  you can't understand^1, mew!/%",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_156": "* Shucks^1, is that a CAMERA!^1?&* Like^1, want to take a&  selfie with me^1, mew?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_157": "* TOO BAD!^1! You gotta PAY for&  photos of me^1! I'm trying&  to build up my BRAND!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_158": "* How else will I afford PINK&  DRESSES for all of my&  BULLETS?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_159": "* Post your OWN selfie^1! I'll&  LIKE and SHARE it^1! Haha^1!&* Serves you right!/%",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_160": "* That white box^1? Pretty sure&  this body interfaces&  with it somehow!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_161": "* There's some Mew Mew game&  on there^1, where if you&  press the controller.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_162": "* It makes my body's voice&  box speak in response&  to what's onscreen!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_163": "* Alphys was using it trying&  to find this body right&  when I^1, er^1, took it over!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_164": "* I could hear her footsteps&  approaching as she kept&  tapping the X button.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_165": "* I crouched in the corner^1,&  trying to cover my mouth&  and voicebox^1, but.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_166": "* My body kept yelling&  'Right here^1! I'm right&  here, mew!'/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_167": "* Finally^1, when she was&  just about to turn the&  corner and see me.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_168": "* I stood up and shouted&  with my own voice./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_169": "\\W* '\\RI'M RIGHT HERE^1, MEW!\\W'/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_170": "* She fainted./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_171": "* And that's my story^1, mew!/%",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_172": "* Energy drinks^1? What^1?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_173": "* The only kind of energy&  drink I need is&  ELECTRICITY!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_174": "* Because if I don't charge&  my voicebox.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_175": "* Demonic^1, low-pitched voice&  clips emanate from inside&  of me!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_176": "* 'Feeeeeeed meee, mewwwww!'/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_177": "* Even SO^1, Burger Freak&  REFUSES to make me a&  battery smoothie.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_178": "* Open me up^1, and pour&  it inside!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_179": "* What is WRONG with him^1?&* Don't make me go to&  Alphys^1, mew!/%",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_180": "* Shucks^1, look at all that&  dog fuzz^1, mew^1!&* Looks kind of like.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_181": "* BULLETS!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_182": "* Remember when I fired all&  of those cotton balls at&  you^1, mew?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_183": "* Then fired all of my own&  bullets?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_184": "* So nostalgic^1! When are we&  gonna do that AGAIN!?/%",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_185": "* Uwa^1, there's gotta be more&  than 500 particles flying&  around right nyaow!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_186": "* Ahh^1, reminds me of back when&  I'd get cut and my cotton&  would fly out everywhere.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_187": "* Undyne^1! I'm still jointed and&  easy to put back together^1!&* You don't have to hold back!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_188": "* ... I want to say to her^1,&  but.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_189": "* ... if I fuse with this body^1,&  I might really get hurt if&  she uses it for training.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_190": "* Fine^1! FINE^1! FINE!!^1!&* This body's for ME^1, not&  for HER!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_191": "*  Still^1, the idea I might get&  really hurt if she stabbed&  me... it makes me feel.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_192": "* 'Follow your heart, mew!'/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_193": "* Agggh^1!&* Not NOW^1, independently&  installed voicebox!!/%",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_194": "* Wow^1, 500 particles^1, mew!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_195": "* That slot machine's so HD..^1.&* It's almost looking^1, uh..^1.&* 401K...?/%",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_196": "* I feel like..^1. everything is&  about to make a really&  big change./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_197": "* If I fuse with this body^1,&  the flowery^1, cotton-filled&  life I had will end^1, and.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_198": "* A new life^1,&  as an anime catgirl^1,&  will begin./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_199": "* A corporeal life..^1.&* One with..^1. all sorts of..^1.&* Maintenance./",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_200": "* If I break something^1, or&  get hurt^1, I might have&  to ask Alphys to help me.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_201": "* It's a bit scary..^1. but I&  love this body^1, so there's&  no way I'm going back!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_202": "* .../",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_203": "* Ahhh^1!&* I almost forgot^1, mew!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_204": "* You reached 1000 particles^1,&  so you've earned.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_205": "* The 1000 Particle&  Subscriber Special!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_206": "\\W* That's right^1, mew^1!&* It's a \\Rspecial gift\\W just&  for you.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_207": "* So don't tell anyone^1, OK?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_208": "* Lean in close.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_209": "* Close your eyes.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_210": "* And listen to me sing my&  super secret song^1!&* Ahem!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_211": "* ooo ooo ooo^2o&* ooo ooo ooo^2o&* oo oo oo^1o oo ooo/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_212": "* oo oo oo oo oo oo oo oo&* oo oo oo oo ooo/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_213": "* ooo/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_214": "* .../",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_215": "* Aha..^1. haha!&* WELL!^1? How was that!^1?&* Is your feeble mind BLOWN?!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_216": "* (I can feel myself blushing!^1)&* I'm never singing that&  again^1, so enjoy^1, mew!/%",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_217": "* Wow^1, 1000 particles!&* Nice!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_218": "* But heck if I'm singing&  that song!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_219": "* You wanna hear it again^1,&  try buying another&  GamerBOX!/%",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_220": "* Welcome to Dog Casino^1, mew~!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_221": "* How can I assist you^1?&* My name's.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_222": "* Wait^1.&* A^1!&* SECOND!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_223": "* You^1. You^1! YOU!!^1!&* You FEEBLE^1, ACCURSED human!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_224": "* Shucks^1, you came to support me&  at my first gig with my&  new look^1, mew?/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_225": "* Hahaha..^1.&* AHAHAHAHAHA!!^1!&* That means.../",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_226": "* A LOT TO ME!!!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_227": "* Okay, mew^1! In return^1, I'll&  tell you my thoughts on&  any prizes you win!/",
  "SCR_TEXT_xbox_228": "* Just check them and talk to&  me^1, mew!/%",
  "xbox_controller_connect_0": "No Controller Connected",
  "xbox_controller_connect_1": "Please connect a controller.",
  "xbox_controller_connect_2": "That seems to be your thing.",
  "xbox_controller_connect_3": "No Controlly Cannoli",
  "xbox_controller_connect_4": "No Controlly is Cannoli",
  "xbox_controller_connect_5": "No head is connected.\nNo body is connected.\nNo arms are connected.\nNo legs are connected.\nNo skin is connected.\nNo ears are connected.\nNo face is connected\nNo mouth is connected.\nNo heart is connected.\nNo teeth are connected.\nNo heart is connected.",
  "xbox_controller_connect_6": "You were excited about dating\na very handsome skeleton and\npulled the controller out by\naccident. I understand."
}{
  "SCR_TEXT_100": "＊ \\[I]を　じめんに&　 おいて　「おつかれさま」と&　 なでてあげた。",
  "SCR_TEXT_1000": "ニャッハッ&ハッ^1！&かくごは&いいか…！/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_1006": "………/",
  "SCR_TEXT_1007": "じゃあ&わかった^1、&こうしよう/",
  "SCR_TEXT_1008": "とりあえず&…/",
  "SCR_TEXT_1009": "このパズル&は^1…&きさまが&ひとりで、&かってに&やれ/",
  "SCR_TEXT_1010": "ここに、&せつめい&しょを&おいておく&から…/",
  "SCR_TEXT_1011": "じぶんで&よんで！/",
  "SCR_TEXT_1012": "そんで、&ルールが、&わかった&ら…/",
  "SCR_TEXT_1013": "じぶんで&スイッチを&いれて！/",
  "SCR_TEXT_1014": "じぶんの&ペースで&いいから！/",
  "SCR_TEXT_1015": "じゃ、&がんばって/",
  "SCR_TEXT_1016": "ニャッ^1…&ハッ^1…&ハ！/%%",
  "SCR_TEXT_102": "＊ \\[I]を　ゴミのように&　 なげすてた。",
  "SCR_TEXT_1024": "＊ (ベンチのしたに　キッシュが&　 すてられている)/",
